<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2CH" style="id" />
  <para style="h">2 Ɩya-ɩya</para>
  <para style="toc1">2 Ɩya-ɩya yaade Yɩɩ Gɩkpa-nyɔɔfɛ</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Ɩya-ɩya Yaade</para>
  <para style="toc3">2 Ɩya</para>
  <para style="mt1">Ɩya-ɩya yaade yɩɩ gɩkpa-nyɔɔfɛ</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2CH 1" />
  <para style="s1">Egyu Solomon e tiri onyun ɛ fɔ gɛsɛyɩ</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="1KI 3:1-15">1 Begyu-dɩrɛ 3:1-15</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 1:1" />Dafidi wobi Solomon e sere ɩkpaa wo bugyu baanɩ gepepe, yema Yahwe, wo Wurubwarɛ fɔ ɛ̀ fɩya ma ɛwɔ, gɛ ɛ yɛ wɔ e di diyere gepepe.<verse eid="2CH 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 1:2" />Gɛ Solomon ɛ tabʋrʋ ɛ tɛ Isareli bete powu. Ɛ tabʋrʋ ɛ tɛ bɩtà bʋʋ bɛndɩrɛ gɛtɛ bɛɛ nya bɛnɩ nkpɩn ton-ton, ma akpilin ton-ton boo koro, ma gɔdɔ gɩɩ bɛdɔ̀lɛ ma begyegeyelɛ gɛtɛ bɛ̀ sa Isareli powu, ma akpaara<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Akpara nyayɩ na be bilingi Isareli bete boo-ifoli fwo ɩnyɔɔ fɔ</char></note> yɩɩ bɛndɩrɛ. <verse eid="2CH 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 1:3" />Gɛ Solomon ma bɛnɩ fɔ powu bɛ san Gibeyon dɩsʋmakʋn, yema dʋkɔ gɛ Wurubwarɛ Dɩyan-kwo gɛtɛ Yahwe wɔsaranyan Mose e sere otonkuma waanɩ fɔ dɩ̀ sa. <verse eid="2CH 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 1:4" />Gɛ Dafidi ɛ ka Wurubwarɛ Dikola dɩɩ dɩdaka fɔ e ye Kiriyati-Yarim ɛ bɛ sɩ̀ ɔkʋn gɛtɛ ɛ pɩna ɛ sɩ̀ ɛ tɛ dɩ fɔ. <verse eid="2CH 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 1:5" />Mɔ gɩwɔrɔnyan-sɩya gii gedi gɩɩ gɛtɛ̀kʋn gɛtɛ Huri wɔnana Besale, gɛtɛ wote n di Uri fɔ ɛ mɛ fɔ gì sere Yahwe Dɩyan dii Dikwo fɔ dɩɩ bʋnʋn Gibeyon ditele daanɩ. Gɛ egyu Solomon ma bɛnɩ fɔ powu bɛ sʋma Yahwe dʋkɔ. <verse eid="2CH 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 1:6" />Gɛ Solomon ɛ san gɩwɔwɔnyan-sɩya gii gedi gɩɩ gɛtɛkʋn gɛtɛ gì sere Yahwe Dɩyan dii Dikwo fɔ dɩɩ bʋnʋn fɔ gɩɩpɩ, gɛ ɛ ka bɛnan nkpɩn ton (1,000) ɛ tɛ gekuma gii gedi gii koro.<verse eid="2CH 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 1:7" />Gɛ Wurubwarɛ e tiri wo koro e wùlà Solomon odente wʋtɔkɔ, gɛ ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Lila gɩnyan-kamasɛ gɛtɛ à len nan mɛ n tɛ wɔ̀.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2CH 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 1:8" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Solomon ɛ dɔ̀ Wurubwarɛ alan, &lt;&lt;A tiri aa gelen-dɩrɛ a wùlà miinte Dafidi, gɛ a sɩ̀ mɩ bugyu a sere wɔ gɩsɩrɩ. <verse eid="2CH 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 1:9" />Nkele, Yahwe miin Wurubwarɛ, yɛ ade gɛtɛ a dɔ̀ a sɩ̀ miinte Dafidi fɔ yàà ba waanɩ. Yema a sɩ̀ mɩ bugyu a tɛ bɛnɩ dɩtɩnpan gɛtɛ bɛn talɩ bɛ kalan bɛ. <verse eid="2CH 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 1:10" />Okoro tɛ mɩ gɛsɛyɩ ma ade yɩɩ gɛnyɩnla gɛtɛ nan ka n di bugyu n tɛ bɛnɩ dɩtɩnpan nyabɛ. Nka gɛlɛ fɔ, ɛnyan nan talɩ ɛ nya aa bɛnɩ dɩtɩnpan nyadɩ dii koro?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2CH 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 1:11" />Gɛ Wurubwarɛ ɛ dɔ̀ Solomon alan, &lt;&lt;Gɛtɛ ade nyayɩ gɛ a lila, gɛ an lila koro gaanyan, abɛɛ kɔba, abɛɛ gebù, abɛɛ aa bɛkyʋnlɛ boo diku, gɛ gɛtɛ an lila nkpa ma ɔfɔ, mɔ a lila gɛ gɛsɛyɩ, ma ade yɩɩ gɛnyɩnla anlɛ gɛtɛ aà ka a gyegeye mɩɩn bɛnɩ gɛtɛ na sɩ̀ wɔ̀ bugyu na tɛ bɛ fɔ okoro, <verse eid="2CH 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 1:12" />nan tɛ wɔ̀ gɛsɛyɩ, ma ade yɩɩ gɛnyɩnla. Gɛ nan biri ntɛ wɔ̀ koro gaanyan, ma gɩkyɩnyɩn ma gebù gɛtɛ begyu-dɩrɛ gɛtɛ be gyegeye wɔ̀ bɛ sara fɔ ben wura, gɛ ɛbɛ gɛtɛ baà bɛ ba aa gama fɔ bɛn nan wura bɛ nya.<verse eid="2CH 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 1:13" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Solomon e ye dɩsʋmakʋn gɛtɛ dɩ̀ sa Dɩyan dii Dikwo dɩɩ bʋnʋn, Gibeyon ditele daanɩ fɔ, gɛ e biri ɛ da Yerusalem. Gɛ ɛ ma di bugyu ɛ tɛ Isareli.<verse eid="2CH 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 1:14" />Solomon ɛ kʋla tiiramisan ɛbɛ, ma abengyi, ma yɩɩ bɛsaralɛ, gɛ e wura tiiramisan ɛbɛ nkpɩn kwarankɩ (1,400), ma abengyi ɩgbaa kooron (12,000), gɛtɛ ɛ ka ɛ ma sɩ̀ tiiramisan ɛbɛ baatele yaanɩ ma ɛwɔ egyu-dɩrɛ gbagba wakʋn Yerusalem. <verse eid="2CH 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 1:15" />Egyu-dɩrɛ fɔ ɛ yɛ sɩka-fututu ma sɩka-sɩya e gbintin Yerusalem anlɛ ataa tun-tun, gɛ seda wo-iyon i gbigi anlɛ gɛtɛ sikamo wo-iyon ɩ yɔn odon wʋʋ gatɩn fɔ. <verse eid="2CH 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 1:16" />Bɛ ka gɛ Solomon wabengyi fɔ be ye gɛ Egyipiti, ma Kuwe ntʋnkwaa baanɩ. Wɔ gɩyɛ gii bedilɛ fɔ be se yɩ be ye gɛ Kuwe. <verse eid="2CH 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 1:17" />Be se tiiramisan-kɩlɩn sɩka-fututu abi nkpɩn bisiyee (600), gɛ be se dibengyi-kɩlɩn mɔ sɩka-fututu abi akpilin kwarankɩ ma fwo (150) be ye Egyipiti. Gɛ ɛbɛ mɔ be fu yɩ bɛ tɛ Hiti bete ma Aram bete boo begyu powu.<verse eid="2CH 1:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2CH 2" />
  <para style="s1">Solomon ɛɛ pɩna koro èè sere Wurubwarɛ Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="1KI 5:1-18">1 Begyu-dɩrɛ 5:1-18</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 2:1" />Solomon ɛ dɔ̀ alɛ eè sere Dikwo-dɩrɛ bàà tɩ̀ sʋma Yahwe daanɩ, ma ɛwɔ gbagba wo digyu-kpaara. <verse eid="2CH 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 2:2" />Solomon e tiri atola yii betolalɛ asepekyi asiyee ma ɩgbaa ton (70,000), ma ataa yɩɩ bɛkpalɩlɛ asepekyi anaa (80,000) idon yaanɩ, ma bɛndɩrɛ gɛtɛ bɛɛ nya gʋtʋn gii koro gbaa ma nkpɩn kooron ma akpilin ton (3,300) gɛtɛ bɛɛ nya gʋtʋn fɔ gii koro. <verse eid="2CH 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 2:3" />Gɛ Egyu-dirɛ Solomon ɛ sa Tire wogyu Hiram ɔtʋn alan,&lt;&lt;Tɩyɛma mɩ Seda wo-iyon anlɛ gɛtɛ a tɩ̀ mɛ a tɛ miinte Dafidi, ɔkʋna gɛtɛ e sere wo digyu-kpaara fɔ. <verse eid="2CH 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 2:4" />Nte len nan sere Wurubwarɛ Dikwo-dɩrɛ gɛtɛ bàà tɩ̀ sʋma Yahwe, miin Wurubwarɛ daanɩ. Fɔ dàà mɛ ɔkʋn-fɩrɩnfɩrɩnkʋn gɛtɛ nmɩ ma mɩɩn bɛnɩ taà tɩ̀ kuma olifwi Yahwe bʋnʋn, ma ɔkʋn gɛtɛ baà tɩ̀ ka boroboro gɛtɛ bɛ ka bɛ tɛ Wurubwarɛ gedi fɔ bɛ sɩ̀ ɔya-kamasɛ, ma ɔkʋn gɛtɛ baà tɩ̀ tɛ gekuma gii gedi gagyɩgyan ma ɔgyɔlɔ ma Awi-tunalɛ ma Bebon-Fon bɔɔ-ɩsɛ yii gedi ma Awi-dilɛ ɔsɛ-kurumakyɛɛ tɛ Yahwe, tii Wurubwarɛ fɔ. Ɛ dɔ̀ ɛtɩ Isareli bete gɛtɛ tàà di ade nyayɩ yii koro gakpaakpa.<verse eid="2CH 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 2:5" />Wurubwarɛ Dikwo gɛtɛ nan sere fɔ daà mɛ Dikwo-dɩrɛ, yema tii Wurubwarɛ è di ɛgbaa da ekpen-kamasɛ. <verse eid="2CH 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 2:6" />Mɔ ɛnyan nan talɩ e sere Dikwo-dɩrɛ ɛ tɛ Yahwe, gɛtɛ gatala, ma gatala gɩɩ gatala gba ɩn sɔ tɛ wɔ̀ lɛ? Ɛnyan gɛ ǹ di gɛtɛ nan sere dikwo n tɛ wɔ, sɩyɛɛ gekuma gii gedi gɩɩ gɛtɛ̀kʋn giiko. <verse eid="2CH 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 2:7" />Okoro tɩyɛma mɩ eteni ɛkɩ gɛtɛ ɛ̀ nyɩ sɩka-sɩya ma sɩka-fututu, ma gɩwɔrɔnyan sɩya ma gɩwɔrɔnyan yɩɩ gʋtʋn gɩɩ gɛmɛ, gɛ è biri ɛ̀ nyɩ̀ ɔkpɩ wuu butu wʋʋ-ɩyangʋ, ma ɔyangʋ-sɩya-yuu ma nkeni butu bʋʋ-ɩyangʋ, gɛ ɛ kʋkwa ma anyan yɩɩ gɛta fɔ ɛ̀ɛ̀ bɛ mɛ gʋtʋn ma maadawʋ yii bete gɛtɛ miinte Dafidi e tiri ɛ sɩ̀ Yuda ma Yerusalem fɔ.<verse eid="2CH 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 2:8" />Nkele mɔ, ka seda wo-iyon, ma sipiresi wo-iyon ma alimugi wo-iyon ye Lebano tɩyɛma mɩ. Yema ǹ nyɩ̀ gɛtɛ aa bɛnɩ bɛ̀ nyɩ̀ iyon yii gekebi. Mɩɩn bɛsaranyan baà bɛ kpà bɛ, <verse eid="2CH 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 2:9" />fɔ bàà talɩ kebi iyon fɔ yàà sɔ, yema Dikwo-dɩrɛ gɛtɛ nan sere fɔ daà sɔ, gɛ daà mɛ ɔmɩrɩ. <verse eid="2CH 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 2:10" />Nan le aa bɛsaranyan gɛtɛ baà kebi iyon fɔ amɔrɔ bɛbagɩ disepekyi, ma anaabi, bɛbagɩ disepekyi, ma wayɩn bʋkan bɛgalɔn disepekyi, ma olife bʋnɔ bɛgalɔn disepekyi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2CH 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 2:11" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Tire wogyu Hiram ɛ ŋwara gɩkpa e tiri wuunyun ɛ tɛ Solomon alan,</para>
  <para style="pm" vid="2CH 2:11">&lt;&lt;Gɛtɛ Yahwe ee len wɔ bɛnɩ baade okoro, ɛ sɩ̀ wɔ̀ bugyu ɛ tɛ bɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2CH 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 2:12" />Gɛ Hiram e biri ɛ ŋwara ɛ fɩya alan,</para>
  <para style="pm" vid="2CH 2:12">&lt;&lt;Ɩ yɛ taà sila Yahwe, Isareli wo Wurubwarɛ gɛtɛ ɛ mɛ gatala ma gɛtʋnkwaa fɔ. Ɛ tɛ egyu Dafidi ebi-teni ɛkɩ gɛtɛ ɛ sɛyɩ, gɛ ɛ̀ nyɩ̀ ade, gɛ ee we ade yaanɩ ɛ nyɩnla. Ɛwɔ nan sere Dikwo-dɩrɛ ɛ tɛ Yahwe, ma ɛwɔ gbagba wo digyu-kpaara fɔ.<verse eid="2CH 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 2:13" />Ǹ tɛ sa Huram-Abi ɛ̀ɛ̀ ba aakʋn. È di adawʋ yɩɩsalɛ-dɩrɛ. <verse eid="2CH 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 2:14" />Wɔna e ye Dan wofoli waanɩ, gɛ wote e ye Tire. Be wùlà wɔ sɩka-sɩya ma sɩka-fututu, ma gɩwɔrɔnyan-sɩya, ma gɩwɔrɔnyan, ma ataa ma iyon yɩɩ gʋtʋn gɩɩ gɛmɛ, gɛ ɛ̀ nyɩ̀ ɔyangʋ-sɩya ma nkeni butu bʋʋ-ɩyangʋ, ma ɔyangʋ-sɩya-yuu, ma ɔyangʋ ɔkpɩ wuu butu, ma akɛlɛlɛ-kpara yɩɩ gɛka mɛ gʋtʋn. Ɛ̀ nyɩ̀ gɛsalɩ gaadawʋ gɩɩ gʋtʋn gepepe, gɛ dɩdawʋ-kamasɛ gɩɩ gʋtʋn gɛtɛ bè len ɛ̀ɛ̀ mɛ fɔ, ɛ̀ talɩ ɛ mɛ. Ɛɛ̀ bɛ mɛ gʋtʋn ma aa bɛnɩ gɛtɛ bɛ̀ nyɩ̀ adawʋ yɩɩ gʋtʋn fɔ, ma miinfonte Dafidi, aate wadawʋ yɩɩ gʋtʋn gɩɩ bɛmɛlɛ fɔ.<verse eid="2CH 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 2:15" />Okoro miinfonte, yɛ afɩnaa, ma amɔrɔ, ma olife bʋnɔ, ma wayɩn bʋkan gɛtɛ a dɔ̀ a sɩ̀ alɛ aà tɛ tɩ fɔ yàà kya tɩ gʋlɔ. <verse eid="2CH 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 2:16" />Fɔ taà kebi seda wo-iyon powu gɛtɛ aa len fɔ ti ye Lebano, fɔ tàà ban ɛyɩ powu tɩ gyaga abatalɩ yii koro tɩ tɩyɛma ma ɛpʋ bàà ka bɛ mɔma wɔ̀ Yopa, fɔ aà talɩ a to yɩ a san Yerusalem.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2CH 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bɛ kya Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ dii gesere</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="1KI 6:1-38">1 Begyu-dɩrɛ 6:1-38</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 2:17" />Solomon ɛ yɛ bɛ kalan besela powu gɛtɛ bɛ̀ sa Isareli gɛtʋnkwaa gii koro anlɛ gɛtɛ wote Dafidi ɛ tɩ̀ mɛ fɔ. Besela fɔ powu bɛ ba asepekyi kwarankɩ ma ɩgbaa kooron ma nkpɩn nɩyɛ (153,600). <verse eid="2CH 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 2:18" />Solomon e tiri baanɩ bɛnɩ asepekyi asiyee ma ɩgbaa-ton (70,000) gɛtɛ bàà mɛ anyan yii betolalɛ, gɛ e tiri bɛnɩ asepekyi anaa (80,000) gɛtɛ bàà mɛ ataa yɩɩ bɛkpalɩlɛ idon yii koro, gɛ bɛndɩrɛ gɛtɛ bɛɛ nya gʋtʋn fɔ gii koro mɔ bɛ̀ ba gbaa ma nkpɩn nɩyɛ (3,600).<verse eid="2CH 2:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2CH 3" />
  <para style="s1">Solomon e sere Wurubwarɛ Dikwo-dɩrɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 3:1" />Solomon ɛ kya Yahwe Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ dii gesere Moriya wodon gɛtɛ wʋ̀ sa Yerusalem fɔ wuu koro, ɔkʋn gɛtɛ Yahwe e tiri koro e wùlà wote Dafidi fɔ. Be sere dɩ Yebusi-te Aruna wamɔrɔ yii getibakʋn gɛtɛ Dafidi e wùlà ɛ sɩ̀ fɔ. <verse eid="2CH 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 3:2" />Ɛ kya dii gesere ye wo bugyu buu gedi bʋʋ gɩkyan-naafɛ, giibon-nyɔɔfɛ, wo duwi-nyɔɔfɛ daanɩ. <verse eid="2CH 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 3:3" />Dikwo-dɩrɛ gɛtɛ Egyu-dɩrɛ Solomon ee sere fɔ daabo ɩ̀ ba bɩsɩrɩ akpilin anaa ma fwo (90), gɛ daayɛrɛ ɩ̀ ba bɩsɩrɩ dikpilin ma fwo (30). <verse eid="2CH 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 3:4" />Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ dɩɩ kpata wayɛrɛ ɩ̀ ba bɩsɩrɩ dikpilin ma fwo (30), gɛtɛ wù di Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ daayɛrɛ, gɛ daatɔ ɩ̀ ba bɩsɩrɩ akpilin yɛkɩ (180). Bɛ ka sɩka-sɩya-kpara bɛ bɔlɩ dikwo fɔ dɩɩ gamɩ. <verse eid="2CH 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 3:5" />Solomon ɛ yɛ bɛ ka seda wo-iyon be sere bɛ marama ɔpɔrɩ fɔ, gɛ bɛ ka sɩka-sɩya bɛ bɔlɩ yɩ, gɛ bɛ ta iben-yon ma agbarɩgbarɩ bɛ sa dɩ ɔmɩrɩ. <verse eid="2CH 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 3:6" />Ɛ ka gɛ ataa ma ɔyɛkɛma ma sɩka-sɩya gɛtɛ ɛ tɩyɛma e ye Parifayim fɔ ɛ pɩna Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ. <verse eid="2CH 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 3:7" />Ɛ ka sɩka-sɩya ɛ bɔlɩ Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ dɩɩ gɛwalɩkʋn fɔ gɩɩ-ɩtaa-walɩlɛ fɔ, ma itunu-yon, ma ɩpɔrɩ, ma itunu fɔ, gɛ ɛ mɛ kerubi ɛbɛ ɛ gyaga ɩpɔrɩ fɔ yii koro.<verse eid="2CH 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 3:8" />Gɛ e sere Dikwo-dɩrɛ dɩɩkʋn-dɩrɛkʋn gɛtɛ waabo ma waayɛrɛ ì we kyɛkyɛ, anlɛ gɛtɛ Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ daayɛrɛ ì we fɔ. Daabo ɩ̀ ba bɩsɩrɩ dikpilin ma fwo (30), gɛ daayɛrɛ ɩ̀ ba bɩsɩrɩ dikpilin ma fwo (30). Ɛ ka sɩka-sɩya-kpara gɛtɛ wʋʋdʋrʋ wʋ̀ ba bekilo disepekyi ma gbaa ma nkpɩn ton (2,300) ɛ bɔlɩ Dikwo-dɩrɛ dɩɩkʋn-dɩrɛkʋn fɔ. <verse eid="2CH 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 3:9" />Sɩka-sɩya gɛtɛ ɛ ka ɛ mɛ aŋanbi fɔ wɔdʋrʋ wʋ̀ ba kilo-fan, gɛ ɛ ka sɩka-sɩya ɛ bɔlɩ gatala gaakwo fɔ yɩɩ-ɩpɔrɩ fɔ mɔ.<verse eid="2CH 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 3:10" />Solomon ɛ mɛ kerubi ɛbɛ bɛnyɔɔ, gɛ ɛ ka sɩka-sɩya ɛ bɔlɩ bɛ, gɛ ɛ ka bɛ ɛ sɩ̀ Ɔkʋn-dɩrɛ Wʋʋkʋn-dɩrɛkʋn fɔ. <verse eid="2CH 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 3:11" />kerubi ɛbɛ bɛnyɔɔ fɔ baabanban yaabo ɩ̀ ba bɩsɩrɩ dikpilin ma fwo (30). Kerubi ɛkɩ dɩbanban-kɩlɩn daabo ɩ̀ ba bɩsɩrɩ kwarankɩ ma ɔfan (7.5), gɛ dɩɩ kya ɔpɔrɩ fɔ. Wɔ dɩbanban-do fɔ mɔ daabo ɩ̀ ba bɩsɩrɩ kwarankɩ ma ɔfan, gɛ dɩɩ kya kerubi-do fɔ woyo. <verse eid="2CH 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 3:12" />Gɛlɛ ke gɛ Kerubi-nyɔɔfɛ fɔ dɩbanban-kɩlɩn daabo ɩ̀ ba bɩsɩrɩ kwarankɩ ma ɔfan (7.5), gɛ dɩɩ kya ɔpɔrɩ fɔ. Gɛ wɔ dɩbanban-do fɔ mɔ daabo dɩ̀ ba bɩsɩrɩ kwarankɩ ma ɔfan, gɛ dɩɩ kya kerubi gyangbasɛlɛ fɔ woyo. <verse eid="2CH 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 3:13" />Kerubi ɛbɛ bɛnyɔɔ nyabɛ baa banban yaabo ɩ̀ ba bɩsɩrɩ dikpilin ma fwo (30). Bè yela bɔɔ bɩsɩrɩ buu koro, gɛ be fi bɔɔ bʋnʋn be ten gamɩ gii dikwo fɔ. <verse eid="2CH 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 3:14" />Gɛ ɛ yɛ bɛ ka bɛnan baanu nkeni butu, ma ɩsɩsɩya, ma ɔkpɩ wuu butu, ma ifututu-kpara bɛ lɔ dɩyan-sʋlɛ otunu tɛ Dɩyan dii Dikwo fɔ, gɛ bɛ lɔ kerubi ɛbɛ bɛ gyaga dii koro. <verse eid="2CH 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 3:15" />Be sere bepila bɛnyɔɔ Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ dɩɩ bʋnʋn, gɛtɛ wʋkamasɛ waabo wʋ̀ ba bɩsɩrɩ akpilin anyɔɔ ma fwo bʋnyɔɔ. Gɛ ayu gɛtɛ ɩ̀ gyaga bepila fɔ baayu yii koro fɔ dɩkamasɛ daatɔ ɩ̀ ba bɩsɩrɩ kwarankɩ ma ɔfan (7.5). <verse eid="2CH 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 3:16" />Gɛ ɛ lɔ imini ɩkɩ anlɛ agbarɩgbarɩ ɛ gyaga bepila fɔ baayu yii koro. Gɛ e biri ɛ mɛ pomegraniti wabi akpilin ton (100) ɛ sa ma agbarɩgbarɩ fɔ. <verse eid="2CH 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 3:17" />E sere bepila fɔ Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ dɩɩ bʋnʋn, wʋkɩ wù sere gatɩn gɩɩ gɩlan, gɛ wʋkɩ mɔ wù sere gatala gɩɩ gɩlan. Gɛ ɛ sa ɛwʋ gɛtɛ wʋ̀ sa gatɩn gɩɩ gɩlan fɔ diyere alɛ Yakin<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yakin gɛtɛ wuu wùlà alɛ &lt;&lt;E sere.&gt;&gt;</char></note>, gɛ ɛ sa ɛwʋ gɛtɛ wʋ̀ sa gatala gɩɩ gɩlan fɔ diyere alɛ Bowasi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bowasi gɛtɛ wuu wùlà alɛ &lt;&lt;Ɔkɛma&gt;&gt;</char></note>.<verse eid="2CH 3:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="2CH 4" />
  <para style="s1">Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ daanyɩmɩnyan</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="1KI 7:23-51">1 Begyu-dɩrɛ 7:23-51</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 4:1" />Egyu-dɩrɛ Solomon ɛ yɛ bɛ ka gɩwɔrɔnyan-sɩya bɛ mɛ gedi gɩɩ gɛtɛ̀kʋn. Gaabo ɩ̀ ba bɩsɩrɩ dikpilin ma fwo, gaayɛrɛ ɩ̀ ba bɩsɩrɩ dikpilin ma fwo, gɛ gaatɔ ɩ̀ ba bɩsɩrɩ fwo-ton. <verse eid="2CH 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 4:2" />Gɛ ɛ yɛ bɛ ka gɩwɔrɔnyan-sɩya bɛ wɔrɔ butu buu geto-sakʋn kulu-kulu-dɩrɛ gɛtɛ gaayɛrɛ ɩ̀ ba bɩsɩrɩ kwarankɩ ma ɔfan (7.5), gɛ waatɔ ɩ̀ ba bɩsɩrɩ kwarankɩ ma ɔfan (7.5), gɛ wuu gesilin-tuma gɩ̀ ba bɩsɩrɩ akpilin anyɔɔ ma ton (45). <verse eid="2CH 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 4:3" />Gɛ ɛ gbɛrɛ e tiri anlɛ bɛkwɔ boonundu ɩgba ɩnyɔɔ e silin butu buu geto-sakʋn fɔ giinyun waanɩ. Ɛ gbɛrɛ bɛkwɔ fwo ɛ sa gɩsɩrɩ gɩkɩ ma ɔfan-kamasɛ gaanɩ.<verse eid="2CH 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 4:4" />Gɛ butu buu geto-sakʋn fɔ gɩ̀ gyaga bɛkwɔ-teni fwo-bɛnyɔɔ gɛtɛ bɛ ka gɩwɔrɔnyan-sɩya bɛ mɛ fɔ boo koro. Besiyee bɔɔ bʋnʋn bù ten gatala gɩɩ gɩlan, gɛ besiyee bɔɔ bʋnʋn bù ten ofila wʋʋ gɛnʋ̀nkʋn wʋʋ gɩlan, gɛ besiyee bɔɔ bʋnʋn bù ten gatɩn gɩɩ gɩlan, gɛ besiyee bɔɔ bʋnʋn bù ten ofila wʋʋ gɛtàkʋn wʋʋ gɩlan. Butu buu geto-sakʋn fɔ gɩ̀ gyaga boo koro, gɛ bɔɔ bɩsɩrɩ bʋʋ gɩlan gama fɔ powu ì ten ma bɛwɔlɔn. <verse eid="2CH 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 4:5" />Wuutin wʋ̀ ba gulobi-kɩlɩn gaabo. E mirigiti wuunyun anlɛ kɔpʋ wonyun, abɛɛ anlɛ lili wafwɛ. Gɛ wuu to butu anlɛ bɛgarawa gbaa ɛkɩ (2,000).<verse eid="2CH 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 4:6" />Ɛ mɛ bɛtasa-dɩrɛ fwo gɛtɛ bee tì fere anyan gɛtɛ bɛɛ ka bɛ tɛ gekuma gii gedi fɔ baanɩ. Ɛ ka ton ɛ sɩ̀ gatɩn gɩɩ gɩlan, gɛ ɛ sɩ̀ ton gatala gɩɩ gɩlan. Mɔ butu gɛtɛ bʋ̀ sa butu buu geto-sakʋn-dɩrɛ-kulu-kulu fɔ gaanɩ fɔ bɩrɛ, bù sa tɛ gedi gɩɩ bɛtɛlɛ fɔ bàà fere koro.<verse eid="2CH 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 4:7" />Solomon ɛ mɛ sɩka-sɩya bɛkandɩya bɔɔ gɛgyagakʋn fwo anlɛ gɛtɛ be wùlà wɔ alɛ ɛ mɛ fɔ, gɛ ɛ ka bɛ e sere-sere Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ daanɩ. Bɛ ka ton be sere gatɩn gɩɩ gɩlan, gɛ ton-do mɔ bè sere gatala gɩɩ gɩlan.<verse eid="2CH 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 4:8" />Gɛ bɛ mɛ ɩkpʋlɔ fwo bɛ sɩ̀ Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ daanɩ. Bɛ ka ton bɛ sɩ̀ gatɩn gɩɩ gɩlan, gɛ ton do mɔ ɩ̀ dɔ gatala gɩɩ gɩlan. Gɛ e biri ɛ mɛ sɩka-sɩya bɛtasabi-ŋwanlɛ nkalan akpilin-ton (100).<verse eid="2CH 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 4:9" />Solomon ɛ mɛ gedi gɩɩ bɛtɛlɛ bɔɔ gɛsarakʋn dɩkpaara fɔ daanɩ, gɛ e biri ɛ mɛ dɩdɩrɛ dɩkɩ mɔ, gɛ ɛ ka gɩwɔrɔnyan-sɩya ɛ bɔlɩ ɩpʋnʋ fɔ. <verse eid="2CH 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 4:10" />Ɛ ka butu buu geto-sakʋn-dɩrɛ kulu-kulu fɔ ɛ sɩ̀ gatɩn gɩɩ gɩlan, ofila wʋʋ gɛtàkʋn wʋʋ gɩlan wuulogyi.<verse eid="2CH 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 4:11" />Gɛ e biri ɛ mɛ isun, ma bɛsɔfɩ, ma bɛtasabi-ŋwanlɛ nkalan.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CH 4:11">Okoro Huram e werema gʋtʋn powu gɛtɛ Egyu-dɩrɛ Solomon ɛ tɛ wɔ alɛ ɛ mɛ Yahwe Dikwo-dɩrɛ daanɩ fɔ.<verse eid="2CH 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 4:12" />Anyan gɛtɛ ɛ mɛ fɔ n di bepila bɛnyɔɔ fɔ,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2CH 4:12">ma ayu gɛtɛ ɩ̀ gyaga bepila fɔ yii koro fɔ,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2CH 4:12">ma agbarɩ-gbarɩ gɛtɛ ɩ̀ kyaga ma bɛwɔlɔn, gɛ ɩɩ sa bɛtasa bɛnyɔɔ gɛtɛ bɛ̀ gyaga bepila fɔ boo koro ɔmɩrɩ fɔ,<verse eid="2CH 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 4:13" />ma pomegraniti wabi nkpɩn bʋnyɔɔ (400) gɛtɛ ɩ̀ kyaga ma butu buu geto-sakʋn-dɩrɛ fɔ ma bepila fɔ, gɛ ɩɩ sa tasa fɔ ɔmɩrɩ fɔ,<verse eid="2CH 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 4:14" />ma bɩsɩrɩ fɔ, ma bʋʋ bɛtasa fɔ,<verse eid="2CH 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 4:15" />ma butu buu geto-sakʋn-dɩrɛ fɔ, ma bɛkwɔ-teni fwo-bɛnyɔɔ-maralɛ gɛtɛ bɛ̀ sa wʋʋ gatɩn fɔ,<verse eid="2CH 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 4:16" />ma isun fɔ, ma bɛsɔfɩ fɔ, ma gɩnan gɩɩ bɩnyanɩ-dɩrɛ-dɩrɛ ma alobi fɔ, ma waanyan-kurumakyɛɛ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CH 4:16">Gɩwɔrɔnyan-sɩya-ŋalagɩlɛ gɛ Huram-Abi ɛ ka ɛ mɛ Yahwe Dikwo-dɩrɛ daanyan fɔ powu ɛ tɛ Egyu-dɩrɛ Solomon. <verse eid="2CH 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 4:17" />Egyu-dɩrɛ Solomon ɛ yɛ bɛ ka gɩwɔrɔnyan-sɩya-yalɩlɛ bɛ da bɛ sa atɩn-maralɛ yaanɩ, gɛ wu tiri gɛlɛ gaanyan nyayɩ Yodan wɔtalɩ gɛtɛ wʋ̀ sa Sukoti ma Saretan boo getite fɔ waanɩ. <verse eid="2CH 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 4:18" />Anyamanyan gɛtɛ Solomon ɛ mɛ fɔ ɩ̀ sɔ gʋsɔ, okoro ɛkɩ ɛn talɩ nyɩnla gɩwɔrɔnyan-sɩya fɔ gɩɩdʋrʋ wʋʋkʋna.<verse eid="2CH 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 4:19" />Gɛ Solomon ɛ nɩ̀ mɛ Yahwe Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ daanyan gɛtɛ ɩ̀ sa daanɩ fɔ powu.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2CH 4:19">Ɛyɩ n di sɩka-sɩya gedi gɩɩ gɛtɛ̀kʋn fɔ,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2CH 4:19">ma ɩkpʋlɔ gɛtɛ bɛɛ ka boroboro bɛ gyaga yii koro bɛ tɛ Yahwe gedi fɔ.<verse eid="2CH 4:19" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 4:20" />Ɛ ka sɩka-sɩya-kpara ɛ mɛ bɛkandɩya bɔɔ gɛgyagakʋn ma bɛkandɩya gɛtɛ wàà ŋmangɩ Ɔkʋn-dɩrɛ wʋʋkʋn-dɩrɛkʋn fɔ wʋʋ bʋnʋn anlɛ gɛtɛ be wùlà wɔ fɔ,<verse eid="2CH 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 4:21" />ma afwɛ fɔ, ma bɛkandɩya fɔ, bɛkandɩya fɔ, ma baayenkpen yɩɩ gɛsakʋn fɔ, gɛtɛ bɛ ka sɩka-sɩya bɛ mɛ yɩ fɔ,<verse eid="2CH 4:21" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 4:22" />ma sɩka-sɩya-kpara wo-imini-tiiralɛ kandɩya wayenkpen, ma bɛtasabi-ŋwanlɛ, ma bɩtɩyɛ, ma olifwi wʋʋ bɛtasabi, ma sɩka-sɩya-kpara, ma sɩka-sɩya wɔ-ɩpʋnʋ tɛ Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ, gɛtɛ ɛyɩ n di Ɔkʋn-dɩrɛ wʋʋkʋn-dɩrɛkʋn fɔ wʋʋpʋnʋ, ma Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ dii getumakʋn gɩɩpʋnʋ fɔ.<verse eid="2CH 4:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="2CH 5" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 5:1" />Gɛtɛ egyu-dɩrɛ Solomon e werema gʋtʋn gɛtɛ ɛ mɛ Yahwe Dikwo-dɩrɛ daanɩ fɔ, ɛ ka anyan-tɛlɛ gɛtɛ wote Dafidi e tiri ɛ sɩ̀ ɛ tɛ Yahwe, gɛtɛ ì di sɩka-fututu, ma sɩka-sɩya, ma anyan kurumakyɛɛ fɔ ɛ ba. Gɛ ɛ ka yɩ ɛ sɩ̀ anyan-gbaa-gbaa yɩɩ gɛsɩ̀kʋn, Wurubwarɛ Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ daanɩ.<verse eid="2CH 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bɛ ka Dikola dɩɩ dɩdaka fɔ bɛ ba Wurubwarɛ Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ daanɩ</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="1KI 8:1-9">1 Begyu-dɩrɛ 8:1-9</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 5:2" />Ɛwʋ gɛ egyu-dɩrɛ Solomon e kpèlè Isareli bɛndɩrɛ, ma Isareli wo-ifoli yɩɩ bɛndɩrɛ, ma Isareli wo-itunu yɩɩ bɛndɩrɛ e tuma, gɛtɛ bàà ka Yahwe Dikola dɩɩ dɩdaka fɔ be ye Siyon, ɔkʋn gɛtɛ bee kpèlè alɛ Dafidi Ditele fɔ bɛ ba Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ daanɩ. <verse eid="2CH 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 5:3" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Isareli bɛndɩrɛ powu be be tuma egyu-dɩrɛ Solomon wakʋn ɔsɛ wuu gedi wʋʋya waanɩ gɛtɛ wù di Isareli bete boobon-kwarankɩfɛ waanɩ fɔ. <verse eid="2CH 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 5:4" />Gɛtɛ bɛndɩrɛ fɔ powu be tuma fɔ, Lefi bete be kukuru dɩdaka fɔ, <verse eid="2CH 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 5:5" />gɛ bɛ ka dɩ, fɩya ma dɩyan dii dikwo ma daanyɩmɩnyan fɩrɩnfɩrɩn fɔ powu. Gɛ gedi gɩɩ bɛtɛlɛ gɛtɛ bè di Lefi bete fɔ be tola dɩ bɛ san Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ daanɩ. <verse eid="2CH 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 5:6" />Gɛ Egyu-dɩrɛ Solomon ma Isareli bete gɛtɛ be tuma fɔ powu bɛ ka bɛyɛran ma bɛkwɔ kpekpesi gɛtɛ ɛkɩ ɛn talɩ ɛ kalan fɔ bɛ tɛ gedi Dikola dɩɩ dɩdaka fɔ dɩɩpɩ.<verse eid="2CH 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 5:7" />Ɛwʋ gɛ gedi gɩɩ bɛtɛlɛ fɔ bɛ ka Yahwe Dikola dɩɩ dɩdaka fɔ bɛ bɛ sɩ̀ dɩɩ gɛsɩ̀kʋn, Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ dɩɩ gamɩ, gɛtɛ wù di Ɔkʋn-dɩrɛ wʋʋkʋn-dɩrɛ-kʋn fɔ, kerubi ɛbɛ baabanban yɩɩ gatɩn. <verse eid="2CH 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 5:8" />Kerubi ɛbɛ fɔ bɛ yɛrɛba baabanban be tin ɔkʋn gɛtɛ Dɩdaka fɔ dɩ̀ dɔ fɔ, gɛ wu tin dɩ, ma dii-iyon-tonlɛ-tolalɛ fɔ powu. <verse eid="2CH 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 5:9" />Iyon fɔ ɩ̀ ba abo, gɛtɛ gengyi à yela Ɔkʋn-fɩrɩnfɩrɩnkʋn, gbɛma Ɔkʋn-dɩrɛkʋn fɔ, aà talɩ a we yɩ, mɔ gengyi à sa okòro fɔ, an nan we yɩ. Gɛ ɩ̀ sa dʋkɔbɛ bè ye ma ǹdò. <verse eid="2CH 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 5:10" />Gɩnyankɩ gɩn ma Dɩdaka fɔ daanɩ fɩya ma ataa-pansan-pansan anyɔɔ gɛtɛ Mose ɛ ka ɛ sa daanɩ, Horebi wodon wuu koro, ɔkʋn gɛtɛ Yahwe ɛ tà dikola ma Isareli bete, ɔkʋna gɛtɛ be ye Egyipiti gɛtʋnkwaa gaanɩ wʋʋ gama fɔ.<verse eid="2CH 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 5:11" />Ɛwʋ gɛ gedi gɩɩ bɛtɛlɛ fɔ be ye Ɔkʋn-fɩrɩnfɩrɩnkʋn fɔ. Gedi gɩɩ bɛtɛlɛ gɛtɛ bɛ̀ sa dʋkɔ fɔ powu bɛ kpa koro dɩdɩɩ gɛtɛ wʋn fɛ ma dikpi gɛtɛ daanɩ be ye. <verse eid="2CH 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 5:12" />Lefi bete powu gɛtɛ bè di ɩnʋn yɩɩ bɛnʋmalɛ, gɛtɛ ɛbɛ n di Asafu, Heman, Yedutun ma boo bebi-teni, ma bɔɔ bɛfʋrɩ be yela gedi gɩɩ gɛtɛ̀kʋn giifila wʋʋ gɛtàkʋn wʋʋ gɩlan. Bɛ sa ngba fututu-kpara, gɛ bɛɛ gbɛrɛ akyaka gɛ bɛɛ tà adʋlɛ ɛbɛ, ma adʋlɛ-dɩrɛ ɛbɛ. Gɛ gedi gɩɩ bɛtɛlɛ akpilin kooron (120) gɛtɛ bɛɛ fʋn akantan fɔ bɛ̀ fɩya ma ɛbɛ. <verse eid="2CH 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 5:13" />Akantan yɩɩ bɛfʋ̀nlɛ, ma ɩnʋn yɩɩ bɛnʋmalɛ fɔ powu bɛ ka onyun-kɩlɩn bɛ nʋma ɩnʋn be sila Yahwe bɛ sa wɔ onyun. Bɛ ka akantan ma akyaka, ma anyan-kurumakyɛɛ bɛ fɩya, gɛ bɛ nʋma gesila gɩɩnʋn bɛ tɛ Yahwe alan,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CH 5:13">&lt;&lt;Ɛ̀ kɔlɔ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CH 5:13">Gɛ wo gelen gɩ̀ sa gakpaakpa.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CH 5:13">Ɛwʋ gɛ akpaba ɩ bɛ yɔn Yahwe Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ daanɩ. <verse eid="2CH 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 5:14" />Gɛ dɩkpaba fɔ dii koro, gedi gɩɩ bɛtɛlɛ fɔ bɛn mɩnɩ talɩ mɛ bɔɔ gʋtʋn, yema Yahwe gingyebi gɩ bɛ yɔn Yahwe Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ daanɩ.<verse eid="2CH 5:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="2CH 6" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 6:1" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Solomon e tiri onyun alan, &lt;&lt;Oo Yahwe, a dɔ̀ alɛ aà sara dɩkpaba-kpim daanɩ. <verse eid="2CH 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 6:2" />Na sere Dikwo-kpatakpɩrɩ na tɛ wɔ̀, ɔkʋn gɛtɛ aà sara gakpaakpa fɔ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2CH 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 6:3" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Solomon e fi bʋnʋn e ten Isareli bete powu gɛtɛ bè yela dʋkɔ fɔ, gɛ e hira bɛ. <verse eid="2CH 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 6:4" />Gɛ ɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Ɩ yɛ taà sila Yahwe, Isareli wo Wurubwarɛ, gɛtɛ ɛ ka wɔkɛma ɛ yɛ anyun-gyebi gɛtɛ ɛ dɔ̀ ɛ sɩ̀ ɛ tɛ miinte Dafidi fɔ ɩ ba waanɩ fɔ. Wurubwarɛ ɛ dɔ̀ alan, <verse eid="2CH 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 6:5" />&lt;Ye duwi gɛtɛ na tiri mɩɩn bɛnɩ Isareli bete na ye Egyipiti gɛtʋnkwaa gaanɩ lɛ, miin te tiri ditele dɩkɩ ye Isareli wo-ifoli fɔ yaanɩ gɛtɛ bàà sere Dikwo-dɩrɛ miin diyere dii koro bàà tɩ sʋma mɩ dʋkɔ. Gɛ mɩɩn tiri ɛnɩ ɛkɩ alɛ e di bugyu ɛ tɛ mɩɩn bɛnɩ Isareli bete. <verse eid="2CH 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 6:6" />Mɔ nkele, na tiri Yerusalem gɛtɛ bɛnɩ bàà tɩ̀ sʋma mɩ dʋkɔ, gɛ na tiri Dafidi ɛ̀ɛ̀ mɛ boogyu.&gt; <verse eid="2CH 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 6:7" />&lt;&lt;Miinte Dafidi ɛ ka ɛ sa woturu waanɩ gɛtɛ eè sere Dikwo-dɩrɛ ɛ tɛ Yahwe, Isareli wo Wurubwarɛ, fɔ bàà tɩ̀ sʋma wɔ daanɩ. <verse eid="2CH 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 6:8" />Gɛ Yahwe ɛ dɔ̀ miinte Dafidi alan, &lt;A mɛ ade gɛtɛ wʋ̀ sa aaturu waanɩ alɛ aà sere Dikwo-dɩrɛ bàà tɩ̀ sʋma mɩ daanɩ lɛ. <verse eid="2CH 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 6:9" />Mɔ fɔ nka awɔ nan sere Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ. Aabi gɛtɛ è di gɛ awɔ gbagba aa nkalan nan sere Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ bàà tɩ̀ sʋma mɩ daanɩ.&gt;<verse eid="2CH 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 6:10" />&lt;&lt;Yahwe e di wade-dɔ̀lɛ-sɩ̀lɛ fɔ yii koro. Yema na sere miinte Dafidi gɩsɩrɩ, gɛ ǹ si Isareli gigyu-bɩya gii koro, anlɛ gɛtɛ ɛ bɔ ɛ dɔ̀ ɛ sɩ̀ fɔ, gɛ na sere Dikwo-dɩrɛ gɛtɛ bàà tɩ̀ sʋma Yahwe, Isareli wo Wurubwarɛ fɔ daanɩ fɔ. <verse eid="2CH 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 6:11" />Dʋkɔ gɛ na ka Dɩdaka gɛtɛ Dikola gɛtɛ Yahwe ɛ tà ma wɔ bɛnɩ Isareli bete fɔ ma daanyan gɛtɛ ɩ̀ sa daanɩ fɔ na bɛ sɩ̀.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2CH 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Solomon wonyun-tiri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 6:12" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Solomon ɛ tɔ e yela Yahwe gedi gɩɩ gɛtɛ̀kʋn fɔ gɩɩ bʋnʋn, Isareli dikpi fɔ powu dɩɩ bʋnʋn, gɛ ɛ bʋma walɔ gatala. <verse eid="2CH 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 6:13" />Fɔ ɛ ka gɩwɔrɔnyan-sɩya ɛ mɛ gɛbʋn-yelakʋn gɛtɛ gaabo ɩ̀ ba bɩsɩrɩ kwarankɩ ma ɔfan, gaayɛrɛ ɩ̀ ba bɩsɩrɩ kwarankɩ ma ɔfan, gɛ gaatɔ ɩ̀ ba bɩsɩrɩ bɩnaa ma ɔfan, gɛ ɛ ka gɩ ɛ ma sɩ̀ dɩkpaara fɔ di getite. Ɛ bʋn e yela gɛbʋn-yelakʋn fɔ gii koro, gɛ ɛ waran e kura Isareli bɛnɩ fɔ powu bɔɔ bʋnʋn, gɛ ɛ bʋma walɔ e wùlà gatala. <verse eid="2CH 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 6:14" />Gɛ e tiri onyun ɛ dɔ̀ alan,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CH 6:14">&lt;&lt;Oo Yahwe, Isareli wo Wurubwarɛ, ɛkɩ ɛn ma gatala, abɛɛ gɛtʋnkwaa anlɛ awɔ. Awɔ nte di gelen gii dikola gɛtɛ a tà ma aa bɛsaranyan gɛtɛ bɛɛ ka boo-ituru powu bɛ san aasele waanɩ fɔ dii koro. <verse eid="2CH 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 6:15" />A di aade gɛtɛ a dɔ̀ a sɩ̀ a tɛ miinte Dafidi gɛtɛ è di aasaranyan fɔ yii koro. A ka aanyun a dɔ̀ ade a sɩ̀, gɛ a ka aakɛma a yɛ wʋ ba waanɩ anlɛ gɛtɛ wù we ǹdò lɛ. <verse eid="2CH 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 6:16" />Nkele Yahwe, Isareli wo Wurubwarɛ, di ade gɛtɛ a dɔ̀ a sɩ̀ a tɛ aasaranyan, miinte Dafidi alan, &lt;Wʋn nan ba alɛ, an nan wura ɛnɩ gɛtɛ ɛ̀ɛ̀ sara Isareli gigyu-bɩya fɔ gii koro mɩɩn bʋnʋn, gengyi aa bebi baà bù, mɩ gɛ baà di maade yii koro anlɛ gɛtɛ a mɛ fɔ, wʋn nan ba wʋ nya alɛ an nan wura ɛnɩ gɛtɛ ɛɛ̀ sara gigyu-bɩya fɔ gii koro.&gt; fɔ yii koro. <verse eid="2CH 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 6:17" />Okoro nkele, oo Yahwe, Isareli wo Wurubwarɛ, yɛ aade gɛtɛ a dɔ̀ a sɩ̀ a tɛ aasaranyan miinte Dafidi fɔ, yàà ba waanɩ.<verse eid="2CH 6:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 6:18" />&lt;&lt;Gɛ gbagbaagba fɔ, Wurubwarɛ ɛɛ̀ bɛ sara gɛtʋnkwaa gaanɩ ma bɛnɩ-nyalɛ? Gatala, ma gatala gɩɩ gatala gba ɩn nan nɩma wɔ̀ gɛsara. Lan gɛ waà mɛ gɛ Dikwo gɛtɛ na sere lɛ daà nɩma wɔ̀? <verse eid="2CH 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 6:19" />Mɔ, oo Yahwe, miin Wurubwarɛ, nʋn nmɩ aasaranyan miinyun-tiri, fɔ àà we mɩ gutunkoro. Nʋn gewula ma onyun-tiri gɛtɛ aasaranyan ee tiri aa bʋnʋn ǹdò lɛ. <verse eid="2CH 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 6:20" />Yɛ aa bʋnʋn bàà gyaga Dikwo-dɩrɛ nyadɩ dii koro odon ma ofilibo nfan nyawʋ gɛtɛ a dɔ̀ alan, &lt;Miin diyere daà sara dʋkɔ&gt; lɛ, fɔ àà nʋn onyun-tiri gɛtɛ nmɩ aasaranyan nte tiri nfan fɔ. <verse eid="2CH 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 6:21" />Nʋn nmɩ aasaranyan maade-fɔlɛ, ma aa bɛnɩ Isareli bete booyo gengyi tì fi tɩɩ bʋnʋn tì ten nfan gɛ ti tiri onyun fɔ. Nʋn taakʋn ye gatala aa gɛsarakʋn fɔ. Nʋn taakʋn, fɔ àà ka taade-kpen kyɛ tɩ! <verse eid="2CH 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 6:22" />&lt;&lt;Gɛ gengyi ɛnɩ ɛkɩ ɛ̀ mɛ wɔwɔlɔn ade-kpen, gɛ wù di gɛtɛ ɛ̀ɛ̀ kan ntam, gɛ ɛ̀ ba ɛɛ kan ntam aa gedi gɩɩ gɛtɛ̀kʋn, aa Dikwo-dɩrɛ nyadɩ daanɩ nfan fɔ, <verse eid="2CH 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 6:23" />nʋn ye gatala, fɔ àà mɛ wʋʋ gʋtʋn. Dɔ̀ aa bɛsaranyan fɔ bɔɔ gɔdɔ, fɔ àà tin ɛwɔ gɛtɛ waade ɩn kɔlɔ fɔ dɩpwɛ, fɔ àà ka wade-kpen tola wɔ. Fɔ àà tɛ ɛwɔ gɛtɛ wade ɩ̀ dɔ̀ fɔ aten. <verse eid="2CH 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CH 6:24" />&lt;&lt;Gengyi aa bɛnɩ Isareli bete bɔɔ bɛkyʋnlɛ bè di boo koro bɩtà baanɩ yema bɛ mɛ wɔ̀ ade-kpen, gɛ bè biri bɛ ba aakʋn, be be kpèlè aa diyere be tiri onyun aa Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ daanɩ bɛ̀ fɔ ade-kpen yɩɩ gɛkakyɛ fɔ, <verse eid="2CH 6:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CH 6:25" />nʋn bɔɔ gɛfɔ fɔ ye gatala, fɔ àà ka aa bɛnɩ Isareli bete fɔ baade-kpen kyɛ bɛ, fɔ àà birima bɛ ba gɛtʋnkwaa, gɛtɛ a ka a tɛ bootu ɛbɛ fɔ gaanɩ.<verse eid="2CH 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CH 6:26" />&lt;&lt;Gengyi gatala gɩ̀ tan, gɛ ɛsʋn ɛn taa nɩ̀ nʋ̀n, yema aa bɛnɩ bɛ mɛ ade-kpen aa koro, gɛ gengyi bɛ̀ dama Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ dii koro be tiri onyun be tiri baade-kpen bɛ dɔ̀ aa diyere daanɩ, gɛ bè kere yɩ bɛ ya, yema aa tiira bɛ giten fɔ, <verse eid="2CH 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CH 6:27" />nʋn baakʋn ye gatala, fɔ àà ka aa bɛsaranyan Isareli bete baade-kpen kyɛ bɛ. Wùlà bɛ dɩsarabi-kpara, fɔ àà yɛ ɛsʋn ɛ̀ɛ̀ nʋ̀n gɛtʋnkwaa gɛtɛ a tɛ aa bɛnɩ gàà mɛ baadikurumanyan fɔ gaanɩ. <verse eid="2CH 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2CH 6:28" />&lt;&lt;Gengyi dɩkpan abɛɛ gyerebi dɩ̀ nʋ̀n gɛtʋnkwaa fɔ gii koro, abɛɛ anyandilɛ yɩɩ gɛmɩna abɛɛ bɛkpagyɩgyɩ abɛɛ ma akpata, abɛɛ gengyi ɛkyʋnlɛ ɛkɩ ɛ̀ bɛ sʋ bɛ ɛ sa boo ditele dɩkɩ daanɩ, abɛɛ gyerebi-dɩrɛ abɛɛ diyebabi dɩkɩ dɩ̀ ba gɛtʋnkwaa fɔ gii koro, <verse eid="2CH 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2CH 6:29" />abɛɛ gengyi aa bɛnɩ Isareli bete fɔ baanɩ ɛkɩ è nu koro wɔ dɩfana ma dɩyɩyɛ daanɩ, gɛ ɛ bʋma walɔ e wùlà Dikwo-dɩrɛ nyadɩ e tiri onyun dɩkpʋkpʋ daanɩ fɔ, <verse eid="2CH 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2CH 6:30" />nʋn ye gatala aa gɛsarakʋn fɔ gaanɩ, fɔ àà ka wade-kpen kyɛ wɔ, fɔ àà mɛ wʋʋ gʋtʋn, fɔ àà le ɛkamasɛ gutoro anlɛ gɛtɛ wade mɛlɛ ì we. Yema à nyɩ̀ woturu waanɩ, gɛ awɔ aako n nyɩ̀ bɛnɩ powu boo-ituru yaanɩ. <verse eid="2CH 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2CH 6:31" />Gɛlɛ fɔ, baà serenti wɔ̀, fɔ bàà di ade yii koro ɔya-kamasɛ gɛtɛ bɛ̀ sa gɛtʋnkwaa gɛtɛ a ka a tɛ tiitu ɛbɛ fɔ gaanɩ fɔ.<verse eid="2CH 6:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2CH 6:32" />&lt;&lt;Gɛlɛ ke gɛ gengyi esela ɛkɩ gɛtɛ en di aa bɛnɩ Isareli bete baanɩ ɛkɩ, ɛ̀ nʋn aa diyere-dɩrɛ, ma aakɛma, ma aa geto-bɛnɩ-ya yii koro, è ye gende ma ɔfɔ gɩkɩ gaanɩ è be tiri onyun Dikwo-dɩrɛ nyadɩ daanɩ fɔ, <verse eid="2CH 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2CH 6:33" />nʋn wakʋn ye gatala, aa gɛsarakʋn fɔ gaanɩ, fɔ àà mɛ gɩnyan-kamasɛ gɛtɛ esela fɔ e lila wɔ̀ fɔ, fɔ wàà yɛ gɛtʋnkwaa gɩɩ bɛnɩ powu bàà nyɩnla aa diyere, fɔ bàà serenti wɔ̀, anlɛ gɛtɛ aa mɛ a tɛ aa bɛnɩ Isareli bete fɔ, fɔ bàà nyɩnla alɛ Dikwo-dɩrɛ nyadɩ gɛtɛ na sere fɔ daanɩ gɛ bàà sʋma wɔ̀. <verse eid="2CH 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="2CH 6:34" />&lt;&lt;Gengyi aa bɛnɩ bɛ̀ san bɩtà ma bɔɔ bɛkyʋnlɛ fɔ, ɔkʋn-kamasɛ gɛtɛ à dɔ̀ bɛ alɛ bɛ san, gɛ bè fi bɔɔ bʋnʋn be ten ditele-dɩrɛ gɛtɛ a tiri, ma Dikwo-dɩrɛ gɛtɛ na sere bàà tɩ̀ sʋma wɔ̀ daanɩ lɛ, gɛ bè tiri onyun bɛ tɛ wɔ̀ fɔ, <verse eid="2CH 6:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2CH 6:35" />nʋn boonyun-tiri ma bɔɔ gɛfɔ fɔ ye gatala, aa gɛsarakʋn fɔ gaanɩ, fɔ àà kpà tɛ bɛ. <verse eid="2CH 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="2CH 6:36" />&lt;&lt;Ɛkɩ ɛn ma gɛtɛ ɛn taà mɛ ade-kpen. Okoro gengyi bɛ̀ mɛ wɔ̀ ade-kpen, gɛ à ka owurufa boo koro, gɛ à tiri bɛ a tɛ bɔɔ bɛkyʋnlɛ gɛtɛ bàà gye bɛ bɩtà san gisela, ɔfɔ abɛɛ gbɛma, <verse eid="2CH 6:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="2CH 6:37" />gɛ gengyi bè foma be boo-ituru gɛtʋnkwaa gɛtɛ be gye bɛ bɩtà bɛ san fɔ gaanɩ, gɛ bè fi bɛ ba aakʋn bɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;Tɩ mɛ ade-kpen, tɩ mɛ ɛwʋ gɛtɛ wʋn kɔlɔ, tɩ mɛ duyu-kɛma daade&gt;, <verse eid="2CH 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="2CH 6:38" />gɛ gengyi bɛ̀ ka boo-ituru ma bɔɔkala ɛbɛ powu be biri be foma bɛ ba aakʋn, bɔɔ bɛkyʋnlɛ gɛtɛ be gye bɛ bɩtà fɔ bɔɔ gɛtʋnkwaa gaanɩ dʋkɔ, gɛ bè fi bɔɔ bʋnʋn be ten gɛtʋnkwaa gɛtɛ a ka a tɛ bootu ɛbɛ, ma ditele-dɩrɛ gɛtɛ a tiri, ma Dikwo-dɩrɛ, gɛtɛ na sere gɛtɛ bàà tɩ̀ sʋma wɔ̀ daanɩ fɔ, gɛ bè tiri onyun fɔ, <verse eid="2CH 6:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="2CH 6:39" />nʋn boonyun-tiri ma bɔɔ gɛfɔ ye gatala aa gɛsarakʋn fɔ gaanɩ, fɔ àà kpà tɛ bɛ, fɔ àà ka aa bɛnɩ baade-kpen gɛtɛ bɛ mɛ wɔ̀ fɔ kyɛ bɛ.<verse eid="2CH 6:39" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="2CH 6:40" />&lt;&lt;Nkele miin Wurubwarɛ, ǹ fɔ wɔ̀ gɛ, nʋn onyun-tiri gɛtɛ baà tiri nfan nyawʋ powu fɔ.<verse eid="2CH 6:40" /></para>
  <para style="qm1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="2CH 6:41" />&lt;&lt;Nkele, oo Yahwe, miin Wurubwarɛ, tɔ fɔ àà bɛ̀ sara aa getunakʋn fɔ gaanɩ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CH 6:41">awɔ ma aakɛma wʋʋ dɩdaka fɔ.</para>
  <para style="qm1" vid="2CH 6:41">Oo Yahwe Wurubwarɛ, yɛ aa getoya gàà sara ma aa gedi gɩɩ bɛtɛlɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CH 6:41">fɔ aa bɛnɩ bàà di ɔsɛ aade-kpara yaanɩ.<verse eid="2CH 6:41" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="2CH 6:42" />Oo Yahwe, mɩɩn Wurubwarɛ, kara tiri bʋnʋn ye aasaranyan gɛtɛ a sʋrʋ bʋnɔ wo koro fɔ.</para>
  <para style="qm2" vid="2CH 6:42">Kʋna gelen-dɩrɛ gɛtɛ a dɔ̀ a sɩ̀ a tɛ aasaranyan Dafidi fɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2CH 6:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="2CH 7" />
  <para style="s1">Solomon ɛ ka Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ ɛ sa Wurubwarɛ gʋlɔ</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="1KI 8:62-66">1 Begyu-dɩrɛ 8:62-66</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 7:1" />Gɛtɛ Solomon e tiri onyun e were fɔ, ɔtan wu ye gatala wu be kuma gekuma gɩɩ gedi ma gedi gɩɩ gɛtɛ̀ kperen-kperen fɔ, gɛ Yahwe gingyebi gɩ yɔn Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ daanɩ. <verse eid="2CH 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 7:2" />Gedi gɩɩ bɛtɛlɛ fɔ bɛn talɩ gyu Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ daanɩ, yema Yahwe gingyebi gɩ yɔn daanɩ. <verse eid="2CH 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 7:3" />Gɛtɛ Isareli bete powu be we gɛtɛ ɔtan fɔ wʋ waran wu ye gatala wʋʋ ba gatɩn, gɛ Yahwe gingyebi gɩ yɔn Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ daanɩ fɔ, bɛ waran be kura baakpin yii koro, gɛ bɛ ka bʋnʋn be tin gɛtʋnkwaa, gɛ bɛ sʋma Yahwe bɛ sa wɔ onyun bɛ dɔ̀ alan,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CH 7:3">&lt;&lt;Ɛ̀ kɔlɔ,</para>
  <para style="pi" vid="2CH 7:3">gɛ wo gelen gɩ̀ sa gakpaakpa!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2CH 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 7:4" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Solomon ma wɔ bɛnɩ powu bɛ ka bɛnan bɛ tɛ Yahwe gedi. <verse eid="2CH 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 7:5" />Egyu-dɩrɛ Solomon ɛ ka bɛkwɔ disepekyi ma gbaa (22,000), ma bɛyɛran ma begbebi asepekyi kooron (120,000) ɛ tɛ gedi. Gɛlɛ gɛ egyu fɔ ma bɛnɩ fɔ powu bɛ mɛ bɛ ka Wurubwarɛ Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ bɛ sa Wurubwarɛ gʋlɔ. <verse eid="2CH 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 7:6" />Fɔ gedi gɩɩ bɛtɛlɛ fɔ bè yela boo geyelakʋn. Gɛlɛ ke gɛ Lefi bete bè yela boofèn, gɛ bè de ɩnʋn yɩɩ gɛnʋma gaanyan gɛtɛ Dafidi e len ɛ sɩ̀ fɔ, gɛ bɛɛ nʋma ɩnʋn be sila Yahwe, gɛ bɛ sa wɔ onyun bɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Wo gelen gɩ̀ sa gakpaakpa.&gt;&gt; Lefi bete boofèn-do fɔ waanɩ fɔ, gɛtɛ gedi gɩɩ bɛtɛlɛ bɛɛ fʋ̀n baakantan fɔ, Isareli bete fɔ powu bɛ tɔ bè yela.<verse eid="2CH 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 7:7" />Solomon e tiri dɩkpaara fɔ dii getite gɛtɛ wʋ̀ sa Yahwe Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ dɩɩ bʋnʋn fɔ ɛ mɛ fɩrɩnfɩrɩn, gɛ ɛ tɛ gekuma gii gedi, ma anyan yaabi yii gedi, ma olila wuu gedi gaayo, yema gedi gɩɩ gɛtɛ̀kʋn gɛtɛ bɛ ka gɩwɔrɔnyan-sɩya bɛ mɛ fɔ gì we pɩɩ gɛtɛ gɩn nan talɩ gi to gekuma gii gedi, ma anyan yaabi yii gedi, ma olila wuu gedi waayo fɔ. <verse eid="2CH 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 7:8" />Okoro Solomon ma Isareli bete powu be di ɔsɛ-dɩrɛ ɔya wʋtɔkɔ awi kwarankɩ. Bɛnɩ bè lu ye Lebo-Hamati ka ma sere Egyipiti gifobi gaanɩ. <verse eid="2CH 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 7:9" />Duwi-nɩyɛfɛ daanɩ fɔ, be biri be tuma. Fɔ be were be di ɔsɛ awi kwarankɩ bɛ ka bɛ mɛ gedi gɩɩ gɛtɛ̀kʋn fɔ fɩrɩnfɩrɩn. Gɛ be biri be di ɔsɛ awi kwarankɩ bɛ fɩya. <verse eid="2CH 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 7:10" />Gɛ ebon-kwarankɩfɛ wo duwi dikpilin ma disiyeefɛ daanɩ fɔ, Solomon e tiri bɛnɩ fɔ osele gɛ bɛ da bɔɔ-ɩlɛ ɔsɛ waanɩ, yema ade-kpara gɛtɛ Yahwe ɛ mɛ ɛ tɛ wɔsaranyan Dafidi ma Solomon ma wɔ bɛnɩ Isareli bete powu fɔ yii koro.<verse eid="2CH 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yahwe e tiri koro e wùlà Solomon</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 7:11" />Gɛtɛ Solomon e werema Yahwe Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ ma digyu-kpaara fɔ yii gesere, gɛ e werema gɩnyan-kamasɛ gɛtɛ ɛ sa amɩnlɛ alɛ ɛɛ̀ mɛ Yahwe Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ daanɩ, ma ɛwɔ gbagba wo digyu-kpaara fɔ, <verse eid="2CH 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 7:12" />Yahwe e tiri koro e wùlà wɔ odente, gɛ ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ alan,&lt;&lt;Na nʋn aanyun-tiri, gɛ na to Dikwo-dɩrɛ nyadɩ na sa gɛtɛ bàà tɩ̀ tɛ mɩ gedi nfan. <verse eid="2CH 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 7:13" />&lt;&lt;Gengyi ǹ tan gatala, gɛ ɛsʋn ɛn taa nʋ̀n, abɛɛ ǹ yɛ bɛkpagyɩgyɩ bɛ bɛ mɩna yii-ili yaanyɩmɩnyan, abɛɛ ǹ yɛ gyerebi ɛkɩ ɛ nʋ̀n mɩɩn bɛnɩ boo koro, <verse eid="2CH 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 7:14" />gɛ gengyi mɩɩn bɛnɩ gɛtɛ miin diyere dɩ̀ gyaga boo koro baà warama koro gatɩn, bàà tiri onyun, bàà fɔ mɩ alɛ n kpà bɛ, gɛ bè kere baade-kpen bɛ ya fɔ, nan nʋn boonyun-tiri n ye gatala, fɔ nan ka baade-kpen n kyɛ bɛ, fɔ nan yɛ bɔɔ gɛtʋnkwaa gàà biri pe. <verse eid="2CH 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 7:15" />Nkele mɩɩn bʋnʋn baà tirima, gɛ maaten yaà nʋn yiinyun-tiri gɛtɛ yaà tiri i ye nfan nyawʋ fɔ. <verse eid="2CH 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 7:16" />Yema na tiri Dikwo-dɩrɛ nyadɩ, gɛ na mɛ dɩ fɩrɩnfɩrɩn gɛtɛ daà mɛ mɩɩn gɛsarakʋn gakpaakpa. Mɩɩn bʋnʋn ma miinturu waà sara dʋkɔ ɔya-kamasɛ.<verse eid="2CH 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 7:17" />&lt;&lt;Awɔ bɩrɛ, gengyi aà sʋma mɩ nʋnkwarɩ anɩ anlɛ gɛtɛ aate Dafidi ɛ mɛ fɔ, gɛ à di ade gɛtɛ na dɔ̀ wɔ̀ alɛ mɛ fɔ powu yii koro, gɛ à di maade-wùlàlɛ, ma mii-ise powu yii koro fɔ, <verse eid="2CH 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 7:18" />nan yɛ aa gigyu-bɩya gàà sere anlɛ gɛtɛ na dɔ̀ na sɩ̀ na tɛ aate Dafidi alan, &lt;Ɔya wʋkɩ wʋn nan ba alɛ nka aadu waanɩ wʋʋnɩ nan di bugyu Isareli&gt; fɔ. <verse eid="2CH 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 7:19" />&lt;&lt;Mɔ gengyi ɛyɩ ma yii bebi ì kere mɩɩn gɛsʋma ɩ ya, gɛ in di mii-ise, ma maade-wùlàlɛ gɛtɛ na tɛ yɩ fɔ yii koro, gɛ ɩ̀ san ɩ ma sʋma bekpen fɔ, <verse eid="2CH 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 7:20" />nan kpa Isareli n ye gɛtʋnkwaa gɛtɛ na tɛ bɛ fɔ gaanɩ, gɛ nan terema Dikwo-dɩrɛ gɛtɛ na mɛ fɩrɩnfɩrɩn miin diyere dii koro fɔ. Gɛ bɛnɩ powu baà tɩ ka Isareli gɩfɩɩ be di giforo, bàà mʋmwa gɩ yoli. <verse eid="2CH 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 7:21" />Dikwo nyadɩ daà biligi Dikwo-gbenalɛ. Gɛ ɛnɩ-kamasɛ gɛtɛ ɛɛ̀ bɛ dama dɩɩpɩ fɔ, ɔmɩrɩ waà ku wɔ, gɛ ɛɛ̀ yɩyɛ eè lila alan, &lt;Anʋn yii koro gɛ Yahwe ɛ yɛ ade nyayɩ ɩ ba gɛtʋnkwaa nyagɩ ma Dikwo-dɩrɛ nyadɩ yii koro?&gt; <verse eid="2CH 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 7:22" />Fɔ bɛnɩ baà tiri wuunyun alan, &lt;Yema be terema Yahwe, boo Wurubwarɛ gɛtɛ e tiri bootu ɛbɛ e ye Egyipiti gɛtʋnkwaa gaanɩ fɔ, gɛ bɛ yɛ bɛ ka koro bɛ tɛ bekpen bɔɔ gɛsʋma. Gɛlɛ wuu koro gɛ Yahwe ɛ ka gyerebi-dɩrɛ nyawɔ ɛ ba boo koro.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="2CH 7:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="2CH 8" />
  <para style="s1">Solomon wade-mɛlɛ gɛtɛ ɩ̀ nɩ fɩya</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="1KI 9:10-28">1 Begyu-dɩrɛ 9:10-28</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 8:1" />Bɩkyan dikpilin gɛ Solomon ɛ ka gɛ e sere Yahwe Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ, ma digyu-kpaara fɔ. <verse eid="2CH 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 8:2" />Solomon ɛ pɩna atelebi gɛtɛ Egyu-dɩrɛ Hiram<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Diyere Hiram ke n di Huram</char></note> ɛ ka ɛ tɛ wɔ fɔ e sere, gɛ ɛ yɛ Isareli bete bɛ ma sara yaanɩ. <verse eid="2CH 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 8:3" />waanɩ gɛ Solomon ɛ ma gye Hamati ma Soba atele bɩtà. <verse eid="2CH 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 8:4" />Gɛ e sere ɩpɔrɩ e silin Tadimori ditele, otonkuma waanɩ, ma anyan yɩɩ gɛsɩ̀kʋn yaatele gɛtɛ e sere Hamati wɔ-ɩlanla yaanɩ fɔ powu. <verse eid="2CH 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 8:5" />Gɛ ɛ pɩna e sere Gatala gii Beti-Horon ma Gatɩn gii Beti-Horon atele fɔ, gɛtɛ ì di atele ma ɔkɛma fɔ, gɛ be sere ɩpɔrɩ be silin yɩ, gɛ bɛ sa yɩ itunu, ma awɔrɔnyan. <verse eid="2CH 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 8:6" />Gɛ e biri e sere ɩpɔrɩ e silin Baalati ditele ma atele-sɩ̀lɛ anyan powu, ma atele gɛtɛ wo tiiramisan ɛbɛ ma waabengyi ɩ̀ sa yaanɩ fɔ. E sere gɩnyan-kamasɛ gɛtɛ è len èè sere Yerusalem, ma Lebanon, ma ntʋnkwaa gɛtɛ ee di bugyu baanɩ powu fɔ. <verse eid="2CH 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 8:7" />Bè ye ma ɔkʋna wʋtɔkɔ fɔ, bɛnɩ bɛkɩ bɛ̀ sangba bè si gɛtʋnkwaa fɔ gii koro gɛtɛ ben di Isareli bete. Bɛnɩ bɛtɔkɔ n di Hiti bete, ma Amori bete, ma Perisi bete, ma Hifi bete, ma Yebusi bete <verse eid="2CH 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 8:8" />gɛtɛ Isareli ben wolo fɔ boodu waanɩ na kuruma gɛtʋnkwaa fɔ gaanɩ lɛ. Ɛbɛ gɛ Solomon ɛ mɛ bɛ bɛdɩ̀, gɛ bɛ mɛ gʋtʋn ma ɔkɛma anlɛ gɛtɛ wu we be ye ma ǹdò lɛ. <verse eid="2CH 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 8:9" />Mɔ Solomon ɛn nyɩ̀ Isareli bete fɔ bàà mɛ bɛdɩ̀ wɔ gʋtʋn gaanɩ, mɔ fɔ, ɛ yɛ baanɩ bɛkɩ bɛ mɛ wɔ bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ, ma bɩtà bʋʋ bɛndɩrɛ, ma wɔ bɛndɩrɛbi, ma wo tiiramisan ɛbɛ yɩɩ bɛnyalɛ, ma waabengyi yɩɩ bɛsaralɛ. <verse eid="2CH 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 8:10" />Gɛ Egyu Solomon ɛ̀ nɩ ba Isareli bɛndɩrɛbi gɛkpɩn ma akpilin anyɔɔ ma fwo (250) gɛtɛ bɛɛ nya bɛnɩ gɛtɛ bɛɛ mɛ gʋtʋn fɔ boo koro.<verse eid="2CH 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 8:11" />Solomon e tiri Farawo wobi-nanɩ e ye Dafidi Ditele ɛ ba digyu-kpaara gɛtɛ e sere ɛ tɛ wɔ fɔ daanɩ, yema ɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Wʋn kʋtʋma gɛtɛ mɩɩnsɔ ɛ̀ɛ̀ sara Isareli wogyu Dafidi digyu-kpaara daanɩ, yema ɔkʋn-kamasɛ gɛtɛ Yahwe Dikola dɩɩ dɩdaka fɔ dɩ̀ sa fɔ, wù we fɩrɩnfɩrɩn.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Gɛtɛ ɛna fɔ en di gɛ Isareli-na fɔ okoro gɛ ɛn kʋtʋma</char></note><verse eid="2CH 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 8:12" />Solomon ɛ tɛ Yahwe gekuma gii gedi, gedi gɩɩ gɛtɛ̀kʋn gɛtɛ e sere Yahwe Dikwo-dɩrɛ dɩɩ kpata bʋnʋn fɔ gii koro. <verse eid="2CH 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 8:13" />Ɛ tɛ gedi fɔ anlɛ gɛtɛ Mose wo-ise ii wùlà alɛ bɛ mɛ duwi-kamasɛ daanɩ, ma Awi-Tunalɛ yaanɩ, ma Bebon-Bon, ma gɩkyan bʋʋ-ɩsɛ isiyee yii gedi, gɛtɛ ɛyɩ n di Boroboro gɛtɛ bɛn sa Gɩfa-ŋanlɛ wɔsɛ wuu gedi, ma Awi-nɩyɛ ɛbɛ Yaawi yii gedi, ma Ɩpanpan Yaawi yii gedi. <verse eid="2CH 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 8:14" />Solomon ɛ tɛrɛma ade-tɩyɛlɛ-sɩ̀lɛ gɛtɛ wote Dafidi ɛ tɩyɛ ɛ sɩ̀ fɔ. Ɛ sɩ̀ gedi gɩɩ bɛtɛlɛ akpi-akpi tɛ bɔɔ gʋtʋn gɩɩ gɛ mɛ, gɛ e tiri Lefi bete gɛtɛ bàà gyegeye tɛ gesila gɩɩnʋn yɩɩ gɛnʋma, fɔ bàà kpà gedi gɩɩ bɛtɛlɛ fɔ anlɛ gɛtɛ wù di gɛtɛ baà mɛ gʋtʋn duwi-kamasɛ daanɩ fɔ. Gɛlɛ ke gɛ ɛ sɩ̀ itunu yɩɩ bɛdɩyɛlɛ akpen-akpen gɛtɛ bàà yela itunu yɩɩ-ɩpɩ. Yema gɛlɛ gɛ Wurubwarɛ wɔnɩ Dafidi ɛ dɔ̀ bɛ alɛ bɛ mɛ. <verse eid="2CH 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 8:15" />Gedi gɩɩ bɛtɛlɛ ma Lefi bete fɔ bɛ bɔ bɛ mɛ gɛ anlɛ gɛtɛ Dafidi e wùlà alɛ bɛ mɛ fɔ, fɩya ma dikwo gɛtɛ bɛɛ sɩ̀ anyan gbaa-gbaa daanɩ fɔ dii koro wʋʋ gɛnya.<verse eid="2CH 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 8:16" />Solomon gʋtʋn fɔ powu gi were nkele. Ye duwi gɛtɛ be sere Yahwe Dikwo-dɩrɛ dɩɩ gʋtʋn fɔ gɩɩpɩ ma ye gii geweremakʋn. Okoro Yahwe Diko-dɩrɛ fɔ di were.<verse eid="2CH 8:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 8:17" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Solomon ɛ san Esiyon-Gebri, ma Elati, Ɛpʋ-sɩya wonyun gɛtɛ wù sa Edom gɛtʋnkwaa gaanɩ fɔ. <verse eid="2CH 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 8:18" />Gɛ egyu-dɩrɛ Hiram ɛ yɛ wɔ bɛndɩrɛbi, ma ɛbɛ gɛtɛ bɛ̀ nyɩ̀ ɩkʋlɩ yaade fɔ bɛ nya ɩkʋlɩ fɔ yɩɩ-ɩsan yii koro. Ɛbɛ ma Solomon bɛndɩrɛbi fɔ na ye dʋkɔ bɛ san bɛ ma gyu Ofiri, gɛ bɛ ka sɩka-sɩya bekilo ɩgbaa nɩyɛ ma nkpɩn ton (17,000) bɛ mɔma Solomon.<verse eid="2CH 8:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="2CH 9" />
  <para style="s1">Seba wogyu-nanɩ ɛ be silin Solomon</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="1KI 10:1-13">1 Begyu-dɩrɛ 10:1-13</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 9:1" />Gɛtɛ Seba wogyu-nanɩ ɛ nʋn anlɛ gɛtɛ Solomon diyere di ye fɔ, ɛ ka ade-lilalɛ ma ɔkɛma ɩkɩ ɛ ba ɛ̀ɛ̀ bɛ kɛrɛ wɔ nya. Ɛ ka bɛnɩ dɩtɩnpan, ma akpɔŋɔ, gɛtɛ ì tola anyan ma ofen, ma sɩka-sɩya gepepe, ma ataa ma ɔyɛ-kɛma ɛ ba Yerusalem. Gɛtɛ e be gyu Solomon wakʋn fɔ, ɛ dɔ̀ Solomon ade powu gɛtɛ ɩ̀ sa wamɩnlɛ yaanɩ. <verse eid="2CH 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 9:2" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Solomon e tiri wade fɔ powu yiinyun ɛ tɛ wɔ. Ade ɩkɩ ɩn mɛ egyu-dɩrɛ ɔkɛma ma yaanɩ yii getiri tɛ wɔ. <verse eid="2CH 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 9:3" />Gɛtɛ Seba wogyu-nanɩ e we gɛsɛyɩ gɛtɛ Solomon ɛ̀ ba, ma digyu-kpaara gɛtɛ e sere, <verse eid="2CH 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 9:4" />ma anyandilɛ gɛtɛ ɩ̀ gyaga wɔkpʋlɔ wuu koro, ma anlɛ gɛtɛ wɔ bɛndɩrɛbi bè si, ma wɔ bɛsaranyan ma bɛsʋgʋgyan gɛtɛ bɛ̀ sa bɔɔ ngba, ma wɔ bʋkan bʋʋ bɛyaranlɛ, ma gekuma gii gedi gɛtɛ ɛ tɛ Yahwe Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ daanɩ fɔ, ɔmɩrɩ wu ku wɔ wʋ kààrà.<verse eid="2CH 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 9:5" />Ɛwʋ gɛ ɛ dɔ̀ egyu-dɩrɛ fɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Ade gɛtɛ na nʋn mɩɩn gɩfɩɩ gaanɩ ka da ma aa gʋtʋn gɛtɛ a mɛ, ma aa gɛsɛyɩ fɔ, ɩ̀ sa waanɩ. <verse eid="2CH 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 9:6" />Mɔ min to ade fɔ di bè ye ma ɔkʋna gɛtɛ nmɩ gbagba na ka mɩɩn gʋnʋn na be we. Nkyɛ bɛn dɔ̀ mɩ aa gɛsɛyɩ gaade-dɩrɛ fɔ yɩɩfan gba. Aa gɛsɛyɩ gɩ kààrà ade gɛtɛ bɛnɩ bɛ dɔ̀ mɩ fɔ. <verse eid="2CH 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 9:7" />Aa bɛnɩ bɛ ma duyu-kpara! Gɛlɛ ke gɛ aa bɛndɩrɛbi, gɛtɛ bɛɛ nʋn aa gɛsɛyɩ gaade ɔya-kamasɛ fɔ, bɛ ma duyu-kpara! <verse eid="2CH 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 9:8" />Ɩ yɛ taà sila Yahwe aa Wurubwarɛ gɛtɛ ee len aade, gɛ ɛ ka wɔ̀ ɛ sɩ̀ bugyu, wo gigyu-bɩya gii koro, fɔ àà di bugyu wo diyere daanɩ fɔ woyo. Yema gelen gɛtɛ Yahwe ɛ̀ ba tɛ Isareli, ma wo gelen gɛtɛ èè ton bɛ ɛ ma ye gakpaakpa fɔ gii koro gɛ ɛ sɩ̀ wɔ̀ bugyu, fɔ àà dɔ̀ gɔdɔ kyɛkyɛ ma giisele waanɩ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2CH 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 9:9" />Ɛwʋ gɛ egyu-nanɩ fɔ ɛ tɛ egyu-dɩrɛ sɩka-sɩya gɛtɛ wʋʋdʋrʋ waà mɛ anlɛ bekilo ɩgbaa ɩnyɔɔ ma nkpɩn bʋnyɔɔ ma akpilin-ton (4,500), ma anyan ma ofèn kpekpesi, ma ataa ma ɔyɛ-kɛma. Solomon en te wura anyan ma ofèn yàà nɩma anlɛ gɛtɛ Seba wogyu-dɩrɛ-nanɩ ɛ tɛ wɔ fɔ nya.<verse eid="2CH 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 9:10" />Gɛlɛ ke gɛ Hiram bɛnɩ ma Solomon bɛnɩ bɛ ka sɩka-sɩya be ye Ofiri bɛ mɔma wɔ. Be biri bɛ ka alimugi wo-iyon, ma ataa ma ɔyɛ-kɛma mɔ bɛ ba. <verse eid="2CH 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 9:11" />Gɛ egyu-dɩrɛ ɛ ka alimugi wo-iyon fɔ e sere akyikya-bʋnkʋn ɛ sa Yahwe Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ, ma digyu-kpaara fɔ, gɛ ɛ ka ɩkɩ ɛ mɛ adʋlɛ ɛbɛ ma adʋlɛ ɛbɛ dɩrɛ-dɩrɛ ɛ tɛ ɩnʋn yɩɩ bɛnʋmalɛ. Ben we gɩnyankɩ gɛlɛ Yuda gɛtʋnkwaa gaanɩ nya. <verse eid="2CH 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 9:12" />Egyu-dɩrɛ Solomon ɛ tɛ Seba wogyu-nanɩ gɩnyan-kamasɛ gɛtɛ ee len abɛɛ e lila fɔ. Ɛ tɛ wɔ anyan ɛ kààrà anlɛ gɛtɛ ɛ bɛ tɛ wɔ fɔ. Ɛwʋ gɛ ɛwɔ ma wɔ bɛnɩ gɛtɛ bɛ nyɩma wɔ bɛ ba fɔ be biri bɛ da bɔɔ gɩfɩɩ gaanɩ.<verse eid="2CH 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Solomon gɩkyɩnyɩn</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="1KI 10:14-25">1 Begyu-dɩrɛ 10:14-25</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 9:13" />Sɩka-sɩya gɛtɛ Solomon ee wura gɩkyan gaanɩ fɔ wʋʋdʋrʋ wʋ̀ ba bekilo disepekyi ma gbaa ma nkpɩn-ton (23,000), <verse eid="2CH 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 9:14" />gɛtɛ sɩka gɛtɛ anyan yii befulɛ ma gɩyɛ gii bedilɛ be le fɔ wʋn fɩya. Gɛlɛ ke gɛ Arabiya begyu-dɩrɛ powu, ma Isareli bete bɔɔ gɩfɩɩ gɩɩ bɛnyalɛ fɔ bɛɛ ka sɩka-sɩya ma sɩka-fututu bɛ mɔma Solomon.<verse eid="2CH 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 9:15" />Egyu-dɩrɛ Solomon ɛ yɛ bɛ ka sɩka-sɩya be tiba bɛ mɛ awɔrɔnyan-dɩyɛlɛ-koro gɛkpɩn (200). Bɛ ka sɩka-sɩya bekilo besiyee ma ɔfan bɛ mɛ gɩwɔrɔnyan-dɩyɛlɛ koro-kɩlɩn. <verse eid="2CH 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 9:16" />E biri e tiba sɩka-sɩya ɛ mɛ awɔrɔnyan-dɩyɛlɛ-koro-titi gɛkpɩn ma akpilin-ton (300). Ɛ ka gɛ sɩka-sɩya bekilo besiyee ma ɔfan e tiba ɛ mɛ gɩwɔrɔnyan-dɩyɛlɛ-koro-kɩlɩn. Gɛ egyu-dɩrɛ ɛ ka yɩ ɛ ma sɩ̀ digyu-kpaara, ɔkʋn gɛtɛ bee kpèlè Lebanon Gɩkan fɔ daanɩ. <verse eid="2CH 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 9:17" />Egyu-dɩrɛ ɛ salɩ gigyu-bɩya-dɩrɛ, gɛ ɛ ka etola wanyaa ɛ sa gɩ adawʋ ofèn wʋkɩ, gɛ ɛ ka sɩka-sɩya-kpara ɛ bɔlɩ giifen-do. <verse eid="2CH 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 9:18" />Gigyu-bɩya fɔ gɩ̀ ba akyikya-bʋnkʋn kooron, gɛ bɛ ka sɩka-sɩya bɛ mɛ bɩsɩrɩ buu gekyikyakʋn bɛ sa gɩ. Gɛ gɛbɩya fɔ gɩ̀ ba alɔ yɩɩ gɛgyagakʋn, giifen ɩnyɔɔ fɔ powu yaanɩ. Bɛ mɛ bɛdɩ̀rɛ̀ bɛnyɔɔ be yela gɛbɩya fɔ gɩɩ dɩbɩyan ma giilogyi. <verse eid="2CH 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 9:19" />Bɛdɩ̀rɛ̀ fwo-bɛnyɔɔ bè yela akyikya-bʋnkʋn kooron yii koro. Ɛdɩ̀rɛ̀ ɛkɩ-ɛkɩ è yela gekyikya-bʋnkʋn-kamasɛ giifèn-kamasɛ wuu koro. Bɛn tɛ mɛ gigyu-bɩya nyagɩ gaakɩ anlɛ nyagɩ giidu tɛ bugyu buu gedikʋn bʋkɩ bɛ nya. <verse eid="2CH 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 9:20" />Bɛ ka gɛ sɩka-sɩya bɛ mɛ egyu-dɩrɛ Solomon bɛkɔpʋ powu. Gɛ digyukpaara dɩɩkʋn gɛtɛ bee kpèlè Lebanon Gɩkan fɔ daanyan powu ì di gɛ sɩka-sɩya-kpara gɛ bɛ ka bɛ mɛ yɩ. Gɩnyankɩ gɩn ma gɛtɛ bɛ ka gɛ sɩka-fututu bɛ mɛ gɩ, yema Solomon wɔya waanɩ fɔ, sɩka-fututu ɛn ma gɩyɛ anlɛ sɩka-sɩya. <verse eid="2CH 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 9:21" />Fɔ egyu-dɩrɛ ɛ̀ ba gɩyɛ gɩɩ-ɩkʋlɩ-kpekpesi ɛpʋ wo koro, fɩya ma Hiram woyo ɩkʋlɩ fɔ. Bɩkyan bisiyee-kamasɛ fɔ, ɩkʋlɩ fɔ ii biri i ye Tarisisi ɩ ba ma sɩka-sɩya, ma sɩka-fututu, ma atola-nyaa, ma bɛsɩsɩra, ma betema.<verse eid="2CH 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 9:22" />Egyu-dɩrɛ Solomon gɛsɛyɩ ma wo koro gaanyan gɛtɛ e wura fɔ, ɩ da gɛtʋnkwaa giigyu-kamasɛ woyo. <verse eid="2CH 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 9:23" />Gɛlɛ wuu koro begyu powu bee ye ande yaanɩ bàà bɛ nʋn Solomon gɛsɛyɩ gaade gɛtɛ Wurubwarɛ ɛ tɛ wɔ fɔ. <verse eid="2CH 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CH 9:24" />Gɩkyan n di gɩkyan, ɛnɩ-kamasɛ gɛtɛ ɛ̀ ba wakʋn fɔ, ɛɛ bɛ kyɛ wɔ anyan. Ɛyɩ n di sɩka-fututu, ma sɩka-sɩya baanyan, ma ngba-serelɛ, ma akpanyan, ma anyan ma ofèn, ma abengyi, ma akpɔŋɔ-tɩtɩɩ. <verse eid="2CH 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CH 9:25" />Solomon e wura abengyi ma tiiramisan ɛbɛ baayelakʋn ɩgbaa ɩnyɔɔ (4,000) ma abengyi ɩgbaa kooron (12,000), gɛtɛ ɛ ka ɛ ma sɩ̀ tiiramisan ɛbɛ baatele yaanɩ, ma ɛwɔ egyu-dɩrɛ gbagba wakʋn Yerusalem. <verse eid="2CH 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CH 9:26" />E di bugyu begyu powu boo koro ye Efirati getu giinyun ka ma sere Filisiti bete bɔɔ gɛtʋnkwaa, ma Egyipiti wɔbalan waanɩ.<verse eid="2CH 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CH 9:27" />Egyu-dɩrɛ ɛ yɛ sɩka-fututu e gbintin Yerusalem anlɛ ataa tun-tun, gɛ seda wo-iyon i gbigi anlɛ gɛtɛ Sikamo wo-iyon ɩ yɔn odon wʋʋ gatɩn fɔ. <verse eid="2CH 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2CH 9:28" />Bɛ tɩyɛma gɛ Solomon wabengyi fɔ be ye Egyipiti, ma ntʋnkwaa-fon powu baanɩ.<verse eid="2CH 9:28" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Solomon diku</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="1KI 11:41-43">1 Begyu-dɩrɛ 11:41-43</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2CH 9:29" />Bɛ ŋwara Solomon wade-mɛlɛ-kurumakyɛɛ, ma wo bugyu buuyo, ye digyegeye daanɩ ma sere geweremakʋn powu bɛ sa Wurubwarɛ wɔtabʋrʋlɛ Natan wo koro gaade yɩɩ gɩkpa gaanɩ, ma Wurubwarɛ wɔtabʋrʋlɛ Ahiya gɛtɛ e ye Silo fɔ wɔ gɛtabʋrʋ gɩɩ gɩkpa gaanɩ, ma Wurubwarɛ wɔtabʋrʋlɛ Ido wade gɛtɛ Wurubwarɛ e tiri e wùlà wɔ anlɛ okute waanɩ ka da ma Nebati wobi Yerobwam wo koro fɔ yɩɩ gɩkpa gaanɩ. <verse eid="2CH 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2CH 9:30" />Solomon ɛ sara Yerusalem e di bugyu ɛ tɛ Isareli bete powu bɩkyan akpilin-anyɔɔ (40). <verse eid="2CH 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2CH 9:31" />Gɛ e kù, gɛ be lò wɔ Yerusalem wɔkʋn gɛtɛ bee kpèlè alɛ Dafidi Ditele fɔ. Gɛ wobi Rehobwam e di bugyu e sere wɔ gɩsɩrɩ.<verse eid="2CH 9:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="2CH 10" />
  <para style="s1">Isareli bete bɛ tɔ be yela Rehobwam wo koro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 10:1" />Rehobwam ɛ tɔ ɛ san Sekem, yema Isareli bete powu bɛ da dʋkɔ bàà màà sɩ̀ wɔ bugyu. <verse eid="2CH 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 10:2" />Gɛtɛ Nebati wobi-teni Yerobwam gɛtɛ e tì serenti e ye egyu Solomon wakʋn ɛ da Egyipiti fɔ ɛ nʋn gɛlɛ fɔ, e biri ɛ ba. <verse eid="2CH 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 10:3" />Okoro bɛ sa bɛnɩ bɛ ma kpèlè Yerobwam, gɛ ɛwɔ ma gatala gɩɩ gɩlan gii-ifoli fɔ powu bɛ ma dɔ̀ Rehobwam alan, <verse eid="2CH 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 10:4" />&lt;&lt;Aate ɛ ka ditola ma ɔdʋrʋ ɛ kyɔlɔga tɩ gigyen, mɔ nkele awɔ tɩyɛra dɩkpankpasan dɩɩ gʋtʋn, ma ditola ma ɔdʋrʋ gɛtɛ aate ɛ ka ɛ sa ti gigyen fɔ. Gɛlɛ fɔ taà sʋma wɔ̀.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2CH 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 10:5" />Gɛ Rehobwam e tiri wuunyun alan, &lt;&lt;Ɩ san, gɩsarama fɔ yàà biri ba.&gt;&gt; Okoro be ye wakʋn bɛ da.<verse eid="2CH 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 10:6" />Ɛwʋ gɛ egyu Rehobwam ɛ ma to amɩnlɛ e ye bɛndɩrɛ gɛtɛ bɛ sʋma wote Solomon, wɔ nkpa wawi yaanɩ fɔ baakʋn alan, &lt;&lt;Amɩnlɛ-mɔmɔ gɛ yaà tɛ mɩ nan ka n tiri bɛnɩ nyabɛ baade fɔ yiinyun n tɛ bɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2CH 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 10:7" />Gɛ be tiri wuunyun alan, &lt;&lt;Gengyi à mɛ gɩnɩ-kpara a tɛ bɛnɩ nyabɛ, gɛ à sʋma bɛ, gɛ à mɛ ade gɛtɛ ii di bɛ gʋnʋn, gɛ a tiri baade fɔ yiinyun gepe a tɛ bɛ fɔ, ɛbɛ mɔ baà mɛ aa bɛsaranyan gakpaakpa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2CH 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 10:8" />Mɔ Rehobwam e terema bɛndɩrɛ fɔ baamɩnlɛ gɛtɛ bɛ dɔ̀ wɔ fɔ, gɛ ɛ ma lila bɛsaranyanbi gɛtɛ ɛwɔ ma ɛbɛ bè di akʋsʋ, gɛ bɛɛ sʋma wɔ fɔ. <verse eid="2CH 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 10:9" />E lila bɛ alan, &lt;Amɩnlɛ-mɔmɔ gɛ yaà tɛ mɩ? Lan gɛ taà tiri ade nyayɩ yiinyun tɩ tɛ bɛnɩ nyabɛ gɛtɛ bɛ dɔ̀ mɩ alan, &lt;&lt;Tɩyɛra ditola gɛtɛ aate ɛ ka ɛ kyɔlɔga tɩ gigyen fɔ&gt; lɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2CH 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 10:10" />Gɛ wakʋsʋ yɩɩ bɛsaranyanbi fɔ be tiri wuunyun bɛ tɛ wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Dɔ̀ bɛnɩ gɛtɛ bɛ dɔ̀ wɔ̀ alan, &lt;Aate ɛ ka ditola-dɩrɛ e tola tɩ, mɔ awɔ bɩrɛ, tɩyɛra dɩ tɛ tɩ&gt; fɔ alan, &lt;Aburuburu ɩ lɛ, adɩrɛ-adɩrɛ ɩ̀ sa gama. <verse eid="2CH 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 10:11" />Miinte e tola yɩ ditola ma ɔdʋrɔ, mɔ nmɩ nan yɛ dàà biri mɛ ɔdʋrɔ fɩya. Miinte ɛ ka gɛ binyanibi ɛ lanla yɩ, mɔ nmɩ bɩrɛ, nan ka gɛ bikpemani n lanla yɩ.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="2CH 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 10:12" />Awi asiyee yɩɩ gama fɔ, Yerobwam ma bɛnɩ fɔ powu be biri bɛ san Rehobwam wakʋn, anlɛ gɛtɛ egyu-dɩrɛ ɛ fʋrʋma ɛ dɔ̀ bɛ fɔ. <verse eid="2CH 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 10:13" />Egyu-dɩrɛ ɛn ka wɔ bɛndɩrɛbi baamɩnlɛ gɛtɛ bɛ tɛ wɔ fɔ, ɛ ŋmanyan bɛ gɛ. <verse eid="2CH 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 10:14" />Ɛ ka gɛ bɛsaranyanbi fɔ baamɩnlɛ gɛtɛ bɛ tɛ wɔ̀ fɔ, gɛ ɛ dɔ̀ bɛ alan, &lt;&lt;Miinte e tola yɩ ditola ma ɔdʋrɔ, mɔ nmɩ miinyo daà nɩ da woyo fɔ. Miinte ɛ ka gɛ binyanibi ɛ lanla yɩ, mɔ nmɩ nan ka gɛ bikpemani n lanla yɩ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2CH 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 10:15" />Okoro egyu-dɩrɛ fɔ ɛn nʋn bɛnɩ fɔ baakʋn, yema ade gɛtɛ i sere lɛ i ye gɛ Yahwe wakʋn, fɔ wàà yɛ Yahwe wade gɛtɛ ɛ dama Silon-te Ahiya wo koro ɛ tabʋrʋ ɛ tɛ Nebati wobi Yerobwam fɔ yàà ba waanɩ.<verse eid="2CH 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 10:16" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:16 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2SA 20:1">2 Sa 20:1</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Gɛtɛ Isareli bete powu be we gɛtɛ egyu-dɩrɛ ɛn nʋn baakʋn fɔ, bɛ dɔ̀ wɔ alan,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CH 10:16">&lt;&lt;Anʋn gɛ ɛtɩ ma Dafidi wɔnana tɩ̀ ba?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CH 10:16">Anʋn gɛ taà wura ti ye Yese wɔnana fɔ wakʋn?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CH 10:16">Oo Isareli bete, ɩ san yaakwo yaanɩ!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CH 10:16">Dafidi wɔnana, kpà ma aa dɩkpaara!&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="m" vid="2CH 10:16">Okoro Isareli bete fɔ bɛ da baakpaara yaanɩ. <verse eid="2CH 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 10:17" />Mɔ Isareli bete gɛtɛ bè si Yuda watele yaanɩ fɔ bɩrɛ, Rehobwam ee di bugyu ɛ tɛ bɛ.<verse eid="2CH 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 10:18" />Ɛwʋ gɛ egyu-dɩrɛ Rehobwam ɛ sa Adoniram, gɛtɛ nafɔ ɛɛ nya dɩkpankpasan dɩɩ gʋtʋn gii koro fɔ Isareli bete baakʋn, mɔ Isareli bete be fun wɔ ataa be wolo. Wʋ ba gɛlɛ fɔ, egyu-dɩrɛ Rehobwam ɛ mɛ bilen e gyu wotiiramisan wanɩ gɛ e serenti ɛ da Yerusalem. <verse eid="2CH 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 10:19" />Okoro Isareli bete bɛ tɔ be yela Dafidi dɩkpaara dii koro bè sere ma ǹdò.<verse eid="2CH 10:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="2CH 11" />
  <para style="s1">Wurubwarɛ wɔtabʋrʋlɛ Semaya wade-dɔ̀lɛ</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="1KI 12:21-24">1 Begyu-dɩrɛ 12:21-24</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 11:1" />Gɛtɛ Rehobwam e bè gyu Yerusalem fɔ, ɛ kʋla Yuda ma Benyamin boo-ifoli yɩɩ bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ asepekyi yɛkɩ (180,000) gɛtɛ bɛ̀ nyɩ̀ bɩtà bʋʋ gɛtà gepepe bàà ma kpà ma Isareli, fɔ èè biri to bugyu fɔ fɩya.<verse eid="2CH 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 11:2" />Mɔ Wurubwarɛ ɛ da ma wɔtabʋrʋlɛ Semaya wo koro ɛ dɔ̀ alan, <verse eid="2CH 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 11:3" />&lt;&lt;Dɔ̀ Solomon wobi Rehobwam, Yuda wogyu-dɩrɛ, ma Isareli bete powu, ma Yuda, ma Benyamin boo-ifoli powu, ma bɛnɩ-kurumakyɛɛ fɔ alan, <verse eid="2CH 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 11:4" />&lt;Yahwe alɛ ɩ kara bʋn ɩ san ɩ ma kpà ma yɩɩwɔlɔn ɛbɛ Isareli bete fɔ. Ɛkamasɛ e biri ɛ san wɔ dɩkpaara, yema nmɩ na yɛ gɛ wʋ ba gɛlɛ.&gt; &gt;&gt; Okoro bɛ nʋn Yahwe wanyun-gyebi fɔ, gɛ ɛkamasɛ e biri ɛ da wɔ dɩkpaara, anlɛ gɛtɛ Yahwe wanyun-gyebi ɩ dɔ̀ fɔ.<verse eid="2CH 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Rehobwam e sere ɔpɔrɩ e silin Yuda atele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 11:5" />Rehobwam ɛ sara Yerusalem gɛ e sere ɩpɔrɩ e silin atele-dɩrɛ-dɩrɛ gɛtɛ ɩ̀ sa Yuda fɔ. <verse eid="2CH 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 11:6" />Atele fɔ n di, Betelehem, ma Etam, ma Tekwa, <verse eid="2CH 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 11:7" />ma Beti-Suri, ma Soko, ma Adulam, <verse eid="2CH 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 11:8" />ma Gati, ma Maresa, ma Sifi, <verse eid="2CH 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 11:9" />ma Adorayim, ma Lakisi, ma Aseka, <verse eid="2CH 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 11:10" />ma Sora, ma Ayalon, ma Hebron. <verse eid="2CH 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 11:11" />Rehobwam ɛ pɩna e sere ɩpɔrɩ gɛtɛ ɩ̀ ba ɔkɛma, gɛ e tiri bɩtà bʋʋ bɛndɩrɛ ɛ sɩ̀ ditele-kamasɛ daanɩ, gɛ ɛ sɩ̀ anyandilɛ ma bʋnɔ, ma bʋkan ditele-kamasɛ daanɩ. <verse eid="2CH 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 11:12" />Ɛ ka awɔrɔnyan panpasan-dɩyɛlɛ koro ma buturunyan ɛ sɩ̀ atele fɔ powu yaanɩ. Ɛ mɛ gɛlɛ ɛ ka ɛ sa yɩ ɔkɛma. Okoro Yuda ma Benyamin ntʋnkwaa bʋ yɛ bʋ̀ sa wɔ gatɩn.<verse eid="2CH 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 11:13" />Gɛ gedi gɩɩ bɛtɛlɛ ma Lefi bete powu gɛtɛ bɛ̀ sa Isareli gatɩn gɩɩ gɩlan fɔ bɛ ma fɩya ma Rehobwam. <verse eid="2CH 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 11:14" />Lefi bete fɔ gba be kere bɔɔ bɛnan baadikʋn ma baanyan bɛ ya, gɛ bɛ tɔ bɛ san Yuda ma Yerusalem yema Yerobwam ma wo bebi-teni bɛn tɛ bɛ osele bàà mɛ bɔɔ gʋtʋn anlɛ Yahwe gedi gɩɩ bɛtɛlɛ. <verse eid="2CH 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 11:15" />Gɛ Yerobwam e tiri ɛwɔ gbagba gedi gɩɩ bɛtɛlɛ gɛtɛ baà tɩ̀ mɛ gʋtʋn asʋmakʋn yaanɩ, fɔ bàà tɩ̀ tɛ bekpen gɛtɛ ɛ yɛ mɛ mara bɛ anlɛ begbebi ma akwɔbi fɔ gedi. <verse eid="2CH 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 11:16" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Isareli wo-ifoli powu yɩɩ bɛnɩ gɛtɛ bee len bàà sʋma Yahwe, Isareli wo Wurubwarɛ fɔ, bɛ tɛrɛma Lefi bete fɔ bɛ san Yerusalem bàà ma tɛ Yahwe, bootu ɛbɛ bɔɔ Wurubwarɛ fɔ gedi. <verse eid="2CH 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 11:17" />Bɛ sa Yuda bugyu fɔ ɔkɛma gɛ bɛ ka bɩkyan bisiyee bɛ kpà Solomon wobi Rehobwam, gɛ bɛ san Wurubwarɛ wosele waanɩ anlɛ gɛtɛ bɛ sara Dafidi ma Solomon baawi yaanɩ fɔ.<verse eid="2CH 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Rehobwam wodu wʋʋ bɛnɩ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 11:18" />Rehobwam e to Mahalati gɩna. Mahalati è di gɛ Dafidi wobi-teni Yerimoti wobi-nanɩ, gɛ wɔna n di Abihayili gɛtɛ è di Yese wobi-teni Eliyabi wobi-nanɩ fɔ. <verse eid="2CH 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 11:19" />E wo bebi-teni ɛ tɛ wɔ. Ɛbɛ n di Yehusi, ma Semariya, ma Saham. <verse eid="2CH 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 11:20" />Gamama fɔ, e to Abisalom wobi-nanɩ Maaka gɩna, gɛ e wo Abiya, ma Atayi, ma Sisa, ma Selomiti ɛ tɛ wɔ. <verse eid="2CH 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 11:21" />Rehobwam e len Abisalom wobi-nanɩ Maaka wade ɛ da wɔsɔ ɛbɛ, ma wodima ɛbɛ kurumakyɛɛ fɔ powu. Ɛwʋ powu waanɩ fɔ, Rehobwam e to bɛna fwo-nɩyɛ (18) ma be dɩma akpilin asiyee (60). Gɛ e wo bebi-teni dikpilin ma nɩyɛ (28), ma bebi-nanɩ akpilin asiyee (60).<verse eid="2CH 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 11:22" />Rehobwam ɛ mɛ Maaka wobi-teni Abiya egyegeyelɛ ɛ tɛ wɔdɩrɛ ma wonobi ɛbɛ, fɔ wàà wùlà alɛ ɛwɔ nan bè di bugyu. <verse eid="2CH 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 11:23" />Rehobwam ɛ mɛ gɛsɛyɩ, gɛ ɛ ka gʋtʋn ɛ sa-sa wo bebi-teni fɔ baalɔ, Yuda ma Benyamin baatele gɛtɛ bɛ mara ɩpɔrɩ be silin yɩ fɔ yaanɩ. Ɛ tɛ bɛ anyan gɛtɛ baà hiyan powu ma bɛna kpekpesi.<verse eid="2CH 11:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="2CH 12" />
  <para style="s1">Sisaki ɛ ma tà bɩtà ma Yuda watele</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="1KI 14:25-28">1 Begyu-dɩrɛ 14:25-28</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 12:1" />Gɛtɛ Rehobwam bugyu bu sere ɩkpaa gɛ e wura ɔkɛma fɔ, ɛwɔ ma Yuda bete powu be kere Yahwe wo-ise fɔ bɛ ya. <verse eid="2CH 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 12:2" />Gɛtɛ ben di nʋnkwarɩ tɛ Yahwe okoro, Egyipiti wogyu-dɩrɛ Sisaki ɛ kpà ma Yerusalem, egyu-dɩrɛ Rehobwam gɩkyan-tonfɛ gaanɩ. <verse eid="2CH 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 12:3" />Ɛ ka tiiramisan ɛbɛ ɩgbaa kooron (12,000) ma bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ gɛtɛ bɛ̀ gyaga abengyi asepekyi asiyee (60,000), ma bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ gɛtɛ bɛ̀ san gɛtʋnkwaa kpekpesi gɛtɛ Libiya bete, ma Suki bete, ma Etiyopiya bete bɛ̀ fɩya gɛtɛ baasɔ ɩ̀ ma ɔkʋna fɔ na fɩya ma ɛwɔ na ye Egyipiti na ba. <verse eid="2CH 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 12:4" />E gye Yuda watele ma ɔkɛma fɔ bɩtà fɔ ka ma ye Yerusalem.<verse eid="2CH 12:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 12:5" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Wurubwarɛ wɔtabʋrʋlɛ Semaya ɛ ba Rehobwam ma Yuda bɛndɩrɛ gɛtɛ be serenti be ye Sisaki wakʋn be be tuma Yerusalem fɔ baakʋn, gɛ ɛ dɔ̀ bɛ alan, &lt;&lt;Yahwe alan, &lt;I terema mɩ, wuu koro gɛ nkele na kere yɩ na ya na tɛ Sisaki.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="2CH 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 12:6" />Okoro Yuda bɛndɩrɛbi ma egyu-dɩrɛ bɛ warama koro gatɩn gɛ bɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Yahwe wade ɩ̀ dɔ!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2CH 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 12:7" />Gɛtɛ Yahwe e we alɛ bɛ warama koro gatɩn fɔ, ɛ tabʋrʋ ɛ tɛ Semaya alan, &lt;&lt;Gɛtɛ bɛ warama koro gatɩn wuu koro, Mɩn nan nɩ muru bɛ. Wʋn nan kyɛrɩ nan tɛ bɛ getoya. Mɩn nan nɩ yɛ Sisaki èè muru Yerusalem. <verse eid="2CH 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 12:8" />Mɔ fɔ, baà sara wɔ gatɩn bɛ sʋma wɔ, fɔ bàà we nyɩnla gefoma gɛtɛ gɩ̀ sa gɛsʋma mɩ, ma gɛtʋnkwaa gii begyu bɔɔ gɛsʋma yaanɩ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2CH 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 12:9" />Ɔkʋna gɛtɛ Egyipiti wogyu Sisaki ɛ bɛ tà Yerusalem bɩtà fɔ, e kpila anyan-gbaa-gbaa gɛtɛ ɩ̀ sa Yahwe Dikwo-dɩrɛ ma digyukpaara yaanɩ fɔ. Ɛ ka gɩnyan-kamasɛ, fɩya ma sɩka-sɩya wawɔrɔnyan panpasan-dɩyɛlɛ koro gɛtɛ Solomon ɛ mɛ fɔ powu. <verse eid="2CH 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 12:10" />Okoro egyu-dɩrɛ Rehobwam ɛ ka gɩwɔrɔyan-sɩya ɛ mɛ awɔrɔnyan panpasan-dɩyɛlɛ koro e sere sɩka-sɩya woyo fɔ yɩɩ bɩsɩrɩ. Gɛ ɛ ka yɩ ɛ sa bɛndɩrɛbi gɛtɛ bɛɛ dɩyɛ egyu-dɩrɛ dɩkpaara diitunu fɔ baalɔ. <verse eid="2CH 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 12:11" />Ɔya-kamasɛ gɛtɛ egyu-dɩrɛ ɛ̀ san Yahwe Dikwo-dɩrɛ daanɩ fɔ, bɛdɩyɛlɛ fɔ bɛɛ ka awɔrɔnya pansan-pansan-dɩyɛlɛ koro fɔ be ton, fɔ bɛ fɩya ma ɛwɔ bɛ san. Gengyi bè were fɔ, bee birima yɩ bɛ ma sɩ̀ bɛdɩyɛlɛ boo dikwo fɔ daanɩ.<verse eid="2CH 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 12:12" />Gɛtɛ Rehobwam ɛ warama koro gatɩn, okoro Yahwe e kere wowurufa-dɩrɛ fɔ ɛ ya, gɛ ɛn mini muru wɔ powu. Gɛ ade i pe ɩ tɛ Yuda.<verse eid="2CH 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 12:13" />Egyu-dɩrɛ Rehobwan i sere ɩkpaa Yerusalem gɛ ee di bugyu fɔ. Ɔkʋna gɛtɛ bɛ sɩ̀ wɔ bugyu fɔ ɛ̀ ba bɩkyan akpilin-anyɔɔ ma gɩkɩ (41), gɛ e di bugyu bɩkyan fwo-kwarankɩ Yerusalem, ditele gɛtɛ Yahwe e tiri e ye Isareli wo-ifoli powu yaanɩ ɛ sɩ̀ alɛ bàà tɩ̀ sʋma wɔ dʋkɔbɛ fɔ. Wɔna diyere n di Naama, gɛtɛ e ye Amon fɔ. <verse eid="2CH 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 12:14" />Rehobwam ɛ mɛ ade-kpen yema ɛn ka woturu bugiti Yahwe gelenbi.<verse eid="2CH 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 12:15" />Bɛ ŋwara ade-kurumakyɛɛ gɛtɛ Rehobwam ɛ mɛ, ye digyegeye daanɩ ma sere ɔkʋna fɔ bɛ sa Wurubwarɛ wɔtabʋrʋlɛ Semaya ma Wurubwarɛ wɔtabʋrʋlɛ Ido gɛtɛ ɛɛ nya gewo-tama gii-idu yii koro. Akpa ɩ bɔ ɩ sara Rehobwam ma Yerobwam boo getite gakpaakpa. <verse eid="2CH 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 12:16" />Rehobwam e ku gɛ be lò wɔ ɔkʋn gɛtɛ bee kpèlè Dafidi Ditele fɔ. Gɛ wobi Abiya e di bugyu e sere wɔ bʋsɩrɩ.<verse eid="2CH 12:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="2CH 13" />
  <para style="s1">Yuda wogyu Abiya</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="1KI 15:1-8">1 Begyu-dɩrɛ 15:1-8</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 13:1" />Egyu-dɩrɛ Yerobwam wo bugyu buu gedi wʋʋ gɩkyan fwo-nɩyɛfɛ gaanɩ fɔ, Abiya e di bugyu Yuda. <verse eid="2CH 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 13:2" />E di bugyu Yerusalem bɩkyan besiyee. Wɔna diyere n di Maaka, gɛtɛ è di Uriyeli gɛtɛ e ye Gibeya fɔ wobi-nanɩ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CH 13:2">Wʋ bɛ ba gɛtɛ bɩtà bʋ nʋ̀n Abiya ma Yerobwam boo getite. <verse eid="2CH 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 13:3" />Abiya ɛ ka bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtalɛ asepekyi dikpilin (400,000) gɛ Yerobwam mɔ ɛ ka wɔ bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtalɛ asepekyi akpilin anyɔɔ (800,000) gɛ bɛ ma tuma akpa.<verse eid="2CH 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 13:4" />Gɛtɛ Abiya ma wɔ bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ fɔ be gyu Efrayim wo-idon yɩɩ gɛtʋnkwaa gii koro fɔ, be yela Semarayim wodon wuu koro, gɛ Abiya e kpen ɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Yerobwam ma Isareli bete powu, ɩ nʋn maakʋn! <verse eid="2CH 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 13:5" />Ɩɩn nyɩ̀ alɛ Yahwe, Isareli wo Wurubwarɛ fɔ ɛ dama Dikola dɩɩ gɛtà gɛtɛ dɩ̀ sa gakpaakpa dii koro ɛ ka Isareli bugyu buu gedi ɛ tɛ Dafidi ma wodu wʋʋ bɛnɩ gakpaakpa loo? <verse eid="2CH 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 13:6" />Mɔ Nebati wobi-teni Yerobwam, gɛtɛ nafɔ è di Dafidi wobi Solomon wɔndɩrɛbi fɔ, ɛ tɔ e yela wofonte wo koro. <verse eid="2CH 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 13:7" />Gamama gɛtɛ Solomon wobi Rehobwam e di bugyu, gɛ ɛ̀ sangba è di ebi-sorobi gɛtɛ ɛn tɛ nyɩnla ade yaanɩ gepe èè terema ade gɛtɛ ɩɩn kɔlɔ fɔ, bɛnɩ gɛtɛ bɛn ma tɔnɔ, gɛ be silin Yerobwam be tuma fɔ, bɛ yɛ ɛwɔ ma ɛbɛ bɛ tɔ be yela Rehobwam wo koro.<verse eid="2CH 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 13:8" />&lt;&lt;Gɛ nkele yaamɩnlɛ ii wùlà yɩ alɛ yaà tɔ i yela ma Yahwe bugyu gɛtɛ ɛ ka ɛ sa Dafidi wodu wʋʋ bɛnɩ baalɔ fɔ? Wʋ̀ sa waanɩ gɛtɛ à ba bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ asɔ yaanɩ, gɛ à de akwɔbi gɛtɛ Yerobwam ɛ ka sɩka-sɩya ɛ mɛ bekpen ɛ tɛ yɩ fɔ. <verse eid="2CH 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 13:9" />A berema Yahwe gedi gɩɩ bɛtɛlɛ gɛtɛ bè di Aaron bebi ma Lefi bete fɔ, gɛ a sɩ̀ awɔ gbagba aa gedi gɩɩ bɛtɛlɛ anlɛ gɛtɛ bɩfɩɩ-kurumakyɛɛ bʋʋ mɛ fɔ. Ɛnɩ-kamasɛ gɛtɛ ee len ɛ̀ɛ̀ mɛ bekpen fɔ boo gedi gɩɩtɛlɛ fɔ, ɛ̀ bɔ ɛ ka ɛkwɔ ma bɛyɛran-teni kwarankɩ ɛ ba fɔ, e bilingi bekpen boo gedi gɩɩtɛlɛ, nka Wurubwarɛ gedi gɩɩtɛlɛ.<verse eid="2CH 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 13:10" />&lt;&lt;Ɛtɩ bɩrɛ, Yahwe n di tii Wurubwarɛ, gɛ tɩn nan kere wɔ gɛtɛrɛma tɩ ya. Gedi gɩɩ bɛtɛlɛ gɛtɛ bɛɛ mɛ Yahwe gʋtʋn fɔ bè di gɛ Aaron bebi, gɛ Lefi bete bɛɛ kpa bɛ. <verse eid="2CH 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 13:11" />Gagyɩgyan ma ɔgyɔlɔ-kamasɛ bɛɛ tɛ-tɛ Yahwe gekuma gedi, bee kuma olifwi-kpara bɛ tɛ Yahwe. Bɛɛ ka boroboro bɛ sɩ̀ ɔkpʋlɔ-fɩrɩnfɩrɩn wuu koro, fɔ bɛ kyangɩ bɛkandɩya gɛtɛ bɛ̀ gyaga sɩka-sɩya bɛkandɩya bɔɔ gɛgyagakʋn gii koro ɔgyɔlɔ-kamasɛ. Tɩɩ mɛ ade wùlàlɛ gɛtɛ Yahwe, tii Wurubwarɛ e wùlà alɛ tɩ mɛ fɔ. Mɔ i fi gama i ten wɔ. <verse eid="2CH 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 13:12" />Wurubwarɛ ɛ̀ sa ma ɛtɩ. Ɛwɔ n di tiigyegeyelɛ. Wo gedi gɩɩ bɛtɛlɛ bè de baakantan fɔ. Baà fʋ̀n yɩ be kpèlè bàà bɛ̀ tà bɩtà ma ɛyɩ. Oo Isareli bete, ɩ kara kpà ma Yahwe, yiitu ɛbɛ boo Wurubwarɛ, yema ɩn nan talɩ i di wo koro.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2CH 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 13:13" />Mɔ fɔ, Yerobwam ɛ sa wɔ bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ fɔ baakpi ɩkɩ bɛ ma bu Yuda bete bɔɔ gama ɔkankɩ. Gɛ bekurumakyɛɛ mɔ be ye bɛ sʋ bɛ bʋnʋn-bʋnʋn. <verse eid="2CH 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 13:14" />Yuda bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ be fi bɛ nya fɔ, be we gɛtɛ bɛ sʋ bɛ sa bʋnʋn ma gama. Gɛ be wula be kpèlè Yahwe, gɛ gedi gɩɩ bɛtɛlɛ fɔ be fʋ̀n baakantan. <verse eid="2CH 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 13:15" />Gɛ Yuda bete bɛɛ gbɛrɛ akpa yaafala kin-kin. Gɛtɛ bɛɛ gbɛrɛɛ akpa yaafala fɔ, Yahwe ɛ yɛ Abiya ma Yuda bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ fɔ bee di Yerobwam ma Isareli bete powu boo koro. <verse eid="2CH 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 13:16" />Isareli bete be serenti be ye Yuda bete bɔɔ bʋnʋn, gɛ Wurubwarɛ ɛ yɛ Yuda bete fɔ be di Isareli bete boo koro. <verse eid="2CH 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 13:17" />Abiya ma wɔ bɛnɩ be wolo Isareli bɛnɩ asepekyi dikpilin ma ton (500,000) gɛtɛ bɛ nyɩ̀ bɩtà bʋʋ gɛtà gepepe. <verse eid="2CH 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 13:18" />Gɛ Yuda bete be di Isareli bete boo koro, yema bɛ ka bɔɔ bʋnʋn bɛ gyaga Yahwe, bootu ɛbɛ boo Wurubwarɛ fɔ wo koro.<verse eid="2CH 13:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 13:19" />Abiya ɛ kpà ɛ gyaga Yerobwam wo koro, gɛ e to Beteli, ma Yesana, ma Efron baatele, fɩya ma yaatelebi gɛtɛ i silin yɩ i tuma fɔ. <verse eid="2CH 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 13:20" />Yerobwam ɛ mini wura ɔkɛma yela Abiya waawi yaanɩ. Gɛ Yahwe ɛ gbɛrɛ wɔ ɛ fɩna gɛ e ku.<verse eid="2CH 13:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 13:21" />Abiya bɩrɛ, ɛ dan ma ɔkɛma. Gɛ e to bɛna fwo-bɛnaa, gɛ e wo bebi-teni dikpilin ma bɛnyɔɔ, ma bebi-nanɩ fwo-kooron.<verse eid="2CH 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 13:22" />Bɛ ŋwara Abiya bugyu baade-kurumakyɛɛ, ma ade gɛtɛ ɛ mɛ, ma ade gɛtɛ ɛ dɔ̀ fɔ bɛ sa Wurubwarɛ wɔtabʋrʋlɛ Ido wo koro gaade yɩɩ gɩkpa gaanɩ.<verse eid="2CH 13:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="2CH 14" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 14:1" />Gɛ Abiya e ku gɛ be lò wɔ ɔkʋn gɛtɛ bee kpèlè Dafidi ditele fɔ daanɩ. Gɛ wobi-teni Asa e di bugyu e sere wɔ bɩsɩrɩ. Asa bugyu buu gedi gaawi yaanɩ fɔ, olila wʋ sara gɩfɩɩ fɔ gaanɩ bɩkyan fwo.<verse eid="2CH 14:1" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yuda wogyu Asa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 14:2" />Asa ɛ mɛ ade gɛtɛ ɩ̀ kɔlɔ, gɛ ɩ̀ tʋna Yahwe, wɔ Wurubwarɛ bʋnʋn. <verse eid="2CH 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 14:3" />E tiri bendeni boo bekpen boo gedi gaatɛkʋn fɔ, ma asʋmakʋn fɔ, gɛ e gbena akpen-taa fɔ, gɛ e kebi Asera wo-iyon fɔ ɛ fɩna. <verse eid="2CH 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 14:4" />Gɛ Asa ɛ dɔ̀ Yuda bete alɛ bɛ tɛrɛma Yahwe, bootu ɛbɛ boo Wurubwarɛ fɔ gelenbi, fɔ bàà di wo-ise ma wade-wùlàlɛ fɔ. <verse eid="2CH 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 14:5" />E tiri asʋmakʋn ma gedi gaatɛkʋn gɛtɛ bee kuma olifwi yii koro bɛ tɛ bekpen fɔ e ye ditele-kamasɛ gɛtɛ dɩ̀ sa Yuda gaanɩ, okoro olila wʋ sara wo bugyu buu gedi baanɩ. <verse eid="2CH 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 14:6" />Gɛ e sere ɩpɔrɩ e silin Yuda atele olila wʋʋya wʋtɔkɔ waanɩ. Gɛ bɩkyan kpekpesi baanɩ fɔ, wɔkyʋnlɛ ɛkɩ ɛn mɛ amɩnlɛ alɛ ɛɛ̀ tà bɩtà ma ɛwɔ, yema Yahwe ɛ tɛ wɔ olila.<verse eid="2CH 14:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 14:7" />Asa ɛ̀ dɔ̀ Yuda bɛnɩ alan, &lt;&lt; Ɩ yɛ taà mara atele nyayɩ, fɔ tàà sere ɩpɔrɩ tɩ sa yɩ, fɔ tàà mara ayelakʋn-dɩyɛlɛ, ma itunu gɛtɛ taà sa yɩ awɔrɔnyan. Gɛtʋnkwaa fɔ gì di tiiyo, yema tɩ mɛ Yahwe, tii Wurubwarɛ fɔ gelenbi, gɛ ɛ yɛ olila wʋ ba wʋ tɛ tɩ. Okoro be sere atele fɔ, gɛ ade ɩ san gepe ɩ tɛ bɛ.<verse eid="2CH 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 14:8" />Asa ɛ ka bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ asepekyi fwo-ton (300,000) e ye Yuda gɛtɛ bè de awɔrɔnyan-dɩyɛlɛ-koro ma buturunyan, gɛ ɛ ka bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ asepekyi fwo-anaa (280,000) e ye Benyamin gɛtɛ bè de awɔrɔnyan-dɩyɛlɛ-koro ma bɔɔ bɛgyangarɩ. Bɛnɩ nyabɛ powu bè di bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtɛlɛ gɛtɛ bɛ̀ ba oturu gepepe.<verse eid="2CH 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 14:9" />Gɛ Etiyopiya-te Sera ɛ ka bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ dɩtɩnpan, ma tiiramisan ɛbɛ gɛkpɩn ma akpilin-ton (300) bàà ma kpà ma Yuda bete. Gɛ bɛ san bɛ ma gyu sɩyɛɛ Maresa. <verse eid="2CH 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 14:10" />Gɛ Asa ma wɔ bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ bɛ ma tuma bɛ bàà tà bɩtà. Ɛkamasɛ ɛ pɩna koro e yela ɛ tɛ akpa Sefata dɩtagba daanɩ gbɛma Maresa.<verse eid="2CH 14:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 14:11" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Asa e tiri onyun ɛ tɛ Yahwe, wo Wurubwarɛ alan, &lt;&lt;Ɛkɩ ɛn ma anlɛ awɔ gɛtɛ eè to ɛfɔbɩlɩlɛ e ye ɛkɛmalɛ gʋlɔ gaanɩ. Oo Yahwe, tii Wurubwarɛ, kpà tɩ, yema tɩɩ bʋnʋn bʋ̀ gyaga gɛ aa koro, gɛ aa diyere daanɩ gɛ tɩ ba tàà bɛ tà bɩtà ma bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ dɩtɩnpan nyadɩ lɛ. Oo Yahwe, awɔ n di tii Wurubwarɛ, kara yɛ ɛnɩ èè di aa koro.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2CH 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 14:12" />Gɛ Yahwe ɛ yɛ Yuda bete be di Etiyopiya bete fɔ boo koro, gɛ Etiyopiya bete fɔ be serenti. <verse eid="2CH 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 14:13" />Gɛ Asa ma wɔ bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ bɛ kpà bɛ gyaga boo koro bɛ ma ye sɩyɛɛ Gera. Etiyopiya bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ fɔ powu be ku. Yahwe ma wɔ bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ be di boo koro. Gɛ Yuda bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ fɔ be kpila anyan kpekpesi bɛ da. <verse eid="2CH 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 14:14" />Ɛwʋ gɛ bɛ muru atele gɛtɛ i silin Gera i tuma fɔ powu, gɛ Yahwe ɛ yɛ gɩsaa gɩ̀ gyu bɛ. Gɛ Yuda bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ fɔ be kpila anyan kpekpesi gɛtɛ ɩ̀ sa atele fɔ yaanɩ fɔ powu. <verse eid="2CH 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 14:15" />Be biri bɛ kpà ma bɛnan boo betonlɛ ma bɔɔ bɛnan gɛtɛ bɛ̀ sa getitebi dʋkɔ fɔ, gɛ be gye bɔɔ bɛyɛran, ma begbebi, ma akpɔŋɔ kpekpesi. Gɛ be biri bɛ da Yerusalem.<verse eid="2CH 14:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="2CH 15" />
  <para style="s1">Asa e foma ade</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 15:1" />Ɔya wʋkɩ waanɩ fɔ, Wurubwarɛ Gifiye gɩ ba Odedi wobi Asariya wo koro. <verse eid="2CH 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 15:2" />Gɛ ɛ san ɛ ma tuma egyu Asa, gɛ ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Egyu Asa ma Yuda ma Benyamin bɛnɩ powu, ɩ nʋn maakʋn, Yahwe ɛ̀ sa ma ɛyɩ ɔya-kamasɛ gɛtɛ ɛyɩ mɔ ɩ̀ sa ma ɛwɔ fɔ. Gengyi ɩ̀ ka yɩɩ bʋnʋn ɩ gyaga wo koro fɔ, ɛɛ̀ kpà yɩ. Mɔ gengyi ì fi gama i ten wɔ fɔ, eè fi gama i ten yi. <verse eid="2CH 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 15:3" />Ɔya kpekpesi wʋ lɛ gɛtɛ Isareli bete bɛn nyɩ̀ nʋnkwarɩ wo Wurubwarɛ fɔ, gɛ bɛn ma gedi gɩɩtɛlɛ ɛkɩ gɛtɛ èè wùlà bɛ ade, gɛ bɛn ma ose wʋkɩ. <verse eid="2CH 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 15:4" />Mɔ bɔɔ dɩyɩyɛ daanɩ fɔ be fi bɛ ba Yahwe, Isareli wo Wurubwarɛ wakʋn, be bugiti wɔ gɛ be we wɔ. <verse eid="2CH 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 15:5" />Awi ɩtɔkɔ yaanɩ fɔ, wʋ̀ ba gɩsaa gɛtɛ ɛkɩ ɛ̀ɛ̀ san osele fɔ èè biri ba olila waanɩ, yema ade-karankaran ɩ̀ sa gɛtʋnkwaa fɔ gɩɩkʋn-kamasɛ. <verse eid="2CH 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 15:6" />Gɩfɩɩ gɩkɩ gɩɩ nyanla gɩfɩɩ-do, fɔ ditele dɩkɩ dɩɩ nyanla ditele-do. Yema Wurubwarɛ è de dɩfana-kamasɛ ɛɛ nyanla bɛ. <verse eid="2CH 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 15:7" />Mɔ ɛyɩ bɩrɛ, ɩ sa koro ɔkɛma, fɔ yàà wura oturu, yema yaà wura yɩɩ gʋtʋn gii gutoro gii gele.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2CH 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 15:8" />Gɛtɛ Asa ɛ nʋn gɛlɛ gaade nyayɩ, ma ade gɛtɛ Wurubwarɛ ɛ dama Odedi wobi Asariya wo koro ɛ tabʋrʋ fɔ, e wura koro ɔkɛma. Gɛ e tiri bekpen gɛtɛ wù di Yahwe wade-kyʋnlɛ gɛtɛ bɛ̀ sa Yuda ma Benyamin ntʋnkwaa powu baanɩ, ma atele gɛtɛ e gye yɩ bɩtà, gɛ ɩ̀ sa Efrayim wo-idon yii koro fɔ yaanɩ. Gɛ ɛ pɩna Yahwe gedi gɩɩ gɛtɛ̀kʋn gɛtɛ gɩ̀ sa Dikwo-dɩrɛ dɩɩ dɩkpaara dii getite fɔ.<verse eid="2CH 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 15:9" />Bɛnɩ kpekpesi be ye Efrayim, ma Manase, ma Simeyon boo-ifoli yaanɩ bɛ bɛ fɩya ma egyu-dɩrɛ Asa, gɛ bɛ sara ma ɛwɔ. Yema be we gɛtɛ Yahwe, Asa wo Wurubwarɛ fɔ ɛ̀ sa ma ɛwɔ. Gɛ Asa ɛ kʋla bɛ powu ma Yuda bɛnɩ ma Benyamin bɛnɩ.<verse eid="2CH 15:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 15:10" />Be tuma Yerusalem Asa bugyu buu gedi bʋʋ gɩkyan fwo-tonfɛ, giibon-siyeefɛ wanɩ. <verse eid="2CH 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 15:11" />Ɔya wʋtɔkɔ waanɩ fɔ, bɛ ka bɛkwɔ nkpɩn bisiyee ma akpilin-ton (700), ma bɛyɛran ɩgbaa isiyee ma nkpɩn-ton (7,000), ma begbebi gɛtɛ be kpila be ye akpa yaanɩ bɛ ba fɔ, bɛ tɛ Yahwe gedi. <verse eid="2CH 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 15:12" />Gɛ bɛ tà dikola gɛtɛ baà ka booturu ma bɔɔkala powu bɛ sʋma Yahwe, bootu ɛbɛ boo Wurubwarɛ fɔ. <verse eid="2CH 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 15:13" />Ebi oo, ɛndɩrɛ oo, eteni oo, ɛnanɩ oo, ɛnɩ-kamasɛ gɛtɛ ɛn nan sʋma Yahwe, Isareli wo Wurubwarɛ fɔ, baà wolo wɔ. <verse eid="2CH 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 15:14" />Gɛ bɛ ka gɩta-dɩrɛ bɛ kan ntam Yahwe diyere daanɩ alɛ baà di dikola fɔ dii koro, gɛ be fʋn akantan ma bɛnan baayela. <verse eid="2CH 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 15:15" />Yuda bɛnɩ powu be di ɔsɛ dikola gɛtɛ bɛ tà fɔ dii koro, yema bɛ tà dɩ booturu powu waanɩ. Bɛ ka ɔsɛ bɛ sʋma Yahwe, gɛ ɛ nʋn bɛ, gɛ ɛ tɛ bɛ olila ofèn-kamasɛ.<verse eid="2CH 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 15:16" />Nkele mɔ Egyu-dɩrɛ Asa e tɔ̀là wonu Maaka gɛtɛ è di egyu-nanɩ fɔ gɛbɩya, yema e sere ekpen Asera wo-iyon gɛtɛ wù di ade-kyʋnlɛ. Asa e kebi wʋ ɛ fɩna gɛ e kuma wʋ Kidiron dɩtagba daanɩ. <verse eid="2CH 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 15:17" />Ma gɛtɛ Asa en tiri asʋmakʋn gɛtɛ ɩ̀ sa Isareli dʋkɔbɛ gba fɔ, ɛ ka waamɩnlɛ powu ɛ gyaga gɛ Yahwe wo koro wɔnkpa awi powu yaanɩ. <verse eid="2CH 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 15:18" />Ɛ ka sɩka-fututu ma sɩka-sɩya ma anyan-gbaa-gbaa gɛtɛ ɛwɔ ma wote ɛbɛ bɛ ka bɛ tɛ Yahwe fɔ ɛ ba Yahwe Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ daanɩ.<verse eid="2CH 15:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 15:19" />Okoro akpa ɩkɩ ɩn mɩnɩ sere ka ma ye wo bugyu buu gedi buu gɩkyan dikpilin ma fwo-tonfɛ gaanɩ.<verse eid="2CH 15:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="2CH 16" />
  <para style="s1">Asa wawi-kurumakyɛɛ</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="1KI 15:17-22">1 Begyu-dɩrɛ 15:17-22</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 16:1" />Asa bugyu buu gedi bʋʋ bɩkyan dikpilin ma fwo-kooronfɛ gaanɩ fɔ, Isareli wogyu Baasa ma wɔ bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ bɛ ma sʋ Yuda bɛ sa, gɛ bɛ sere ɔpɩ bɛɛ mara ɔpɔrɩ bɛ sa Rama ditele anlɛ gɛtɛ waà mɛ gɛ ɛnɩ ɛkɩ ɛn nan talɩ e gyu, abɛɛ èè ye ɔkʋn gɛtɛ Yuda wogyu Asa ee di bugyu fɔ.<verse eid="2CH 16:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 16:2" />Gɛ Asa ɛ ka sɩka-fututu ma sɩka-sɩya gɛtɛ wʋ̀ sa sɩka gɛsɩkʋn Yahwe Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ daanɩ ma ɛwɔ gbagba digyu-kpaara diiyo, gɛ ɛ ka wʋ ɛ ma tɛ Aram wogyu Ben-Hadadi gɛtɛ ee di bugyu Damasiko fɔ, gɛ ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ alan, <verse eid="2CH 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 16:3" />&lt;&lt;Yɛ nmɩ ma awɔ taà tà dikola, anlɛ gɛtɛ aate ma miinte bɛ sara fɔ. Nya n de sɩka-fututu ma sɩka-sɩya ntɛ tɩyɛma wɔ̀, fɔ àà kebi dikola gɛtɛ a ta ma Isareli wogyu Baasa fɔ, fɔ èè kere bɩtà bʋʋ gɛtà ma nmɩ ɛ ya.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2CH 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 16:4" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Ben-Hadadi e yera egyu-dɩrɛ Asa wade fɔ, gɛ ɛ sa wɔ bɩtà bʋʋ bɛndɩrɛ Isareli watele-dɩrɛ-dɩrɛ yaanɩ. Gɛ e gye Iyon ditele, ma Dan, Abeli-Beti-Maaka, ma Kinereti fɩya ma Nafitali watele-sɩ̀lɛ-anyan powu bɩtà. <verse eid="2CH 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 16:5" />Ɔya gɛtɛ Baasa ɛ nʋn ade nyayɩ fɔ, e kere Rama ditele dɩɩpɔrɩ fɔ wuu gesere ɛ ya, gɛ e kere wɔ gʋtʋn fɔ ɛ ya. <verse eid="2CH 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 16:6" />Gɛ Egyu-dɩrɛ Asa ɛ kʋla Yuda beteni powu. Gɛ ɛ yɛ bɛ be tola ataa, ma iyon atoo-atoo gɛtɛ Baasa è de ee sere ɔpɔrɩ e Rama ditele fɔ, gɛ egyu-dɩrɛ Asa ɛ ma ka yɩ e sere e silin Geba ma Misipa atele.<verse eid="2CH 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 16:7" />Ɔya wʋtɔkɔ waanɩ fɔ, Wurubwarɛ wɔtabʋrʋlɛ Hanani ɛ bɛ dɔ̀ Yuda wogyu Asa alan &lt;&lt;Gɛtɛ a ka bʋnʋn a gyaga gɛ Aram wogyu wo koro, gɛ a kere Yahwe, aa Wurubwarɛ fɔ a ya okoro, gedi gɛtɛ nafɔ aà di Aram bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ boo koro fɔ wʋ gbɛrɛ wɔ. <verse eid="2CH 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 16:8" />Nka Etiyopiya bete, ma Libiya bete n di bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ ma ɔkɛma gɛtɛ bɛ̀ ba tiiramisan ɛbɛ ma abengyi yɩɩ bɛsaralɛ kpekpesi fɔ? Mɔ gɛtɛ a ka aa bʋnʋn a gyaga Yahwe wo koro fɔ, ɛ yɛ wɔ a di boo koro. <verse eid="2CH 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 16:9" />Yema Yahwe ee we gɛtʋnkwaa powu gii koro, gɛ ɛɛ sa ɛbɛ gɛtɛ bɛ ka booturu powu bɛ tɛ wɔ fɔ ɔkɛma. A mɛ anyimapu-de, okoro ye ǹdò san baà tɩ̀ tà bɩtà ma awɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2CH 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 16:10" />Ade nyayɩ ɩ yɛ Asa ɛ ka owurufa Wurubwarɛ wɔtabʋrʋlɛ fɔ wo koro, gɛ e gye wɔ ɛ tan dikwo. Ɔkʋna wʋtɔkɔ ke gɛ Asa e sere ɔpɩ ɛɛ nyanla bɛnɩ fɔ bɛkɩ gɛnyanla-kpen.<verse eid="2CH 16:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 16:11" />Bɛ ŋwara Asa bugyu baade, ye digyegeye ma sere ɔkʋna powu bɛ sa Yuda ma Isareli begyu boo koro gaanɩ yɩɩ gɩkpa gaanɩ. <verse eid="2CH 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 16:12" />Asa bugyu buu gedi bʋʋ gɩkyan dikpilin ma fwo-yɛkɩfɛ gaanɩ fɔ, geyeba gɩkɩ gɩ gbɛrɛ wɔ gɩsɩrɩ. Ma gɛtɛ wo geyeba fɔ giinyun gɩ mɛ ɔkɛma gba fɔ, en lila gɛkpà ye Yahwe wakʋn, mɔ fɔ, e len geyeba-kya e ye gɛ geyeba gɩɩ bɛkyalɛ booko baakʋn. <verse eid="2CH 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 16:13" />Gɛ Asa e ku wo bugyu buu gedi wʋ̀ bɩkyan akpilin anyɔɔ ma gɩkɩfɛ gaanɩ. <verse eid="2CH 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 16:14" />Gɛ be lò wɔ gɩsàn gɛtɛ ɛ pɩna ɛ sɩ̀ ɛ tɛ ɛwɔ gbagba wo koro fɔ gaanɩ, ɔkʋn gɛtɛ bee kpèlè Dafidi Ditele daanɩ. Bɛ ka wɔ bɛ dʋrɔ npa wo koro, gɛ bɛ ka anyan ma ofen, ma bʋnɔ ma ofen bɛ sʋrʋ wɔ, gɛ bɛ sa ɔtan-dɩrɛ wʋkɩ bɛ ka be wula wɔ.<verse eid="2CH 16:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="2CH 17" />
  <para style="s1">Yuda wogyu Yehosafati</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 17:1" />Asa wobi Yehosafati e di bugyu e sere wote gɩsɩrɩ, gɛ ɛ sa wo bugyu buu gedikʋn fɔ ɔkɛma gepepe gɛtɛ bàà talɩ be yela ma Isareli gɩfɩɩ. <verse eid="2CH 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 17:2" />Ɛ sɩ̀-sɩ̀ bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ Yuda watele ma ɔkɛma fɔ yaanɩ, gɛ e sere bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ baasarakʋn Yuda ma Efrayim atele gɛtɛ wote Asa ɛ kpà e to fɔ yaanɩ.<verse eid="2CH 17:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 17:3" />Yahwe ɛ sara ma Yehosafati yema ɔkʋna gɛtɛ e sere wo bugyu buu gedi fɔ, ɛ tɛrɛma wotu Dafidi bɩsɩrɩ. Ɛn sʋma Baali wokpen. <verse eid="2CH 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 17:4" />Mɔ fɔ, ɛ sʋma gɛ wotu wo Wurubwarɛ gɛ e di wo-ise yii koro. Ɛn tɛrɛma Isareli begyu baade-mɛlɛ. <verse eid="2CH 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 17:5" />Gɛlɛ wuu koro Yahwe ɛ yɛ Yehosafati bugyu bu sere ɩkpaa, gɛ bɛnɩ powu gɛtɛ bɛ̀ sa Yuda fɔ bɛ bɛ kyɛ wɔ anyan gɛ wʋ yɛ wɔ e wura koro gaanyan gepepe ma gebù. <verse eid="2CH 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 17:6" />Ɛ ka woturu powu ɛ tɛrɛma Yahwe wo-isele, gɛ nkele mɔ, e ni tiri asʋmakʋn ma Asera wo-iyon gɛtɛ ɩ̀ sa Yuda fɔ.<verse eid="2CH 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 17:7" />Yehosafati bugyu buu gedi bʋʋ gɩkyan-siyeefɛ gaanɩ fɔ, ɛ sa wɔ bɛndɩrɛbi Ben-Hayili, ma Obadiya, ma Sekariya, ma Netaneli, ma Mikayiya alɛ bɛ ma wùlà ade Yuda watele yaanɩ. <verse eid="2CH 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 17:8" />Ɛ sa Semayiya, ma Netaniya, ma Sebadiya, ma Asaheli, ma Semiramoti, ma Yehonatan, ma Adoniya, ma Tobiya ma Tobi-Adoniya gɛtɛ bè di Lefi bete fɔ, fɩya ma gedi gɩɩ bɛtɛlɛ Elisama ma Yehoram. <verse eid="2CH 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 17:9" />Gɛ bɛ ka Yahwe wo-ise yɩɩ gɩkpa fɔ be silin be wùlà bɛnɩ ade Yuda watele powu yaanɩ.<verse eid="2CH 17:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 17:10" />Gɛ Yahwe ɛ yɛ gɩsaa gi gyu bugyu-bugyu baadikʋn gɛtɛ bu silin Yuda bu tuma powu fɔ, gɛtɛ bɛn mɩnɩ ma kpà ma Yehosafati. <verse eid="2CH 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 17:11" />Filisiti bete bɛkɩ bɛ ka anyan-kyɛlɛ ɩkɩ, ma gɩkyan-gɩkyan gɩɩ sɩka-fututu-tolɛ bɛ mɔma Yehosafati. Gɛ Arabi bete bɛ ka bɛyɛran-teni ɩgbaa isiyee ma nkpɩn nɩyɛ ma akpilin ton (7,700), ma begbebi ɩgbaa isiyee ma nkpɩn nɩyɛ ma akpilin ton (7,700) bɛ bɛ kyɛ wɔ.<verse eid="2CH 17:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 17:12" />Okoro Yehosafati ɛ̀ bɔ ee wura ɔkɛma ɛ fɩya, gɛ e sere atele gɛtɛ bɛ mara ɩpɔrɩ be silin yi ma atele sɩ̀lɛ anyan Yuda gɩfɩɩ gaanɩ. <verse eid="2CH 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 17:13" />Yaanɩ gɛ bɛɛ sɩ̀ baanyan kpekpesi, gɛ ɛ ka bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ gɛtɛ bɛ̀ nyɩ̀ bɩtà baanɩ gepepe fɔ ɛ sɩ̀ Yerusalem. <verse eid="2CH 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 17:14" />Ofoli-kamasɛ wuu be gyegeyelɛ, ma wʋʋ bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ baasɔ ntɛ ba lɛ.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2CH 17:14">Ye Yuda wofoli waanɩ fɔ, Adina na mɛ bɩtà bʋʋndɩrɛ gɛtɛ ɛ nya bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ asepekyi fwo-ton (300,000) boo koro.<verse eid="2CH 17:14" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 17:15" />Ɛndɩrɛ-nyɔɔfɛ n di Yehohanan gɛtɛ ɛɛ nya bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ asepekyi fwo-anaa (280,000) boo koro fɔ,<verse eid="2CH 17:15" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 17:16" />gɛ ɛndɩrɛ-siyeefɛ fɔ n di Sikiri wobi Amasiya gɛtɛ ɛ ka koro ɛ tɛ Yahwe gʋtʋn gɩɩ gɛmɛ fɔ, gɛ ɛ nya bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ asepekyi fwo (200,000) boo koro.<verse eid="2CH 17:16" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 17:17" />Benyamin wofoli wʋʋ bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ baasɔ ɩ̀ ba asepekyi fwo (200,000), gɛ bè de bɩsɩnta ma awɔrɔnyan-dɩyɛlɛ koro. Bɔɔndɩrɛ n di Eliyada, gɛ ɛ̀ ba oturu.<verse eid="2CH 17:17" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 17:18" />Wɔnyɔɔfɛ n di Yehosabadi gɛtɛ ɛɛ nya bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ asepekyi yɛkɩ anaa (180,000) gɛtɛ bɛ pɩna koro gepepe tɛ bɩtà fɔ boo koro.<verse eid="2CH 17:18" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 17:19" />Nyabɛ n di bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ gɛtɛ bɛ sʋma egyu Yerusalem, fɩya ma bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ gɛtɛ ɛ sɩ̀ Yuda watele ma ɔkɛma yaanɩ fɔ.<verse eid="2CH 17:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="2CH 18" />
  <para style="s1">Yehosafati e terema ade ɛ tɛ Ahabi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="1KI 22:1-28">1 Begyu-dɩrɛ 22:1-28</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 18:1" />Yuda wogyu Yehosafati e wura koro gaanyan gepepe ma gebù, gɛ ɛ yɛ ɛwɔ ma Isareli wogyu Ahabi bɛ dɔ̀ be yera gɛtɛ wɔ dɩkpaara dɩɩnɩ gɩna. <verse eid="2CH 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 18:2" />Bɩkyan bɛrɛɛ bʋkɩ bʋʋ gama fɔ, Yehosafati ɛ san ɛ ma silin Ahabi Samariya ditele daanɩ. Gɛ Ahabi e wolo bɛyɛran ma bɛkwɔ kpekpesi e kpele anyandilɛ e to Yehosafati ma bɛnɩ gɛtɛ bɛ fɩya ma ɛwɔ fɔ. Gɛ Ahabi ɛ fɔ Yehosafati alɛ ɛ bɛ kpà wɔ baà kpà ma Ramoti-Gileyadi. <verse eid="2CH 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 18:3" />Ahabi e lila Yehosafati alan, &lt;&lt;Aà fɩya ma nmɩ nan ma kpà ma Ramoti-Gileyadi?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CH 18:3">Ɛwʋ gɛ Yehosafati e tiri wuunyun alan, &lt;&lt;Miinyo wù di aayo, gɛ mɩɩn bɛnɩ bè di aa bɛnɩ. Taà fɩya ma awɔ tɩ ma kpà. <verse eid="2CH 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 18:4" />Gɛ Yehosafati e biri ɛ dɔ̀ Isareli wogyu Ahabi alan, &lt;&lt;Gyegeye lila Yahwe gelenbi pɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2CH 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 18:5" />Okoro Isareli wogyu-dɩrɛ ɛ kʋla Wurubwarɛ bɛtabʋrʋlɛ fɔ powu gɛtɛ baà mɛ anlɛ bɛnɩ nkpɩn bʋnyɔɔ (400), gɛ e lila bɛ alan, &lt;&lt;N san n ma kpà ma Ramoti-Gileyadi ditele, abɛɛ n kara n san?&gt;&gt; Gɛ Be tiri wuunyun alan, &lt;&lt;San, yema Yahwe ɛɛ̀ ka dɩ ɛ sa awɔ egyu-dɩrɛ aa gʋlɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2CH 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 18:6" />Mɔ Yehosafati e lila alan, &lt;&lt;Yahwe wɔtabʋrʋlɛ ɛkɩ ɛn mɩnɩ ma fɩya gɛtɛ taà lila ti ye wakʋn?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2CH 18:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 18:7" />Gɛ Isareli wogyu e tiri wuunyun ɛ tɛ Yehosafati alan, &lt;&lt;Ɛkɩ ɛ̀ sangba ɛ̀ sa gɛtɛ taà talɩ ti lila wɔ Yahwe gelenbi, mɔ n tɛ kyʋn wɔ, yema ɛn tɛ dɔ̀ ade-kpara ka dama miin koro nya, mɔ ɔya-kamasɛ fɔ, ade-kpen yiiko-yiiko gɛ ɛɛ dɔ̀. Ɛwɔ n di Imila wobi Mikaya.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CH 18:7">Gɛ Yehosafati ɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Egyu-dɩrɛ Ahabi, kara dɔ̀ gɛlɛ!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2CH 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 18:8" />Okoro Isareli wogyu ɛ sa wɔsaranyan ɛkɩ alan, &lt;&lt;San ma ka Imila wobi Mikaya ba nfan nkenkele.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2CH 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 18:9" />Fɔ Isareli wogyu Ahabi, ma Yuda wogyu Yehosafati bɛ̀ sa baagyu-nyan bè si bugyu-bɩya buu koro ɔkʋn gɛtɛ bee tiba afabi Samariya ditele diitunu-yon fɔ. Fɔ bɛtabʋrʋlɛ fɔ powu bè si bɔɔ bʋnʋn bɛɛ tabʋrʋ. <verse eid="2CH 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 18:10" />Gɛ Baanɩ ɛkɩ gɛtɛ bee kpèlè wɔ alɛ Sedekiya gɛ wote n di Kenaana fɔ, ɛ mɛ awɔrɔnyan yaakantan, gɛ ɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Yahwe ɛɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;Akantan nyayɩ gɛ aà ka a kpà ma Siriya bete ma sere gɛtɛ aà muru bɛ.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="2CH 18:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 18:11" />Bɛtabʋrʋlɛ-do fɔ powu bɛɛ dɔ̀ gɛ ade-kɩlɩn alan, &lt;&lt;Ma kpà ma Ramoti-Gileyadi ditele, fɔ àà di dii koro, yema Yahwe ɛɛ̀ ka di ɛ sa egyu-dɩrɛ gʋlɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2CH 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 18:12" />Ɛsalɛ gɛtɛ ɛ san ɛ ma kpèlè Mikaya fɔ ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Nya, bɛtabʋrʋlɛ-do fɔ powu bɛɛ dɔ̀ gɛ ade-kɩlɩn be wùlà gɛtɛ egyu-dɩrɛ eè di akpa fɔ yii koro. Okoro yɛ aanyun-gyebi yàà mɛ dɩkɩlɩn ma booyo, fɔ àà tabʋrʋ ade-kpara.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2CH 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 18:13" />Mɔ Mikaya ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Na nya Yahwe alɛ, nan bɔ n dɔ̀ wɔ gɛ ɛwʋ gɛtɛ Yahwe ɛɛ̀ dɔ̀ mɩ fɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2CH 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 18:14" />Gɛtɛ e be gyu fɔ, egyu-dɩrɛ e lila wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Mikaya, n ma kpà ma Ramoti-Gileyadi, abɛɛ n kara san?&gt;&gt; Gɛ e tiri wuunyun alan, &lt; Ma kpà, aà di boo koro, yema Yahwe ɛɛ̀ ka bɛ ɛ sa aa gʋlɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2CH 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 18:15" />Gɛ egyu-dɩrɛ ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Disere dilen gɛ aa le mɩ nan yɛ wɔ̀ àà kan ntam tɛ mɩ alɛ an taa dɔ̀ ade-fon ɩkɩ mɔ fɔ nʋnkwarɩ gɛ aa dɔ̀ mɩ Yahwe diyere daanɩ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2CH 18:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 18:16" />Gɛ Mikaya e tiri wuunyun alan, &lt;&lt;Na we Isareli bete powu bɛ yasɩ idon yii koro, anlɛ bɛyɛran gɛtɛ bɛn ma ɛnyalɛ, gɛ Yahwe ɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;Bɛnɩ nyabɛ bɛn ma ɛnyalɛ. Yɛ ɛkamasɛ ɛ̀ɛ̀ san wɔ dɩkpaara olila waanɩ.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="2CH 18:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 18:17" />Gɛ Isareli wogyu ɛ dɔ̀ Yehosafati alan, &lt;&lt;Mɩn dɔ̀ wɔ̀ alɛ, ɛn taa dɔ̀ ade-kpara ka dama miin koro, mɔ ade-kpen yiiko-yiiko?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2CH 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 18:18" />Mikaya e biri ɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Nkele nʋn ade gɛtɛ Yahwe ɛɛ dɔ̀, &lt;Na we Yahwe è si wo gigyu-bɩya gii koro, gɛ gatala gɩɩ dɩtɩnpan fɔ powu bè yela wɔ dɩbɩyan ma wologyi. <verse eid="2CH 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 18:19" />Gɛ Yahwe e lila alan, &lt;Ɛnyan nan ma gban Ahabi, ɛ̀ɛ̀ ma kpà ma Ramoti-Gileyadi bàà wolo wɔ dʋkɔ?&gt; Gɛ &lt;&lt;ɛkɩ ɛ dɔ̀ anlɛ, gɛ edo mɔ ɛ dɔ̀ lɛ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2CH 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 18:20" />Gamama fɔ gifiye-kpen gɩkɩ gi ye gi be yela Yahwe bʋnʋn gɛ gɩ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;Nmɩ nan ma gban wɔ.&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CH 18:20">Gɛ Yahwe e lila wɔ alan, &lt;&lt; &lt;Osele-mɔmɔ gɛ aà ka?<verse eid="2CH 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 18:21" />Gɛ gifiye fɔ gi tiri wuunyun alan, &lt;&lt; &lt;Nan ye n san nan ma mɛ didebila dii gifiye wɔ bɛtabʋrʋlɛ fɔ powu boonyun waanɩ.&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CH 18:21">Gɛ Yahwe ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ alan, &lt;&lt; &lt;Aà talɩ a gban wɔ, okoro san fɔ àà ma mɛ gɛlɛ.&gt;<verse eid="2CH 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 18:22" />Okoro Yahwe ɛ ka didebila dii gifiye ɛ sa aa bɛtabʋrʋlɛ nyabɛ powu boo-inyun yaanɩ. Yahwe ɛ wɛrɛ mɛ gɛtɛ eè muru wɔ̀.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2CH 18:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 18:23" />Gɛ Kenaana wobi Sedekiya ɛ bʋn ɛ ma gbɛrɛ Mikaya ɔtan gɛ e lila wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Osele-mɔmɔ gɛ Yahwe gifiye gi ye maanɩ gɩ ma tabʋrʋ ma awɔ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2CH 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CH 18:24" />Mikaya e tiri wuunyun alan, &lt;&lt;Duwi gɛtɛ aà ma bu dikwo dɩɩ gamɩ fɔ, gɛ aà we a nyɩnla.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2CH 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CH 18:25" />Gɛ Isareli wogyu ɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Ɩ Ka Mikaya, fɔ yàà birima wɔ ɩ ma tɛ Amon, gɛtɛ ɛɛ nya ditele dii koro fɔ, ma egyu-dɩrɛ wobi Yowasi, <verse eid="2CH 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CH 18:26" />fɔ yàà dɔ̀ bɛ alan, &lt;&lt;Egyu-dɩrɛ alan, &lt;Ɩ ka wɔ ɩ ma tan dikwo, gɛ ɩ kara tɛ wɔ gɩnyankɩ ɩ fɩya ma boroboro, ma butu buuko, ma sere gɛtɛ nan biri n ba olila waanɩ.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="2CH 18:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CH 18:27" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Mikaya ɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Gengyi à biri à ba olila waanɩ fɔ, ɛwʋ bɩrɛ Yahwe ɛn dama miin koro ɛ tabʋrʋ.&gt;&gt; Gɛ e biri ɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Ɛyɩ powu, ɩ nʋn maanyun-gyebi ɩ sɩ̀!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2CH 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ahabi diku</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="1KI 22:29-35">1 Begyu-dɩrɛ 22:29-35</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2CH 18:28" />Okoro Isareli wogyu Ahabi, ma Yuda wogyu Yehosafati bɛ bʋn bɛ da Ramoti-Gileyadi. <verse eid="2CH 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2CH 18:29" />Gɛ Isareli wogyu ɛ dɔ̀ Yehosafati alan, &lt;&lt;Nmɩ nan sa anyɩmɩnyan n bubwa koro n gyu akpa fɔ yaanɩ. Mɔ awɔ bɩrɛ, sa aagyu-nyan.&gt;&gt; Okoro Isareli wogyu e foma koro, gɛ e gyu akpa fɔ yaanɩ. <verse eid="2CH 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2CH 18:30" />Siriya wogyu ɛ dɔ̀ wo tiiramisan ɛbɛ bɔɔ bɛndɩrɛ fɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Ebi oo, ɛndɩrɛ oo, Ɩ kara kpà ma ɛnɩ ɛkɩ, ɩ kpà gɛ ma Isareli wogyu woko.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2CH 18:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2CH 18:31" />Gɛtɛ tiiramisan ɛbɛ bɔɔ bɛndɩrɛ fɔ be we Yehosafati fɔ, bɛ sa amɩnlɛ alɛ wù di gɛ Isareli wogyu okoro be fi bɛ̀ ma kpà ma ɛwɔ, mɔ gɛtɛ Yehosafati e tiri onyun fɔ, Yahwe e to wɔ, gɛ be kere wɔ bɛ ya. <verse eid="2CH 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2CH 18:32" />Yema tiiramisan ɛbɛ bɔɔ bɛndɩrɛ fɔ be we gɛtɛ nka Isareli wogyu fɔ wɔlɛ, gɛ be kere wo geserenti berema wɔ bɛ ya.<verse eid="2CH 18:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="2CH 18:33" />Mɔ ɛkɩ ɛ tà wɔ gɩsɩnta ɛ sa bɛnɩ fɔ baanɩ, gɛ gɩ ma sere Isareli wogyu gɛgba fɔ gɩɩ gɛkyagakʋn gʋʋgba gɛtɛ wʋ̀ dɔ fɔ waanɩ. Gɛ egyu-dɩrɛ ɛ dɔ̀ wo tiiramisan wɔkanlɛ fɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Fi, fɔ àà ka mɩ ye akpa fɔ yaanɩ, yema na pira.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2CH 18:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="2CH 18:34" />Akpa fɔ ɩ mɛ ɔkɛma duwi fɔ powu daanɩ, gɛ egyu-dɩrɛ ɛ yɛ ɛ̀ kpasa tiiramisan fɔ anɩ, gɛ wɔ bʋnʋn bʋ yɛ bù ten Siriya bete fɔ ma ye ɔgyɔlɔ. Gɛ e ku ɔgyɔlɔ wʋtɔkɔ.<verse eid="2CH 18:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="2CH 19" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 19:1" />Yuda wogyu Yehosafati e biri ɛ ma gyu wo digyu-kpaara Yerusalem olila waanɩ. <verse eid="2CH 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 19:2" />Gɛ Hanani wobi Wurubwarɛ wɔtabʋrʋlɛ Yehu ɛ ma tuma egyu fɔ, gɛ ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Wù di gɛtɛ àà kpà omiri-kpen wuu bete fɔ àà len ɛbɛ gɛtɛ bɛɛ kyʋn Yahwe? Nyawʋ wuu koro, Yahwe ɛ ka owurufa-dɩrɛ ma awɔ. <verse eid="2CH 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 19:3" />Mɔ fɔ, ade-kpara bɛrɛɛ ɩ̀ sa aanɩ, yema a tiri Asera wo-iyon gɛtɛ ɩ̀ sa gɛtʋnkwaa fɔ gaanɩ powu, gɛ a ka aaturu aa bugiti Wurubwarɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2CH 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yehosafati ɛ sɩ̀ gɔdɔ gɩɩ bɛdɔ̀lɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 19:4" />Yehosafati ɛ sara Yerusalem, mɔ ee tì ye Beseba ɛ san Efrayim wo-idon yɩɩ gɛtʋnkwaa gaanɩ ɛɛ ma tabʋrʋ ɛ tɛ dʋkɔ wʋʋ bɛnɩ gɛtɛ bàà biri fi boo-ituru ba Yahwe, bootu ɛbɛ boo Wurubwarɛ fɔ wakʋn. <verse eid="2CH 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 19:5" />Ɛ sɩ̀ gɔdɔ gɩɩ bɛdɔ̀lɛ Yuda watele-kɛmalɛ-kamasɛ yaanɩ. <verse eid="2CH 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 19:6" />Gɛ ɛ dɔ̀ bɛ alan, &lt;&lt;Ɩ nya gɛtɛ yaà dɔ̀ gɔdɔ-kamasɛ ma giisele, yema nka bɛnɩ-nyalɛ gɛ ɩɩ dɔ̀ gɔdɔ fɔ ɩ tɛ, ɩɩ dɔ̀ ɩ tɛ gɛ Yahwe. Gɛ ɛ̀ fɩya ma ɛyɩ ɔya-kamasɛ gɛtɛ ɩɩ tɛ aten ma dɩpwɛ gɔdɔ gaanɩ fɔ. <verse eid="2CH 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 19:7" />Ɩ yɛ Yahwe geserenti gàà sara yaanɩ. Ɩ dɔ̀ gɔdɔ ma giisele, yema Yahwe tii Wurubwarɛ ɛn taa len akutugyi, abɛɛ diligi, abɛɛ ma dibilin daanyan yii geto.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2CH 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 19:8" />Gɛ Yerusalem ditele daanɩ fɔ, Yehosafati ɛ sɩ̀ Lefi bete ma gedi gɩɩ bɛtɛlɛ ma akpaara yɩɩ bɛndɩrɛ bɛkɩ gɛtɛ bàà tɛrɛma Yahwe wo-ise fɔ dɔ̀ gɔdɔ fɔ bàà pɩna itiira gɛtɛ ɩ̀ sa bɛnɩ boo getite. Bɛ sara gɛ Yerusalem dʋkɔ. <verse eid="2CH 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 19:9" />Ɛ dɔ̀ bɛ alan, &lt;&lt;Wù di gɛtɛ yàà mɛ gɩnyan-kamasɛ Yahwe geserenti ma nʋnkwarɩ anɩ. <verse eid="2CH 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 19:10" />Ɔya-kamasɛ gɛtɛ yɩɩ bɛnɩ baanɩ ɛkɩ gɛtɛ e ye ditele dɩkɩ daanɩ, ɛ̀ ka ade ɩkɩ ɛ mɔma yɩ fɔ, gengyi wù di gɩnɩ-wolo gaade oo, wù di ade kadama ise fɔ oo, abɛɛ ade-wùlàlɛ oo, abɛɛ ade-mɛlɛ oo, abɛɛ ade-tɩyɛlɛ-sɩ̀lɛ ɩkɩ yii koro oo, ɩ dɔ̀ bɛ fɔ bàà nya gepe gɛtɛ baà dɔ̀ gɔdɔ fɔ ma giisele, fɔ bɛ kara bɛ mɛ Yahwe ade-kpen. Nka gɛlɛ fɔ, wowurufa-dɩrɛ waà ba ɛyɩ ma yɩɩdɩrɛ ɛbɛ boo koro. Ɩ mɛ nyawʋ gɛtɛ ɩ kara bɛ mɛ ade-kpen.<verse eid="2CH 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 19:11" />Amariya gɛtɛ è di gedi gɩɩtɛlɛ ɛndɩrɛ fɔ nan nya yii koro ade powu gɛtɛ ɩ̀ san ma Yahwe gɩlan fɔ. Gɛ Isimayeli wobi Sebadiya gɛtɛ è di egyegeyelɛ Yuda wofoli waanɩ fɔ nan nya yii koro dɩsarabi daade powu yaanɩ. Gɛ Lefi bete fɔ mɔ nan mɛ bɛndɩrɛbi bɛ tɛ yɩ. I yela kin-kin, fɔ Yahwe ɛ̀ɛ̀ fɩya ma ɛbɛ gɛtɛ bɛɛ mɛ ade-kpara fɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2CH 19:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="2CH 20" />
  <para style="s1">Yehosafati e di Mowabi ma Amon bete boo koro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 20:1" />Nyawʋ wʋʋ gama fɔ, Mowabi bete ma Amon bete ma Mewun bete bɛkɩ bɛ ma kpà ma Yehosafati.<verse eid="2CH 20:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 20:2" />Ɛwʋ gɛ bɛnɩ bɛkɩ bɛ bɛ dɔ̀ Yehosafati alan, &lt;&lt;Bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ dɩtɩnpan dɩkɩ be ye Edom, ɛpʋ ofèn bɛ̀ bɛ̀ tà wɔ̀ bɩtà. Be were gyu Hasason-Tamari.&gt;&gt; (Dʋkɔ n di En-Gedi fɔ) <verse eid="2CH 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 20:3" />Gɩsaa-dɩrɛ gi gyu Yehosafati, okoro e lila Yahwe gɩnyan gɛtɛ ɛɛ̀ mɛ. Ɛ dɔ̀ gɛtɛ ɛnɩ-kamasɛ gɛtɛ ɛ̀ sa Yuda fɔ ɛ ban onyun. <verse eid="2CH 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 20:4" />Gɛ bɛnɩ gɛtɛ bɛ̀ sa Yuda watele powu yaanɩ fɔ, be be tuma Yerusalem bɛ bɛ fɔ Yahwe ɛ̀ɛ̀ kpà bɛ.<verse eid="2CH 20:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 20:5" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Yehosafati ɛ tɔ e yela Yuda bete ma Yerusalem bete bɔɔ bʋnʋn, Yahwe Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ dɩɩ kpata-fon fɔ bʋnʋn, <verse eid="2CH 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 20:6" />gɛ e tiri onyun alan,</para>
  <para style="pm" vid="2CH 20:6">&lt;&lt;Oo Yahwe, tiitu ɛbɛ boo Wurubwarɛ, aako n di Wurubarɛ gɛtɛ ɛ̀ sa gatala. Awɔ nte di bugyu gɛtɛ bʋ̀ sa gɛtʋnkwaa gii koro powu buu koro. Awɔ n otimi ma ɔkɛma wuute, gɛ ɛkɩ ɛn nan talɩ e yela ma awɔ. <verse eid="2CH 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 20:7" />Oo tii Wurubwarɛ, ɔkʋna gɛtɛ aa bɛnɩ be gyu gɛtʋnkwaa nyagɩ gaanɩ fɔ, a berema bɛnɩ gɛtɛ bè si gaanɩ fɔ, gɛ a ka gɩ a tɛ aa wɔlɔn Abraham wodu wʋʋ bɛnɩ gàà mɛ booyo gakpaakpa. <verse eid="2CH 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 20:8" />Aa bɛnɩ bɛ sara nfan gɛ be sere Dikwo-dɩrɛ bàà tɩ sʋma wɔ̀, gɛ bɛ dɔ̀ alan, <verse eid="2CH 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 20:9" />&lt;Gengyi gyerebi ɛkɩ anlɛ bɩtà, abɛɛ geyeba, abɛɛ dɩkpan dɩɩ ba tii koro fɔ, taà be yela aa bʋnʋn, aa Dikwo-dɩrɛ nyadɩ daanɩ, fɔ tàà wula tɩ tɛ wɔ̀ alɛ to tɩ ya, fɔ àà nʋn tɩ fɔ àà to tɩ.&gt;<verse eid="2CH 20:9" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 20:10" />Nya anlɛ gɛtɛ Amon, ma Mowabi, ma Edom bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ bɛɛ mɛ tɩ. Ɔkʋna gɛtɛ tiitu ɛbɛ be ye Egyipiti fɔ, an yɛ bɛ bàà gyu bɔɔ ntʋnkwaa baanɩ, okoro be fi gɩlan be kere bɛ bɛ ya. <verse eid="2CH 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 20:11" />Nya anlɛ gɛtɛ bee le tɩ gutoro. Bɛ ba bàà bè berema tɩ ye gɛtʋnkwaa gɛtɛ a ka a tɛ tɩ fɔ gaanɩ. <verse eid="2CH 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 20:12" />Oo tii Wurubwarɛ, tiira bɛ giten, yema tɩn ma ɔkɛma gɛtɛ taà kpà ma bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ dɩtɩnpan gɛtɛ bɛɛ ba bàà ba kpà ma ɛtɩ lɛ. Tɩn nyɩ̀ gɩnyan gɛtɛ taà mɛ, mɔ aa koro gɛ tɩɩ bʋnʋn bʋ̀ gyaga.<verse eid="2CH 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 20:13" />Waanɩ fɔ, Yuda beteni powu ma bɔɔsɔ ɛbɛ, ma boo bebi, ma bebi-sorobi be be yela Yahwe bʋnʋn.<verse eid="2CH 20:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 20:14" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Yahwe Gifiye gɩ ba Sekariya wobi Yahasiyeli wo koro ɔkʋna gɛtɛ è yela dikpi fɔ daanɩ fɔ. Wotu n di Benayiya, wotu akpin n di Yeyeli, gɛ wotu olongoron n di Lefi-te Mataniya gɛtɛ è di Asaf wodu waanɩ wʋʋnɩ fɔ.<verse eid="2CH 20:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 20:15" />Gɛ ɛ dɔ̀ bɛ alan, &lt;&lt;Egyu Yehosafati ma ɛyɩ gɛtɛ ɩ̀ sa Yuda ma Yerusalem powu ɩ nʋn! Yahwe alan, &lt;Ɩ kara yɛ gɩsaa gàà ton yɩ, abɛɛ koro gàà yɔ yɩ bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ dɩtɩnpan nyadɩ dii koro. Yema akpa fɔ in di gɛ yiiyo, mɔ fɔ, ì di gɛ Wurubwarɛ woyo. <verse eid="2CH 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 20:16" />Gɩsa, ɩ waran ɩ ma kpà ma ɛbɛ. Yaà we bɛ gɛtɛ bɛɛ bʋn ma Sisi wosele fɔ bɛɛ ba. Yaà tuma bɛ dɩtagba gɛtɛ dɩ dɔ̀ ma ye Yeruweli wotonkuma waanɩ fɔ dii kere. <verse eid="2CH 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 20:17" />Nka ɛyɩ nan kpà gɛlɛ gaakpa nyayɩ. I yela kin-kin, fɔ yàà nya anlɛ gɛtɛ Yahwe ɛɛ̀ yɛ yɩ yàà di boo koro. Oo Yuda ma Yerusalem bete, ɩ kara yɛ gɩsaa gàà ton yɩ, gɛ ɩ kara yɛ koro gàà yɔ yɩ. Gɩsa ɩ san akpà fɔ yaanɩ, Yahwe ɛ̀ fɩya ma ɛyɩ.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="2CH 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 20:18" />Gɛ egyu Yehosafati ma Yuda bete ma Yerusalem bete fɔ powu bɛ waran be kura bɛ ka bʋnʋn be tin gɛtʋnkwaa bɛ sʋma Yahwe. <verse eid="2CH 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 20:19" />Gɛ Lefi bete bɛkɩ gɛtɛ be ye Kohati ma Kora baafʋrɩ yaanɩ fɔ bɛ tɔ be yela, gɛ bɛ ka gɩta-dɩrɛ be sila Yahwe, Isareli wo Wurubwarɛ fɔ.<verse eid="2CH 20:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 20:20" />Kere-kpalɛ gɛgyɩgyan fuu fɔ, Yuda bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ fɔ bɛ tɔ bɛ da Tekowa wotonkuma waanɩ. Gɛtɛ bɛ tɔ bàà da fɔ, Yehosafati ɛ dɔ̀ bɛ alan, &lt;&lt;Yuda ma Yerusalem bete, ɩ nʋn maakʋn! I to Yahwe, yii Wurubwarɛ i di, fɔ yàà talɩ i yela kin-kin. I to wɔ bɛtabʋrʋlɛ fɔ i di, fɔ ade yàà san gepe ɩ tɛ yɩ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2CH 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 20:21" />Gɛtɛ Yehosafati ma bɛnɩ fɔ be tiri amɩnlɛ be were fɔ, e tiri baanɩ bɛkɩ ɛ sɩ bɩta bʋʋ bɛtalɛ fɔ bɔɔ bʋnʋn alɛ bàà tɩ nʋma ɩnʋn bɛ tɛ Yahwe, bàà sila wo gingyebi-fɩrɩnfɩrɩn fɔ, bàà dɔ alan,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CH 20:21">&lt;&lt;Ɩ sa Yahwe onyun,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CH 20:21">yema wo gelen gɩ̀ sa gakpaakpa.<verse eid="2CH 20:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 20:22" />Gɛtɛ be sere ɔnʋn fɔ wʋʋ gɛnʋma ma Yahwegesila fɔ, Yahwe ɛ yɛ gɩsaa-dɩrɛ gi gyu Amon ma Mowabi ma Edom bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ gɛtɛ bɛ tɩtrɩ bee gyu Yuda ga tʋnkwa gaanɩ fɔ, gɛ Uuda bett be di boo koro. <verse eid="2CH 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 20:23" />Amon ma Mowabi bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ be gyu Edom bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ fɔ baanɩ, gɛ be muru bɛ. Gɛtɛ be wolo Edom bete be were fɔ, bɛ tɔ be wolo booko-booko mɔ.<verse eid="2CH 20:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CH 20:24" />Ɔkʋna gɛtɛ Yuda bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ fɔ be be gyu ɔkʋn gɛtɛ baà talɩ be we otonkuma fɔ waanɩ waran san fɔ, be we gɛtɛ bɛnɩ be ku bɛ̀ fɩna bɛ̀ fɩna gɛtʋnkwaa. Ɛnɩ n di ɛnɩ en ye waanɩ. <verse eid="2CH 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CH 20:25" />Okoro Yehosafatɩ ma wɔ bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ fɔ bɛ ma kpila bɔɔ bɛ kyʋnlɛ fɔ baanyan. Be wura gʋtʋn gaanyan, ma ngba ma anyan gbaa-gbaa kpekpesi. Anyan fɔ ɩ̀ sɔ gepepe gɛtɛ bɛn talɩ kʋla yɩ duwi-kɩlɩn, okoro awi asiyee gɛ bɛ ka bɛ kʋla yɩ. <verse eid="2CH 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CH 20:26" />Duwi-naafɛ fɔ, be tuma Beraka dɩtagba daanɩ gɛ be sila Yahwe ɛwʋ gɛtɛ ɛ mɛ fɔ wuu koro. Nyawʋ na yɛ gɛ bee kpèlè dʋkɔ Beraka dɩtagba bè ye ma ǹdò lɛ. <verse eid="2CH 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CH 20:27" />Yehosafati e gyegeye Yuda ma Yerusalem bete powu bɔɔ bʋnʋn, gɛ be biri bɛ san Yerusalem ɔsɛ waanɩ, yema Yahwe e di bɔɔ bɛkyʋnlɛ boo koro ɛ tɛ bɛ. <verse eid="2CH 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2CH 20:28" />Gɛtɛ be gyu Yerusalem fɔ, bɛ ka adʋlɛ ɛbɛ dɩrɛ-dɩrɛ, ma adʋlɛ ɛbɛ ma akantan bɛ nʋma ɩnʋn be gyu Yahwe Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ daanɩ.<verse eid="2CH 20:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2CH 20:29" />Gɛ bɩfɩɩ-bɩfɩɩ buu bugyu baadikʋn gɛtɛ bʋ nʋn anlɛ gɛtɛ Yahwe ɛ kpà ma Isareli bɛkyʋnlɛ fɔ bu gyu gɩsaa. <verse eid="2CH 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2CH 20:30" />Gɛ wʋ yɛ olila wʋ ba Yehosafati bugyu baanɩ, yema wo Wurubwarɛ ɛ yɛ olila wʋ ba wɔ gɛtʋnkwaa powu gaanɩ.<verse eid="2CH 20:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yehosafati bugyu buu gewere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="2CH 20:31" />Yehosafati e di bugyu Yuda gɛtʋnkwaa gaanɩ. Ɔkʋna gɛtɛ e di bugyu fɔ, ɛ̀ ba bɩkyan dikpilin ma fwo-ton (35), gɛ e di bugyu Yerusalem bɩkyan dikpilin ma ton (25). Wɔna diyere n di Asuba, gɛtɛ e di Silihi wobi-nanɩ fɔ. <verse eid="2CH 20:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2CH 20:32" />Yehosafati ɛ mɛ ade gɛtɛ ɩ̀ kɔlɔ Yahwe bʋnʋn, gɛ ɛn falɩ ye wote Asa osele gɛtɛ ɛ san fɔ waanɩ, ɛ san gɛ osele fɔ wuu koro. <verse eid="2CH 20:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2CH 20:33" />Mɔ fɔ, en gbena asʋmakʋn fɔ, gɛ bɛnɩ fɔ bɛn ka boo-ituru tɛ bootu ɛbɛ boo Wurubwarɛ fɔ.<verse eid="2CH 20:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="2CH 20:34" />Bɛ ŋwara ade-kurumakyɛɛ gɛtɛ Yehosafati ɛ mɛ, ma ɛyɩ gɛtɛ ɛ mɛ wo bugyu buu gedi gaanɩ, ye digyegeye ma sere ɔkʋna fɔ bɛ sa Hanani wobi-teni Yehu gɩkpa gɛtɛ bɛ ka bɛ fɩya Isareli begyu-dɩrɛ boo koro gaade yɩɩ gɩkpa gaanɩ fɔ gaanɩ.<verse eid="2CH 20:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="2CH 20:35" />Gamama fɔ, Yuda wogyu Yehosafati ɛ mɛ onyun ma Isareli wogyu Ahasiya gɛtɛ è di duyu-kɛma diite fɔ. <verse eid="2CH 20:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="2CH 20:36" />Gɛ ɛ dɔ̀ e yera ma ɛwɔ gɛtɛ bàà salɩ gɩyɛ gɩɩ-ɩkʋlɩ-dɩrɛ-dɩrɛ. Gɛtɛ bɛ mɛ ɩkʋlɩ fɔ bɛ sɩ̀ ɩkʋlɩ yii geyelakʋn Esiyon-Geberi ditele daanɩ be were wʋʋ gama fɔ, <verse eid="2CH 20:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="2CH 20:37" />Dodafahu wobi Eliyeseri gɛtɛ e ye Maresa fɔ ɛ tabʋrʋ Yehosafati wo koro gaade alan, &lt;&lt;Gɛtɛ a mɛ onyun-kɩlɩn ma Ahasiya wuu koro, Yahwe ɛɛ̀ mɩna aa gʋtʋn gɛtɛ a mɛ fɔ.&gt;&gt; Ɩkʋlɩ fɔ ɩ gbena Esiyon-Geberi ditele daanɩ, okoro ɩn talɩ ɩ mɛ gʋtʋn.<verse eid="2CH 20:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="2CH 21" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 21:1" />Yehosafati e ku, gɛ be lò wɔ ɔkʋn gɛtɛ bee kpèlè alɛ Dafidi Ditele fɔ. Gɛ wobi Yehoram e di bugyu e sere wɔ gɩsɩrɩ. <verse eid="2CH 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 21:2" />Egyu Yehosafati wobi Yehoram ɛ ba benobi kooron. Ɛbɛ n di, Asariya, ma Yehiyeli, ma Sekariya, ma Asariyahu, ma Mikayeli, ma Sefatiya. Ɛbɛ powu bè di Isareli wogyu Yehosafati bebi <verse eid="2CH 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 21:3" />Boote ɛ tɛ bɛ anyan kpekpesi. Ɛyɩ n di sɩka-fututu, ma sɩka-sɩya ma anyan ma ɔyɛ-kɛma kpekpesi, gɛ ɛ ka baanɩ-kamasɛ ɛ mɛ Yuda watele gɛtɛ bɛ mara ɩpɔrɩ be silin fɔ yii begyegeyelɛ. Mɔ ɛ ka bugyu fɔ ɛ sa Yehoram gʋlɔ yema ɛwɔ n di wobi-teni ɛndɩrɛ.<verse eid="2CH 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yuda wogyu Yehoram</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 21:4" />Gɛtɛ Yehoram e be di bugyu e sere wote gɩsɩrɩ, gɛ e sere ɩkpaa fɔ, e wolo wonobi ɛbɛ fɔ powu, fɩya ma Isareli bɛndɩrɛbi fɔ bɛkɩ. <verse eid="2CH 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 21:5" />Yehoram e di bugyu fɔ ɛ̀ ba bɩkyan dikpilin ma fwo-bʋnyɔɔ, gɛ e di bugyu Yerusalem bɩkyan nɩyɛ. <verse eid="2CH 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 21:6" />Yehoram mɔ ɛ mɛ gɛ anlɛ gɛtɛ Isareli begyu bɛ mɛ fɔ. Ɛ mɛ ade-kpen Yahwe bʋnʋn. Ɛ mɛ duyu-kɛma anlɛ egyu Ahabi, yema e to Ahabi wobi-nanɩ ɛkɩ gɩna. <verse eid="2CH 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 21:7" />Mɔ dikola gɛtɛ Yahwe ɛ tà ma Dafidi fɔ dii koro fɔ, en len ɛ̀ɛ̀ mɩna Dafidi dɩkpaara. Yema Yahwe ɛ dɔ̀ ɛ sɩ̀ gɛtɛ Dafidi wodu wʋʋ bɛnɩ nan di bugyu gakpaakpa.<verse eid="2CH 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 21:8" />Yehoram wɔya waanɩ fɔ, Edom bete bɛ tɔ be yela Yuda gɩfɩɩ gii koro, gɛ bɛ sɩ̀ ɛbɛ gbagba boogyu. <verse eid="2CH 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 21:9" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Yehoram ɛ ka wɔ bɛndɩrɛbi ma wo tiiramisan ɛbɛ, gɛ bɛ ma sʋ Edom bɛ sa. Dʋkɔ fɔ, Edom bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ bɛ silin ɛwɔ ma wo tiiramisan ɛbɛ yɩɩ bɛsaralɛ bɔɔ bɛndɩrɛ fɔ powu be tuma, mɔ ɛ tɔ e serenti odente. <verse eid="2CH 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 21:10" />Okoro Edom ɛ lanla koro e ye Yuda anɩ bè ye ma ǹdò.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CH 21:10">Ɔya wʋtɔkɔ waanɩ ke gɛ Libina ditele mɔ dɩ tɔ di yela Yuda wo koro, yema Yehoram e terema Yahwe, wotu ɛbɛ boo Wurubwarɛ fɔ. <verse eid="2CH 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 21:11" />Nkele mɔ e ni sere asʋmakʋn Yuda wo-idon yii koro, gɛ ɛ yɛ bɛnɩ gɛtɛ bɛ̀ sa Yerusalem ma Yuda fɔ be lulu osele, yema bɛ ma sʋma bekpen.<verse eid="2CH 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 21:12" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Wurubwarɛ wɔtabʋrʋlɛ Eliya ɛ ŋwara gɩkpa ɛ san ma Yehoram alan,&lt;&lt;Yahwe, aate Dafidi wo Wurubwarɛ alan, &lt;An tɛrɛma aate Yehosafati abɛɛ aatu Yuda wogyu Asa wo-isele. <verse eid="2CH 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 21:13" />Mɔ fɔ, a tɛrɛma gɛ Isareli begyu boo-isele, gɛ a yɛ Yerusalem ma Yuda bete bɛ ma sʋma bekpen anlɛ gɛtɛ egyu Ahabi ma ɛbɛ gɛtɛ be di bugyu wɔ gama fɔ bɛ mɛ Isareli fɔ. A biri wolo awɔ gbagba aanobi ɛbɛ, aate dɩkpaara dii beteni gɛtɛ bee di gʋnʋn bɛ da wɔ fɔ. <verse eid="2CH 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 21:14" />Okoro nkele, Yahwe è de dɩyɩyɛ-dɩrɛ ɛɛ ba aa bɛnɩ, ma aa bebi-teni, ma aasɔ ɛbɛ ma gɩnyan-kamasɛ gɛtɛ gi di aayo fɔ gii koro. <verse eid="2CH 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 21:15" />Gɛ awɔ-gbagba mɔ, ɛɛ̀ yɛ àà gyu ɩkpɩn yii geyeba-kpen gɩkɩ gɛtɛ gaà mɛ ɔkɛma duwi n di duwi ma sere gɛtɛ aà ku.<verse eid="2CH 21:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 21:16" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Yahwe ɛ yɛ Filisiti bete ma Arabi bete gɛtɛ bè si gbɛma Etiyopiya bete fɔ bɛ ma kpà ma Yehoram. <verse eid="2CH 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 21:17" />Bɛ ma kpà ma Yuda bete, gɛ be tola baanyan-kpara gɛtɛ be wura digyu-kpaara fɔ daanɩ fɔ, fɩya ma wo bebi-teni ma wɔsɔ ɛbɛ powu bɛ da. Ahasiya gɛtɛ è di wobi-teni-sʋnalɛ ɔkʋna fɔ woko gɛ be kere bɛ ya.<verse eid="2CH 21:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 21:18" />Nyawʋ powu wʋ gama fɔ, Yahwe ɛ yɛ ɩkpɩn yii geyeba gɩkɩ gɛtɛ gɩ̀ ma gɩfa gɩ gbɛrɛ Yehoram. <verse eid="2CH 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 21:19" />Bɩkyan bʋnyɔɔ bàà be were fɔ, wo geyeba fɔ gɩ mɛ ɔkɛma gɛ ɛ ka dɩfana-dɩrɛ e ku. Wɔ bɛnɩ bɛn sa ɔtan wula wɔ anlɛ gɛtɛ be wula bootu ɛbɛ fɔ.<verse eid="2CH 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 21:20" />Gɛtɛ Yehoram e di bugyu fɔ ɛ̀ ba bɩkyan dikpilin ma fwo-bʋnyɔɔ, gɛ e di bugyu Yerusalem bɩkyan nɩyɛ. Gɛtɛ e ku fɔ, wʋn mɛ ɛnɩ ɛkɩ dɩkpʋkpʋ. Be lò wɔ ɔkʋn gɛtɛ bee kpèlè alɛ Dafidi Ditele fɔ, mɔ nka begyu boo gelòkʋn fɔ.<verse eid="2CH 21:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="2CH 22" />
  <para style="s1">Yuda wogyu Ahasiya</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2KI 8:25-29">2 Begyu-dɩrɛ 8:25-29</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 9:21-28">9:21-28</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 22:1" />Yerusalem bete bɛ sɩ̀ Yehoram wobi-teni Ahasiya gɛtɛ è di wobi-teni-sʋnalɛ ɔkʋna fɔ bugyu, yema bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ gɛtɛ bɛ ba ma Arabi bete fɔ, be wolo bebi-teni bɛndɩrɛ fɔ powu. Gɛlɛ wuu koro Yuda wogyu Yehoram wobi Ahasiya n te di bugyu Yuda.<verse eid="2CH 22:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 22:2" />Ɔkʋna gɛtɛ Ahasiya e di bugyu fɔ, ɛ̀ ba bɩkyan dikpilin ma bʋnyɔɔ, gɛ e di bugyu Yerusalem gɩkyan-kɩlɩn. Wɔna n di Omiri wɔnana Ataliya.<verse eid="2CH 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 22:3" />Ahasiya mɔ ɛ tɛrɛma gɛ Ahabi wo-isele kpen fɔ yaanɩ, yema wɔna e yela wɔ gama ma ade-kpen yɩɩ gɛmɛ. <verse eid="2CH 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 22:4" />Ɛ mɛ ade-kpen Yahwe bʋnʋn anlɛ gɛtɛ Ahabi ma wɔ dɩkpaara bɛ mɛ fɔ. Yema wote diku dɩɩ gama fɔ, Ahabi dɩkpaara dɩɩ bɛnɩ na bilingi waamɩnlɛ yɩɩbɛtɛlɛ, gɛ wʋ yɛ wɔ ɛ nʋ̀n. <verse eid="2CH 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 22:5" />Baamɩnlɛ gɛtɛ bɛ tɛ wɔ fɔ yii koro, ɛ fɩya ma Isareli wogyu Ahabi wobi-teni Yoram, gɛ bɛ ma tà bɩtà ma Aram wogyu Hasayeli Ramoti-Gileyadi ditele daanɩ. Gɛ Aram bete be pira Yoram. <verse eid="2CH 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 22:6" />Okoro e biri ɛ san Yesereeli ɛ̀ɛ̀ ma kya wakʋn gɛtɛ e pira Ramoti ditele daanɩ, ɛbɛ ma Aram wogyu Hasayeli baakpa fɔ yaanɩ fɔ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CH 22:6">Gɛ Yehoram wobi Ahasiya ɛ san ɛ ma silin wɔ Yesereli ditele dʋkɔbɛ.<verse eid="2CH 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 22:7" />Wurubwarɛ ɛ yɛ Ahasiya wɔ-ɩsan gɛtɛ ɛ san Yoram wakʋn fɔ i bilingi duyu-kpen-dɩrɛ ɩ tɛ wɔ. Ɔkʋna gɛtɛ Ahasiya ɛ ma gyu dʋkɔ fɔ, ɛbɛ ma Yoram bɛ tɔ bɛ ma tuma Nimisi wobi Yehu. Ɛwɔ gɛ Yahwe e tiri gɛtɛ eè muru Ahabi wodu wʋʋ bɛnɩ fɔ. <verse eid="2CH 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 22:8" />Gɛtɛ Yehu ee tin Ahabi wodu wʋʋ bɛnɩ dɩpwɛ anlɛ gɛtɛ Wurubwarɛ ɛ dɔ̀ fɔ, e we Yuda bɛndɩrɛ ma Ahasiya bekperebi gɛtɛ bɛɛ mɛ gʋtʋn bɛ tɛ wɔ, gɛ e wolo bɛ. <verse eid="2CH 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 22:9" />Gɛ Yehu e gyu gebugiti Ahasiya gɛ wɔ bɛsaranyan bɛ ma we wɔ gɛtɛ è bu Samariya ditele. Be gye wɔ gɛ bɛ ka wɔ bɛ mɔma Yehu gɛ e wolo wɔ. Gɛ be lò wɔ gepe yema bɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;È di Yehosafati gɛtɛ ɛ sʋma Yahwe nʋnkwarɩ anɩ fɔ wɔnana.&gt;&gt; Okoro ɛnɩ gbaa ɛkɩ ɛ mɩnɩ ma Ahasiya dɩkpaara fɔ daanɩ gɛtɛ eè di bugyu.<verse eid="2CH 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ataliya ma Yowasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 22:10" />Ɔkʋna gɛtɛ egyu-dɩrɛ Ahasiya wɔna Ataliya ɛ nʋn gɛtɛ wobi-teni Ahasiya e ku fɔ, ɛ san alɛ ɛ̀ ma muru Yuda digyu-kpaara fɔ dɩɩ bɛnɩ powu. <verse eid="2CH 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 22:11" />Mɔ egyu-dɩrɛ Yehoram wobi-nanɩ Yehoseba gɛtɛ e di Ahasiya wonosobi fɔ, ɛ ka Ahasiya wobi Yowasi e serenti e ye digyu-kpaara dɩɩ bɛnɩ gɛtɛ baà be wolo fɔ baanɩ. Ɛ ka ebi fɔ ma ɛnɩ gɛtɛ ɛɛ kyala wɔ fɔ ɛ ma bubwa Dikwo-dɩrɛ dii dikwo-dʋrɔlɛ dɩkɩ daanɩ. Okoro Ataliya en wura wolo wɔ. <verse eid="2CH 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 22:12" />Yowasi ma wɔnyalɛ fɔ be bu Yahwe Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ daanɩ bɩkyan kooron, fɔ Ataliya ee di bugyu gɛtʋnkwaa fɔ gaanɩ.<verse eid="2CH 22:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="2CH 23" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 23:1" />Mɔ gɩkyan kwarankɩfɛ gaanɩ fɔ, gedi gɩɩtɛlɛ Yehoyada ɛ mɛ wamɩnlɛ alɛ ɛɛ̀ mɛ gɩnyankɩ. Ɛ tà dikola ma bɩtà bʋʋ bɛndɩrɛ gɛtɛ bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ akpilin ton-ton bɛ̀ sa bɔɔ gatɩn fɔ. Ɛbɛ n di Yeroham wobi-teni Asariya, ma Yehohanan wobi-teni Isimayeli, ma Obedi wobi-teni Asariya, ma Adaya wobi Maaseya, ma Sikiri wobi Elisafati. <verse eid="2CH 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 23:2" />Gɛ bɛ san bɛ kʋla Lefi bete ma Isareli wakpaara-akpaara yɩɩ bɛndɩrɛ Yuda watele powu yaanɩ. Gɛtɛ be be gyu Yerusalem fɔ, <verse eid="2CH 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 23:3" />bɛnɩ dikpi fɔ powu bɛ tà dikola ma egyu-dɩrɛ Yowasi Yahwe Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ daanɩ, Wurubwarɛ bʋnʋn.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CH 23:3">Dʋkɔ gɛ Yehoyada ɛ dɔ̀ bɛ alan, &lt;&lt;Egyu wobi nan di bugyu, anlɛ gɛtɛ Yahwe ɛ dɔ̀ ɛ sɩ̀ ka da ma Dafidi wodu wʋʋ bɛnɩ boo koro fɔ. <verse eid="2CH 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 23:4" />Gɩnyan gɛtɛ yàà mɛ fɔ n di alɛ, gengyi ɛyɩ gedi gɩɩ bɛtɛlɛ ma Lefi bete ɩ̀ ba gʋtʋn Duwi-tunalɛ daanɩ fɔ, bè yo yaanɩ akpen asiyee fɔ, yaanɩ dikpen dɩkɩ nan mɛ Dikwo-dɩrɛ dii-itunu yɩɩ bɛdɩyɛlɛ, <verse eid="2CH 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 23:5" />fɔ dikpen dɩkɩ dàà dɩyɛ digyu-kpaara fɔ, fɔ dikpen-kurumakyɛɛ fɔ mɔ baà dɩyɛ gesere-ɔpɩ wuutunun fɔ. Fɔ nkele bɛnɩ-kurumakyɛɛ fɔ powu bàà sara Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ dɩɩ bɛkpata baanɩ. <verse eid="2CH 23:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 23:6" />Wun di gɛtɛ ɛnɩ ɛkɩ èè gyu Yahwe Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ daanɩ, sɩyɛɛ gedi gɩɩ bɛtɛlɛ gɛtɛ bɛɛ mɛ gʋtʋn dʋkɔ fɔ booko. Baà talɩ be gyu, yema be fere koro. Mɔ bɛnɩ-kurumakyɛɛ fɔ powu bɩrɛ, wù di gɛtɛ bàà dɩyɛ, anlɛ gɛtɛ Yahwe e wùlà bɛ fɔ. <verse eid="2CH 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 23:7" />Wù di gɛtɛ Lefi bete fɔ baanɩ-kamasɛ èè ton wakpanyan, fɔ bàà yela silin egyu fɔ dɩyɛ wɔ. Gengyi ɛnɩ-fon ɛkɩ è gyu dikwo fɔ daanɩ fɔ, baà wolo wɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2CH 23:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 23:8" />Lefi bete ma Yuda bɛnɩ powu bɛ mɛ anlɛ gɛtɛ gedi gɩɩtɛlɛ Yehoyada ɛ bɔ ɛ dɔ̀ fɔ. Bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ bɔɔndɩrɛ-kamasɛ ee wura ɛ kʋla wɔ bɛnɩ gɛtɛ bɛɛ san gʋtʋn duwi-tunalɛ daanɩ, ma ɛbɛ gɛtɛ bɛn taa san fɔ powu, yema gedi gɩɩtɛlɛ Yehoyada ɛn taa yɛ bɛnɩ gɛtɛ bɛ san gʋtʋn duwi-tunalɛ daanɩ fɔ bàà biri san baakpaara. <verse eid="2CH 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 23:9" />Gɛ Yehoyada ɛ tɛ bɩtà bʋʋ bɛndɩrɛ gɛtɛ bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ akpilin ton-ton bɛ sa bɔɔ gatɩn fɔ bɩtʋrʋnyan ma awɔrɔnyan-dɩyɛlɛ-koro adɩrɛ-dɩrɛ ma aburuburu gɛtɛ ì di egyu Dafidi woyo, gɛ ɩ̀ dɔ Wurubwarɛ Dikwo-dɩrɛ daanɩ fɔ. <verse eid="2CH 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 23:10" />Gɛ ɛ yɛ bɛdɩyɛlɛ fɔ be yela be silin egyu fɔ gɛtɛ bè de baakpanyan. Be yela ye gbɛma gedi gɩɩ gɛtɛ̀kʋn ma Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ, ye gatɩn gɩɩ gɩlan ma sere gatala gɩɩ gɩlan.<verse eid="2CH 23:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 23:11" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Yehoyada ma wo bebi-teni bɛ ka Yowasi be ye okòro gɛ be tin wɔ digyu-koto, gɛ bɛ ka ise yɩɩ gɩkpa bɛ tɛ wɔ, gɛ be sɩ̀ wɔ bugyu. Bɛ sʋrʋ wɔ bʋnɔ gɛ bɛ ka afala bɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Egyu sara nkpa ma ɔfɔ!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2CH 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 23:12" />Gɛtɛ Ataliya ɛ nʋn afala gɛtɛ bɛnɩ fɔ bɛ gbɛrɛ be di ɔsɛ fɔ, ɛ san baakʋn Yahwe Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ daanɩ. <verse eid="2CH 23:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 23:13" />Gɛtɛ ɛ nya fɔ, e we egyu-dɩrɛ fɔ è yela ma pila otunu. Bɛndɩrɛbi fɔ ma akantan yɩɩ bɛfʋ̀nlɛ bè yela egyu fɔ wakʋn, gɛ gɛtʋnkwaa fɔ gɩɩ bɛnɩ powu bee di ɔsɛ, gɛ bɛɛ fʋ̀n akantan, gɛ ɩnʋn yɩɩ bɛnʋmalɛ bè de ɩnʋn yɩɩ gɛnʋma gaanyan bɛɛ nʋma gesila gɩɩ-ɩnʋn. Ɛwʋ gɛ Ataliya e gye wɔ ngba ɛ fɛɛran, gɛ ɛ gbɛrɛ afala kin-kin alan,&lt;&lt;Ɛgbanlɛ bɛnɩ! Ɛgbanlɛ bɛnɩ!<verse eid="2CH 23:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 23:14" />Ɛwʋ gɛ gedi gɩɩtɛlɛ Yehoyada ɛ dɔ̀ bɩtà bʋʋ bɛndɩrɛ gɛtɛ bɛɛ nya bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ akpilin ton-ton boo koro fɔ alan, &lt;&lt;I tiri wɔ i ye bɛnɩ fɔ baanɩ, fɔ yàà wolo ɛkamasɛ gɛtɛ ɛ̀ tɛrɛma wɔ fɔ. Yema gedi gɩɩtɛlɛ fɔ ɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;Ɩ kara wolo wɔ Yahwe Dikwo-dɩrɛ daanɩ.&gt; &gt;&gt; <verse eid="2CH 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 23:15" />Okoro be gye wɔ, ɔkʋna gɛtɛ ee gyu Abengyi Yiitunu, digyu-kpaara fɔ daanɩ fɔ, gɛ be wolo wɔ dʋkɔbɛ.<verse eid="2CH 23:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 23:16" />Yehoyada ma bɛnɩ fɔ ma egyu fɔ bɛ tà dikola gɛtɛ baà mɛ Yahwe bɛnɩ. <verse eid="2CH 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 23:17" />Ɛwʋ gɛ bɛnɩ fɔ powu bɛ san Baali dikpen-kwo bɛ ma sila dɩ bɛ fɩna. Be gbena gedi gaatɛ̀kʋn ma bekpen fɔ buruburu gɛ be wolo Baali wokpente Matan gedi gaatɛ̀kʋn dʋkɔ.<verse eid="2CH 23:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 23:18" />Gɛ Yehoyada ɛ sɩ̀ bɛdɩyɛlɛ Yahwe Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ daanɩ. Gɛ ɛ ka Yahwe Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ dɩɩ gʋtʋn ɛ sa gedi gɩɩ bɛtɛlɛ ma Lefi bete baalɔ fɔ bàà mɛ gʋtʋn gɛtɛ Dafidi ɛ tɛ bɛ alɛ bɛ mɛ Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ daanɩ fɔ. Wù di gɛtɛ bàà tɩ̀ tɛ Yahwe gekuma gii gedi anlɛ gɛtɛ bɛ ŋwara bɛ sa Mose Wose yɩɩ gɩkpa gaanɩ fɔ, fɔ bàà nʋma ɩnʋn anlɛ gɛtɛ Dafidi ɛ dɔ̀ bɛ fɔ. <verse eid="2CH 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 23:19" />Gɛ e biri ɛ sɩ̀ otunu wʋʋ bɛdɩyɛlɛ gɛtɛ bàà nya Dikwo-dɩrɛ dii tunun yii koro, fɔ ɛnɩ gɛtɛ ɛ̀ ba dɩdɩɩ fɔ ɛ kara wura e gyu daanɩ.<verse eid="2CH 23:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 23:20" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Yehoyada ɛ ka bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ bɔɔ bɛndɩrɛ gɛtɛ bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ akpilin ton-ton bɛ̀ sa bɔɔ gatɩn fɔ ma bɛnɩ gɛtɛ bɛ ba gingyebi, ma begyegeyelɛ, ma gatʋnkwa fɔ gɩɩ bɛnɩ powu gɛ bɛ tɛrɛma egyu fɔ be ye Yahwe Dikwo-dɩrɛ daanɩ. Bɛ da gɛ ma Gatala Giitunun fɔ waanɩ be gyu digyu-kpaara fɔ daanɩ, gɛ bɛ ka egyu fɔ bɛ sɩ̀ gigyu-bɩya gii koro. <verse eid="2CH 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 23:21" />Gɩfɩɩ fɔ gɩɩ bɛnɩ powu be di ɔsɛ, gɛ olila wʋ ba gɩfɩɩ fɔ gaanɩ, yema be wolo Ataliya.<verse eid="2CH 23:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="2CH 24" />
  <para style="s1">Yuda wogyu Yowasi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2KI 12:1-16">2 Begyu-dɩrɛ 12:1-16</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 24:1" />Ɔkʋna gɛtɛ Yowasi è di bugyu fɔ ɛ̀ ba bɩkyan kwarankɩ, gɛ e di bugyu Yerusalem bɩkyan akpilin anyɔɔ (40). Wɔna diyere n di Sibiya, e ye Beseba. <verse eid="2CH 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 24:2" />Gedi gɩɩtɛlɛ Yehoyada wawi powu yaanɩ fɔ, Yowasi ɛ mɛ ade gɛtɛ ɩ̀ tʋna Yahwe bʋnʋn. <verse eid="2CH 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 24:3" />Yehoyada e to bɛna bɛnyɔɔ ɛ tɛ Yowasi, gɛ e wo bebi-teni ma bebi-nanɩ.<verse eid="2CH 24:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 24:4" />Bɩkyan bʋkɩ bʋʋ gama fɔ, Yowasi ɛ sa amɩnlɛ alɛ ɛɛ̀ pɩna Yahwe Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ. <verse eid="2CH 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 24:5" />Gɛ e kpèlè gedi gɩɩ bɛtɛlɛ ma Lefi bete fɔ gɛ ɛ dɔ̀ bɛ alan, &lt;&lt;Ɩ san Yuda watele, fɔ yàà ma to gɩkyan gɩɩ sɩka gɛtɛ bɛnɩ fɔ bee le fɔ, fɔ tàà ka tɩ̀ pɩna yii Wurubwarɛ Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ. Ɩ tɔ ɩ san nkenkele.&gt;&gt; Mɔ Lefi bete fɔ bɛn tɔ ade fɔ yii koro bilen.<verse eid="2CH 24:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 24:6" />Okoro egyu e kpèlè gedi gɩɩtɛlɛ ɛndɩrɛ Yehoyada, gɛ e lila wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Anʋn yii koro gɛ an tɛ yɛ Lefi bete bàà to kɔba gɛtɛ Yahwe wɔsaranyan Mose ɛ tɛ ose alɛ be le be ye Yuda ma Yerusalem bàà ka mɛ Yahwe Dɩyan dii dikwo dɩɩ gʋtʋn fɔ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2CH 24:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 24:7" />Duyu-kɛma dɩɩna Ataliya bebi-teni bɛ ma gbena Yahwe Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ, gɛ bɛ ka anyan-fɩrɩnfɩrɩn fɔ ɩkɩ bɛ sʋma Baali.<verse eid="2CH 24:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 24:8" />Okoro Yowasi ɛ yɛ Lefi bete fɔ bɛ mɛ dɩdaka-tolɛ sɩka, gɛ bɛ ka dɩ bɛ sɩ̀ Yahwe Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ diitunun okòro. <verse eid="2CH 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 24:9" />Gɛ bɛ sa Yerusalem ma Yuda bete ɔtʋn alɛ ɛnɩ-kamasɛ ɛ ka kɔba gɛtɛ Yahwe wɔsaranyan Mose ɛ tɛ ose otonkuma waanɩ alɛ Isareli bete bɛ ka bɛ bɛ tɛ Yahwe fɔ bɛ ba. <verse eid="2CH 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 24:10" />Gɛ bɛndɩrɛbi fɔ ma bɛnɩ fɔ powu bɛ ka bɔɔ kɔba bɛ ba sa dɩdaka fɔ daanɩ ɔsɛ waanɩ, ka ma sere gɛtɛ dɩdaka fɔ dɩ yɔn. <verse eid="2CH 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 24:11" />Ɔyɛ-kamasɛ gɛtɛ dɩdaka fɔ dɩ̀ yɔn fɔ, Lefi bete fɔ bɛɛ ka dɩ bɛ ma tɛ egyu-dɩrɛ bɛndɩrɛbi. Fɔ egyu gɩkpa gɩɩŋwaralɛ ma gedi gɩɩ tɛlɛ ɛndɩrɛ wɔmalɛ bee tiri kɔba fɔ be ye dɩdaka fɔ daanɩ, fɔ be birima dɩ bɛ ma sɩ̀ dɩɩ gɛsarakʋn. Bɛɛ mɛ gɛlɛ duwi n di duwi, gɛ be wura kɔba gepepe.<verse eid="2CH 24:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 24:12" />Ɛwʋ gɛ egyu ma Yehoyada bɛ ka kɔba fɔ bɛ sa ɛbɛ gɛtɛ bɛɛ nya Yahwe Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ dɩɩ gɛpɩna gii koro fɔ bɔɔ gʋlɔ. Gɛ bɛ hayɩ ɩpɔrɩ yɩɩ bɛmaralɛ ma bɛkapɩnta, gɛ bɛ nɩ̀ hayɩ gɩwɔrɔnyan-sɩya ma gɩwɔrɔnyan yɩɩ bʋtʋn bʋʋ bɛmɛlɛ bàà bɛ pɩna Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ.<verse eid="2CH 24:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 24:13" />Gɛ ɛbɛ gɛtɛ bɛɛ mɛ gʋtʋn fɔ bɛ ka ɔkɛma bɛ mɛ gʋtʋn fɔ. Bɛ pɩna Wurubwarɛ dii Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ anlɛ gɛtɛ dɩ̀ fʋrʋma dɩ̀ dɔ fɔ, gɛ di wura ɔkɛma dɩ fɩya. <verse eid="2CH 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 24:14" />Gɛtɛ bɛ mɛ gɛpɩna gɩɩ gʋtʋn fɔ be were fɔ, bɛ ka kɔba gɛtɛ wu kuruma fɔ bɛ bɛ tɛ egyu ma Yehoyada. Gɛ bɛ ka wʋ bɛ mɛ anyan kperen-kperen bɛ sa Yahwe Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ daanɩ. Ɛyɩ n di anyan gɛtɛ bɛɛ ka bɛ sʋma, ma ɛyɩ gɛtɛ bɛɛ ka bɛ tɛ gekuma gii gedi, ma bɛtasa, ma bɩtɩyɛ, ma anyan gɛtɛ bɛ ka sɩka-sɩya ma sɩka-fututu bɛ mɛ fɔ. Gɛ awi powu gɛtɛ Yehoyada è si nkpa fɔ, bɛɛ tɩ̀ tɛ Yahwe gekuma gii gedi ɔya-kamasɛ Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ daanɩ.<verse eid="2CH 24:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 24:15" />Yehoyada ɛ dan gepepe, e di bɩkyan akpilin kooron ma fwo (130), gɛ e ku. <verse eid="2CH 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 24:16" />Be lò wɔ begyu boo gelòkʋn, ɔkʋn gɛtɛ bee kpèlè Dafidi Ditele fɔ, wade-kpara gɛtɛ ɛ mɛ ɛ tɛ Wurubwarɛ ma wo Dikwo-dɩrɛ Isareli anɩ fɔ wuu koro.<verse eid="2CH 24:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yowasi duyu-kɛma daade</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 24:17" />Yehoyada diku dɩɩ gama fɔ, Yuda bɛndɩrɛbi bɛ ka gebù bɛ ma kura egyu Yowasi, gɛ ɛ nʋn baakʋn. <verse eid="2CH 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 24:18" />Be kere bootu ɛbɛ boo Wurubwarɛ, Yahwe Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ daanɩ dɩɩ gɛsʋma bɛ ya gɛ bɛ yɛ bɛɛ sʋma gɛ Asera wo-iyon, ma bekpen. Okoro Wurubwarɛ wowurufa wʋ ba Yuda ma Yerusalem bete boo koro.<verse eid="2CH 24:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 24:19" />Ma gɛtɛ Yahwe ɛ sa wɔ bɛtabʋrʋlɛ bɛnɩ fɔ baakʋn gɛtɛ bàà biri ba wakʋn, gɛ be tiri baade-kpen be sere bɛ gba fɔ, bɛn nʋn baakʋn.<verse eid="2CH 24:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 24:20" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Wurubwarɛ gifiye gɩ sara Yehoyada wobi-teni Sekariya wo koro, gɛ e yela bɛnɩ fɔ bɔɔ bʋnʋn ɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Wurubwarɛ alan, &lt;Anʋn yii koro gɛ ɩn taa di Yahwe wo-ise fɔ yii koro? Wʋn nan pe wʋ tɛ yɩ. Yema i kere Yahwe ɩ ya, gɛ wʋ yɛ ɛwɔ mɔ e kere yɩ ɛ ya.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="2CH 24:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 24:21" />Mɔ bɛnɩ fɔ bɛ mɛ onyun alɛ baà wolo Sekariya. Ɛwʋ gɛ egyu ɛ dɔ̀ bɛ alɛ be fun wɔ ataa be wolo Yahwe Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ daanɩ. <verse eid="2CH 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 24:22" />Egyu Yowasi ɛn kʋna gɩnɩ-kpara gɛtɛ Sekariya wote Yehoyada e tiri e wùlà wɔ fɔ, mɔ e wolo wobi. Gɛtɛ Sekariya ɛɛ kpà ma diku fɔ, ɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Yahwe ɛ nya ade gɛtɛ aa mɛ lɛ, fɔ ɛ̀ɛ̀ dɔ̀ aa gɔdɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2CH 24:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 24:23" />Gɛtɛ gɩkyan fɔ gii were fɔ, Aram bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ bɛ ma bʋn be yela Yowasi wo koro. Bɛ sʋ Yuda ma Yerusalem bɛ sa, gɛ be wolo boo begyegeyelɛ fɔ powu, gɛ be kpila baanyan kpekpesi bɛ san bɛ ma tɛ boogyu Damasiko. <verse eid="2CH 24:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CH 24:24" />Ma gɛtɛ Aram bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ gɛtɛ bɛ ma sʋ Yuda ma Yerusalem bɛ sa fɔ bɛn sɔ gba fɔ, Yahwe ɛ yɛ bɛ be di Yuda bete fɔ boo koro, yema Yuda bete be kere Yahwe, bootu ɛbɛ boo Wurubwarɛ fɔ bɛ ya, okoro Wurubwarɛ e tɩn Yowasi dɩpwɛ. <verse eid="2CH 24:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CH 24:25" />Gɛ ɔkʋna gɛtɛ Aram bete be ye akpà fɔ yaanɩ fɔ, be pira Yowasi gɛtɛ wʋn ma gɛnya. Mɔ ɛwɔ gbagba bɛndɩrɛbi bɛ mɛ onyun wo koro, gɛ be wolo wɔ wɔ gɛdʋrɔkʋn yema gɛtɛ e wolo gedi gɩɩtɛlɛ Yehoyada wobi-teni fɔ wuu koro. Okoro e ku, gɛ be lò wɔ ɔkʋn gɛtɛ bee kpèlè alɛ Dafidi Ditele fɔ, mɔ nka begyu boo gelòkʋn fɔ baanɩ. <verse eid="2CH 24:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CH 24:26" />Ɛbɛ gɛtɛ bɛ mɛ onyun wo koro fɔ n di Amon-na Simeyati wobi-teni Sabedi, ma Mowabi-na Simriti wobi-teni Yehosabadi. <verse eid="2CH 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CH 24:27" />Bɛ ŋwara ade gɛtɛ Yowasi bebi-teni bɛ mɛ, ma ade gɛtɛ Wurubwarɛ bɛtabʋrʋlɛ bɛ tabʋrʋ ka dama wo koro, ma anlɛ gɛtɛ ɛ pɩna Wurubwarɛ Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ bɛ sa begyu baakpa yaanɩ. Gɛ wobi Amasiya e di bugyu e sere wɔ gɩsɩrɩ.<verse eid="2CH 24:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="2CH 25" />
  <para style="s1">Yuda wogyu Amasiya</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2KI 14:2-6">2 Begyu-dɩrɛ 14:2-6</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 25:1" />Ɔkʋna Amasiya e di bugyu fɔ ɛ̀ ba bɩkyan dikpilin ma ton, gɛ e di bugyu Yerusalem bɩkyan dikpilin ma yɛkɩ. Wɔna diyere n di Yehowadin gɛtɛ e ye Yerusalem fɔ. <verse eid="2CH 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 25:2" />Ɛ mɛ ade gɛtɛ ɩ̀ tʋna Yahwe bʋnʋn, mɔ nka ma woturu powu. <verse eid="2CH 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 25:3" />Ɔkʋna gɛtɛ Amasiya wo bugyu bu sere ɩkpaa gepepe fɔ, e wolo bɛndɩrɛbi gɛtɛ be wolo wote fɔ. <verse eid="2CH 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 25:4" />Mɔ en wolo bɛndɩrɛbi fɔ boo bebi, yema bɛ ŋwara Mose Ise yɩɩ Gɩkpa gaanɩ alɛ Yahwe ɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Ɩ kara wolo bɛtaawe bebi baade-kpen yii koro, gɛ ɩ kara wolo bebi bɛtaawe baade-kpen yii koro, ɛkamasɛ wade-kpen gɛtɛ ɛ mɛ fɔ yii diku gɛ eè ku&gt;&gt; okoro.<verse eid="2CH 25:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 25:5" />Gɛ Amasiya e kpèlè Yuda wofoli ma Benyamin wofoli wuu bete e tuma, gɛ ɛ sɩ̀ bɛ akpen-akpen, gɛ e tiri bɩtà bʋʋ bɛndɩrɛ gɛtɛ bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ nkpɩn ton-ton, ma ɛbɛ gɛtɛ akpilin ton-ton bɛ̀ sa bɔɔ gatɩn fɔ ɛ sɩ̀ odu waakpaara-akpaara yiinyun. Gɛ ɛ kalan ɛbɛ gɛtɛ be di bɩkyan dikpilin ka bʋn fɔ. Ɛbɛ powu bɛ ba asepekyi fwo-ton (300,000) gɛtɛ baà talɩ be ton gɩtʋrʋnyan ma gɩwɔrɔnyan-panpasan-dɩyɛlɛ koro bɛ san akpà. <verse eid="2CH 25:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 25:6" />Gɛ e biri ɛ hayɩ bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ asepekyi ton (100,000) e ye Isareli fɔ èè le bɛ sɩka-fututu gɛtɛ wʋʋdʋrʋ wʋ̀ ba bekilo gbaa ɛkɩ ma nkpɩn kwarankɩ (3,400).<verse eid="2CH 25:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 25:7" />Mɔ Wurubwarɛ wɔtabʋrʋlɛ ɛkɩ ɛ ba wakʋn ɛ bɛ dɔ̀ wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Oo egyu-dɩrɛ, kara yɛ Isareli bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ nyabɛ bàà fɩya ma awɔ san, yema alɛ Yahwe ɛn fɩya ma Isareli bete, gɛ ɛn fɩya ma Efrayim gba. <verse eid="2CH 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 25:8" />Gɛ gengyi à san a ma kpà lann fɔ, Wurubwarɛ ɛɛ̀ yɛ aa bɛkyʋnlɛ fɔ bàà di aa koro. Yema Wurubwarɛ n ba ɔkɛma gɛtɛ ɛ̀ɛ̀ kpà aa bɛkyʋnlɛ abɛɛ ɛ̀ɛ̀ yɛ bɛ bàà nʋ̀n bɩtà baanɩ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2CH 25:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 25:9" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Amasiya e lila Wurubwarɛ wɔtabʋrʋlɛ fɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Gɛ gɛtɛ na were le sɩka-fututu gɛtɛ wʋʋdʋrʋ wʋ̀ ba bekilo gbaa ɛkɩ ma nkpɩn kwarankɩ (3,400) lɛ de?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CH 25:9">Gɛ Wurubwarɛ wɔtabʋrʋlɛ fɔ e tiri wuunyun alan, &lt;&lt;Yahwe ɛ̀ talɩ ɛ tɛ wɔ̀ ɛ da gɛlɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2CH 25:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 25:10" />Okoro Amasiya e tiri bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ gɛtɛ be ye Efrayim bɛ ba wakʋn fɔ osele, gɛ ɛ yɛ bɛ be biri bɛ da bɔɔlɛ. Bɛ ka owurufa Yuda wo koro, gɛ bɛ tɔ bɛ da bɔɔlɛ ma owurufa.<verse eid="2CH 25:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 25:11" />Gɛ Amasiya e sere oturu, gɛ e gyegeye wɔ bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ fɔ bɔɔ bʋnʋn, gɛ bɛ san Bʋbɔlɛ bʋʋ Dɩtagba fɔ daanɩ, gɛ e wolo Edom bete ɩgbaa ton (10,000) dʋkɔbɛ. <verse eid="2CH 25:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 25:12" />Yuda bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ fɔ be ni gye bɛnɩ ɩgbaa ton (10,000) gʋnʋn-ŋɔrɔ, gɛ bɛ ka bɛ bɛ bʋn dɩtaa-tɔlɛ dɩkɩ dii koro, gɛ be tunla bɛ be ye gatala dʋkɔ bɛ fɩna gɛtʋnkwaa, gɛ be sila kpeti-kpeti.<verse eid="2CH 25:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 25:13" />Gɛ bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ gɛtɛ Amasiya ɛn yɛ bɛ bàà tɛrɛma bɛ san akpa fɔ bɛ ma tin Yuda watele yaanɩ ye Samariya ma gyu Beti-Horon. Be wolo bɛnɩ Gbaa ma nkpɩn-ton (3,000) gɛ be kpila anyɩmɩnyan kpekpesi bɛ da.<verse eid="2CH 25:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 25:14" />Gɛtɛ Amasiya ɛ ma di Edom bete boo koro e be gyu fɔ, ɛ ka bekpen gɛtɛ e to e ye baakʋn fɔ ɛ ba wakʋn. Ɛ tɩyɛ bɛ ɛ sɩ̀ anlɛ ɛwɔ gbagba wo bekpen, gɛ ɛ sʋma bɛ, gɛ ɛ tɛ bɛ gekuma gii gedi. <verse eid="2CH 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 25:15" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Yahwe wowurufa wʋ tɔ Amasiya wuu koro, gɛ ɛ sa wɔtabʋrʋlɛ ɛkɩ wakʋn alan, &lt;&lt;Anʋn yii koro gɛ a sʋma bɛnɩ nyabɛ boo bekpen gɛtɛ bɛn talɩ be to bɛ be ye aalɔ yaanɩ fɔ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2CH 25:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 25:16" />Gɛtɛ Wurubwarɛ wɔtabʋrʋlɛ fɔ ɛ̀ sangba ɛɛ tabʋrʋ fɔ, egyu-dɩrɛ e lila wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Ti tiri wɔ̀ alɛ mɛ amɩnlɛ-yɩɩtɛlɛ tɛ egyu-dɩrɛ? Ten! Nka gɛlɛ nan wolo wɔ̀.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CH 25:16">Okoro Wurubwarɛ wɔtabʋrʋlɛ fɔ e kere gɛtabʋrʋ ɛ ya, mɔ ɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Ǹ nyɩ gɛtɛ Wurubwarɛ ɛ mɛ gɛtɛ eè muru wɔ̀, yema ade nyayɩ gɛtɛ a mɛ gɛ an nʋn maade gɛtɛ na dɔ̀ fɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2CH 25:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 25:17" />Gamama gɛtɛ Yuda wogyu-dɩrɛ Amasiya e to amɩnlɛ e ye waamɩnlɛ-yɩɩbɛtɛlɛ baakʋn fɔ, ɛ sa Yehohasi gɛtɛ è di Yehowahasi wobi, gɛ è di Isareli wogyu-dɩrɛ Yehu wɔnana fɔ ɔtʋn alan, &lt;&lt; Bè tuma mɩ, fɔ tàà kpà.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2CH 25:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 25:18" />Mɔ Isareli wogyu Yehowasi e birima ɔtʋn ɛ tɩyɛma Yuda wogyu Amasiya alan, &lt;&lt;Dɩfa ma iwiya gɛtɛ ɩ̀ sa Lebanon wo-idon yaanɩ fɔ ɩ sa seda wo-iyon ɔtʋn alɛ, &lt;Ka aabi-nanɩ tɛ miinbi-teni èè to gɩna.&gt; Ɛwʋ gɛ dɩfa dɩɩnan ɛkɩ e be kyikya dɩfa ma iwiya fɔ ɛ mɩna. <verse eid="2CH 25:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 25:19" />Wʋ̀ sa waanɩ alɛ a di Edom bete boo koro, gɛ wʋ yɛ wɔ̀ aa bʋma koro gatala. Yɛ wàà di wɔ̀ gʋnʋn alɛ a di boo koro, mɔ waran sara aalɛ! Anʋn yii koro gɛ aa len ade gɛtɛ yaà ka gyerebi ɩ mɔma awɔ ma Yuda bɛnɩ powu?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2CH 25:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 25:20" />Mɔ Amasiya e terema, ɛn nʋn. Yema Wurubwarɛ ɛ wɛrɛ mɛ ɛ sɩ̀ gɛtɛ ɛɛ̀ yɛ Yehowasi èè di Amasiya wo koro gɛtɛ e biri ɛ ma sʋma Edom bekpen fɔ wuu koro. <verse eid="2CH 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 25:21" />Okoro Isareli wogyu-dɩrɛ Yehowasi ɛ san ɛ ma tama Yuda wogyu-dɩrɛ Amasiya Beti-Semesi ditele gɛtɛ dɩ̀ sa Yuda gɛtʋnkwaa gaanɩ gɛ bɛ tà bɩtà. <verse eid="2CH 25:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 25:22" />Isareli bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ be di Yuda bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ fɔ boo koro, gɛ wʋ yɛ Yuda bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ fɔ be serenti bɛ da baatele yaanɩ. <verse eid="2CH 25:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 25:23" />Isareli wogyu Yehowasi e gye Yuda wogyu Amasiya gɛtɛ è di Yowasi wobi, gɛ è di Ahasiya wɔnana fɔ bɩtà Beti-Semesi. Gɛ Yehowasi ɛ san Yerusalem ɛ ma sila Yerusalem wɔpɔrɩ fɔ ɛ fɩna, ye Efrayim Wotunu ka ma sere otunu gɛtɛ bee kpèlè Kɔna Wotunu fɔ. Ɔpɔrɩ gɛtɛ e sila fɔ waà mɛ bɩsɩrɩ nkpɩn bisiyee (600). <verse eid="2CH 25:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CH 25:24" />Gɛ be kpila sɩka-sɩya ma sɩka-fututu powu, ma anyɩmɩnyan gɛtɛ be we Yahwe Dikwo-dɩrɛ daanɩ gɛtɛ Obedi-Edom ɛɛ nya yii koro fɔ, fɩya ma digyu-kpaara daanyan-kpara fɔ ma bɛnɩ gɛtɛ be gye fɔ, gɛ ɛ ka bɛ e birima ɛ da Samariya. <verse eid="2CH 25:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CH 25:25" />Yowasi wobi Amasiya gɛtɛ è di Yuda wogyu-dɩrɛ fɔ ɛ sara nkpa bɩkyan fwo-ton Yehowahasi wobi Yehowasi gɛtɛ è di Isareli wogyu-dɩrɛ diku dɩɩ gama. <verse eid="2CH 25:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CH 25:26" />Ade-kurumakyɛɛ gɛtɛ Amasiya ɛ mɛ, ma ɛyɩ gɛtɛ ɛ mɛ wo bugyu buu gedi baanɩ, ye digyegeye ma sere ɔkʋna fɔ, bɛ ŋwara yɩ bɛ sa Yuda ma Isareli begyu-dɩrɛ boo koro gaade yɩɩ gɩkpa-dɩrɛ fɔ gaanɩ. <verse eid="2CH 25:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CH 25:27" />Ye ɔkʋna gɛtɛ Amasiya e kere Yahwe gɛsʋma ɛ ya fɔ, Yerusalem bɛnɩ bɛ mɛ onyun bàà wolo Amasiya, gɛ e serenti ɛ san Lakisi. Mɔ bɛ sa bɛnɩ bɛ tɛrɛma wɔ bɛ san dʋkɔ bɛ ma wolo wɔ. <verse eid="2CH 25:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2CH 25:28" />Gɛ bɛ ka wo gikpena fɔ bɛ gyaga dibengyi dii koro bɛ ba Yerusalem, gɛ be lò wɔ wotu ɛbɛ boo gelòkʋn, ɔkʋn gɛtɛ bee kpèlè Dafidi Ditele fɔ.<verse eid="2CH 25:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="2CH 26" />
  <para style="s1">Yuda wogyu Usiya</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2KI 14:21-22">2 Begyu-dɩrɛ 14:21-22</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 15:1-7">15:1-7</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 26:1" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Yuda bɛnɩ powu be gye Usiya gɛtɛ e di bɩkyan fwo-kooron fɔ bɛ sɩ̀ bugyu be sere wote Amasiya gɩsɩrɩ. <verse eid="2CH 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 26:2" />Gɛtɛ wote e ku wʋʋ gama fɔ, ɛwɔ na pɩna na sere Elati ɛ tɛ Yuda.<verse eid="2CH 26:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 26:3" />Usiya e di bugyu fɔ ɛ̀ ba bɩkyan fwo-kooron, gɛ e di bugyu Yerusalem bɩkyan akpilin anyɔɔ ma fwo-bʋnyɔɔ (52). Wɔna diyere n di Yekoliya, gɛ e ye Yerusalem <verse eid="2CH 26:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 26:4" />Ɛ mɛ ade gɛtɛ ɩ̀ tʋna Yahwe bʋnʋn anlɛ gɛtɛ wote Amasiya ɛ mɛ fɔ. <verse eid="2CH 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 26:5" />Ɔkʋna gɛtɛ Sekariya è si nkpa, gɛ ɛɛ tɩ̀ tabʋrʋ ɛ tɛ Usiya Wurubwarɛ geserenti gaanɩ fɔ, ɛ san Wurubwarɛ gelenbi gaanɩ. Gɛ Wurubwarɛ ɛ yɛ ade i pe ɩ tɛ wɔ.<verse eid="2CH 26:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 26:6" />Usiya ɛ san ɛ ma kpà ma Filisiti bete gɛ e gbena Gati, ma Yabine, ma Asidodi bɔ-ɩpɔrɩ. Gɛ ɛ pɩna e sere atele gbɛma Asidodi ma ɩkʋn-fon, Filisiti bete baanɩ. <verse eid="2CH 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 26:7" />Gɛ Wurubwarɛ ɛ yɛ wɔ e di Filisita bete, ma Arabi bete gɛtɛ bɛ sa Guri-Baali ma Mewun bete boo koro <verse eid="2CH 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 26:8" />Amori bete bee le gɩkyan-gɩkyan gii gutoro bɛ tɛ Usiya, gɛ e wura ɔkɛma-dɩrɛ gɛtɛ wʋ yɛ wo diyere dɩ yasɩ dɩ ma ye sɩyɛɛ Egyipiti wɔ-ɩbalan yaanɩ.<verse eid="2CH 26:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 26:9" />Usiya ɛ mara ayelakʋn-dɩyɛlɛ Yerusalem ma otunu gɛtɛ bee kpèlè Kɔna Wotunu fɔ, ma Dɩtagba Diitunu, ma ɔkʋn gɛtɛ ɔpɔrɩ fɔ wu fi fɔ, gɛ ɛ mara ɩpɔrɩ ɛ sa yɩ. <verse eid="2CH 26:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 26:10" />Gɛ e biri ɛ mara ayelakʋn-dɩyɛlɛ otonkuma yaanɩ gɛ e kunla atiribun yema ɛ ba ditele dɩ bɛnan kpekpesi odon wʋʋ bɩsɩrɩ wuufila wʋʋ gɛnʋ̀nkʋn gɩɩ gɩlan ma wɔtalɩ waanɩ. Usiya ee len bʋfʋn baade okoro ɛ yɛ bɛnɩ bɛ fʋn wayɩn wo-ili idon yɩɩ ntʋnkwaa baanɩ, ma ntʋnkwaa-kpara baanɩ.<verse eid="2CH 26:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 26:11" />Usiya e wura bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ gɛtɛ be wùlà bɛ akpa yɩɩ gakpa gepepe. Be yo baanɩ akpen-akpen tɛ akpa anlɛ gɛtɛ wɔ gɩkpa gɩɩ ŋwaralɛ Yeyeli ma ɛndɩrɛbi Maaseya bɛ ŋwara bɛ sa gɩkpa gaanɩ ɔkʋna gɛtɛ Hananiya ɛɛ nya boo koro fɔ. <verse eid="2CH 26:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 26:12" />Akpaara yɩɩ bɛndɩrɛ gɛtɛ bɛɛ nya bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ fɔ boo koro fɔ bɛ̀ ba gbaa ma nkpɩn-busiyee (2,600). <verse eid="2CH 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 26:13" />Bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ asepekyi fwo-ton ma ɩgbaa isiyee ma nkpɩn kwarankɩ ma akpilin ton (307,500) n sa be gyegeyelɛ fɔ bɔɔ gatɩn gɛtɛ be wula bɛ akpa yɩɩ gakpa gepepe, ɔkɛma-dɩrɛ wuu bete gɛtɛ baà tɩ̀ tà bɔɔ bɛ kyʋnlɛ bɩtà bɛ tɛ egyu-dɩrɛ. <verse eid="2CH 26:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 26:14" />Usiya ɛ tɛ bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ fɔ baanɩ-kamasɛ gɩwɔrɔnyan-dɩyɛlɛ koro, ma bɩsɩnta, ma gɩwɔrɔnyan gaakoto, ma bɩtà bʋʋ ngba, ma agyatʋrʋ, ma bɛtaya. <verse eid="2CH 26:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 26:15" />Gɛ wɔ bɛnɩ gɛtɛ bɛ̀ nyɩ̀ alɔ yaanɩ yaadawʋ yɩɩ bʋtʋn yɩɩ gɛ mɛ fɔ, bɛ mɛ ɩdʋ gɛtɛ yiiko-yiiko ɩɩ talɩ ɩ tà bɩsɩnta, gɛ ɩɩ talɩ i fun ataa-dɩrɛ-dɩrɛ, gɛ ii fun bɩsɩnta ma ataa i ye Yerusalem ayelakʋn-dɩyɛlɛ ma ɩpɔrɩ yii koro. Gɛ wo diyere di ye, gɛ e wura ɔkɛma-dɩrɛ yema Wurubwarɛ ɛ kpà wɔ.<verse eid="2CH 26:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 26:16" />Mɔ gɛtɛ Usiya e wura ɔkɛma fɔ, wɔ gɛbʋma koro gatala wʋ yɛ wɔ ɛ nʋ̀n. En di nʋnkwarɩ tɛ Yahwe, wɔ Wurubwarɛ fɔ, gɛ e gyu Yahwe Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ daanɩ e kuma olifwi, olifwi wuu gedi gɩɩ gɛtɛ̀kʋn fɔ gii koro. <verse eid="2CH 26:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 26:17" />Gɛ gedi gɩɩtɛlɛ Asariya, fɩya ma gedi gɩɩ bɛtɛlɛ akpilin anaa do gɛtɛ bɛ̀ ba oturu bɛ tɛrɛma wɔ be gyu Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ daanɩ. <verse eid="2CH 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 26:18" />Bɛ ma sʋ wɔ, gɛ bɛ dɔ̀ wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Usiya! Nka awɔ nan kuma olifwi a tɛ Yahwe. Gedi gɩɩ bɛtɛlɛ gɛtɛ bè di Aaron wodu wʋʋ bɛnɩ gɛtɛ bɛ kpa koro dɩdɩɩ fɔ bɔɔ gʋtʋn gɩlɛ. Ye ɔkʋn fɩrɩnfɩrɩn-kʋn nfan san, yema an di nʋnkwarɩ tɛ Yahwe, gɛ ɛn nan hira wɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2CH 26:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 26:19" />Fɔ Usiya è yela gedi gɩɩ gɛtɛ̀kʋn fɔ gɩɩpɩ è de olifwi wʋʋ bɛtasabi. Gɛ ɛ ka owurufa ma gedi gɩɩ bɛtɛlɛ fɔ Yahwe Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ daanɩ dʋkɔ, disere-kɩlɩn fɔ, akyanga-kpen akɩ ɩ ŋwan wɔ gɛyɛ gii koro. <verse eid="2CH 26:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 26:20" />Gɛtɛ gedi gɩɩtɛlɛ ɛndɩrɛ Asariya ma gedi gɩɩ bɛtɛlɛ do fɔ powu bɛ nya fɔ, be we gɛtɛ akyanga ɩ ŋwan wɔ bʋnʋn. Okoro bɛ kpaara wɔ be ye okòro. Ɛwɔ gbagba mɔ e kutuma e ye, yema Yahwe ɛ yɛ geyeba gɩ gbɛrɛ wɔ.<verse eid="2CH 26:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 26:21" />Egyu-dɩrɛ Usiya e gyu akyanga ka ma sere gɛtɛ e ku. Ɛ sara dɩkpaara kperen dɩkɩ daanɩ woko-kwan, gɛ wobi Yotam na yɛ ɛ nya digyukpaara fɔ ma gɩfɩɩ fɔ gɩɩ bɛnɩ boo koro.<verse eid="2CH 26:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 26:22" />Wurubwarɛ wɔtabʋrʋlɛ Amosi wobi Isaya ɛ ŋwara ade-kurumakyɛɛ gɛtɛ Usiya ɛ mɛ wo bugyu buu gedi gaanɩ ye digyegeye ma sere ɔkʋna powu. <verse eid="2CH 26:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 26:23" />Usiya e ku gɛ be lò wɔ gbɛma wotu ɛbɛ bɔɔ bɩsàn gɛtɛ bee lò begyu fɔ, yema bɛnɩ bɛɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Ee yeba akyanga.&gt;&gt; Gɛ wobi Yotam e di bugyu e sere wɔ gɩsɩrɩ.<verse eid="2CH 26:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="2CH 27" />
  <para style="s1">Yuda wogyu Yotam</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2KI 15:32-38">2 Begyu-dɩrɛ 15:32-38</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 27:1" />Yotam e di bɩkyan dikpilin ma ton pɛ gɛ e di bugyu. Gɛ e di bugyu Yerusalem bɩkyan fwo kooron. Wɔna n di Yerusa Sadoki wobi-nanɩ Yerusa. <verse eid="2CH 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 27:2" />Ɛ mɛ ade gɛtɛ ɩ tʋna Yahwe bʋnʋn, anlɛ gɛtɛ wote Usiya ɛ mɛ fɔ. Mɔ Yotam bɩrɛ en gyu Yahwe Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ daanɩ anlɛ gɛtɛ wote ɛ mɛ fɔ. Mɔ fɔ bɛnɩ bɛ̀ bɔ bɛɛ mɛ baade-kpen fɔ. <verse eid="2CH 27:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 27:3" />Yotam na biri na sere Yahwe Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ dɩɩ Gatala Giitunu fɔ, gɛ e biri ɛ mɛ gʋtʋn-dɩrɛ ɛ ka ɛ pɩna ɔpɔrɩ gɛtɛ wʋ̀ gbɛma Ofeli wodon fɔ. <verse eid="2CH 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 27:4" />E sere atele Yuda idon yii koro, gɛ e sere atele gɛtɛ bɛ mara ɩpɔrɩ be silin yi ma ayelakʋn-dɩyɛlɛ akan yaanɩ.<verse eid="2CH 27:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 27:5" />Yotam ɛ ma kpà ma Amon bete boogyu-dɩrɛ, gɛ e di boo koro. Gɩkyan gɩtɔkɔ Amon bete be le wɔ sɩka-fututu bekilo gbaa ma nkpɩn kwarankɩ (3,400), ma anaabi bekilo miliyon, ma amɔrɔ bekilo miliyon. <verse eid="2CH 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 27:6" />Gɛ Yotam e wura ɔkɛma-dɩrɛ yema ɛ tɛrɛma Yahwe nʋnkwarɩ anɩ, wɔ Wurubwarɛ fɔ nʋnkwarɩ anɩ.<verse eid="2CH 27:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 27:7" />Bɛ ŋwara ade-kurumakyɛɛ gɛtɛ Yotam ɛ mɛ wo bugyu buu gedi gaanɩ fɩya ma akpà gɛtɛ ɛ san, ma ade kurumakyɛɛ gɛtɛ ɛ mɛ fɔ, bɛ sa Isareli ma Yuda begyu-dɩrɛ boo koro gaade yɩɩ gɩkpa-dɩrɛ fɔ gaanɩ. <verse eid="2CH 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 27:8" />E di bɩkyan dikpilin ma ton pɛ gɛ e di bugyu. Gɛ e di bugyu Yerusalem bɩkyan fwo kooron. <verse eid="2CH 27:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 27:9" />Yotam e ku gɛ be lò wɔ wotu ɛbɛ bɔɔ bɩsan baanɩ ɔkʋn gɛtɛ bee kpèlè Dafidi Ditele-dɩrɛ fɔ. Gɛ wobi Ahasi e di bugyu e sere wɔ gɩsɩrɩ.<verse eid="2CH 27:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="2CH 28" />
  <para style="s1">Yuda wogyu Ahasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 28:1" />Ahasi e sere bugyu buu bugyu fɔ, ɛ̀ ba bɩkyan dikpilin, gɛ e di bugyu Isareli bɩkyan fwo-kooron. Ɛn tɛrɛma wotu Dafidi wade-mɛlɛ. Ɛn mɛ ade-kpara Yahwe, wo Wurubwarɛ bʋnʋn. <verse eid="2CH 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 28:2" />Ɛ tɛrɛma Isareli begyu boo-isele, gɛ ɛ ka gɩwɔrɔnyan ɛ yalɩ ɛ mɛ ekpen Baali bàà tɩ̀ sʋma wɔ. <verse eid="2CH 28:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 28:3" />E kuma olifwi Ben-Hinom dɩtagba daanɩ, gɛ ɛ ka wo bebi-teni gba ɛ tɛ gekuma gii gedi. Ɛ mɛ ade-kyʋnlɛ anlɛ gɛtɛ bɩfɩɩ gɛtɛ Yahwe e berema e ye Isareli bete bɔɔ bʋnʋn fɔ bɛ mɛ fɔ. <verse eid="2CH 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 28:4" />Ɛɛ tɛ gedi, gɛ ee kuma olifwi asʋmakʋn, ma adenbi yii koro, ma oyon-kusuu-kamasɛ wʋʋ gatɩn.<verse eid="2CH 28:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 28:5" />Gɛlɛ wuu koro Yahwe, wɔ Wurubwarɛ e tiri wɔ ɛ tɛ Aram wogyu, gɛ Aram bete be di Ahasi wo koro. Be gye wɔ bɛnɩ kpekpesi gɛ bɛ ka bɛ bɛ da Damasiko.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CH 28:5">Yahwe e biri ɛ yɛ Isareli wogyu e di Ahasi wo koro, gɛ e wolo wɔ bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ kpekpesi. <verse eid="2CH 28:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 28:6" />Duwi-kɩlɩn daanɩ fɔ, Remaliya wobi Peka e wolo bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ asepekyi kooron (120,000) Yuda anɩ, yema Yuda bɛnɩ be kere Yahwe, bootu ɛbɛ boo Wurubwarɛ fɔ bɛ ya. <verse eid="2CH 28:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 28:7" />Isareli bɩtà bʋʋtàlɛ gɛtɛ bee kpèlè Sikri fɔ na wolo Ahasi wobi Maaseyiya, ma Asrikam gɛtɛ è di ɛndɩrɛbi digyu-kpaara fɔ daanɩ fɔ, ma Elikana gɛtɛ è di egyu wɔmalɛ fɔ. <verse eid="2CH 28:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 28:8" />Ma gɛtɛ Yuda bete bè di Isareli bete bɔɔ bɛ fʋrɩ gba fɔ, Isareli bete fɔ be gye bɔɔsɔ ɛbɛ ma boo bebi asepekyi fwo (200,000), gɛ be kpila baanyan bɛ fɩya, gɛ be tola yɩ bɛ da Samariya.<verse eid="2CH 28:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 28:9" />Mɔ Wurubwarɛ wɔtabʋrʋlɛ Odedi fɔ ɛ sa dʋkɔbɛ, gɛ e ye e tuma bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ gɛtɛ be biri bɛɛ ba Samariya fɔ, gɛ ɛ dɔ̀ bɛ alan, &lt;&lt; Yahwe, yiitu ɛbɛ boo Wurubwarɛ fɔ ɛ ka owurufa Yuda bete boo koro gɛ ɛ yɛ yɩ i di boo koro. Mɔ ɩ mɛ ɩ kààrà gɛ i wolo bɛ omiri-kpen waanɩ. <verse eid="2CH 28:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 28:10" />Gɛ nkele ii len gɛtɛ yàà ka Yuda ma Yerusalem beteni ma bɔɔ bɛnanɩ ɩ mɛ yɩɩ bɛdɩ. Ɩɩn nyɩ̀ alɛ ɛyɩ mɔ ɩ mɛ Yahwe, yii Wurubwarɛ fɔ ade-kpen? <verse eid="2CH 28:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 28:11" />Nʋn ma kʋn! Birima aawɔlɔn ɛbɛ nyabɛ gɛtɛ a gye fɔ san, nka gɛlɛ fɔ Yahwe wowurufa-dɩrɛ waà ba aa koro.<verse eid="2CH 28:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 28:12" />Yehohanan wobi Asariya, ma Mesilemoti wobi Berekiya, ma Salum wobi Yehisikiya, ma Hadayi wobi Amasa gɛtɛ bè di Efrayim bɛndɩrɛbi fɔ mɔ ben yera bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ fɔ baade mɛlɛ fɔ. <verse eid="2CH 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 28:13" />Gɛ bɛ dɔ̀ bɛ alan, &lt;&lt;Ɩ kara ka bɛnɩ gɛtɛ i gye lɛ ɩ ba nfan, nka gɛlɛ fɔ, Yahwe wowurufa waà ba tii koro. Ii len yàà biri ka ade-kpen-fon ɩ bɛ̀ fɩya ma ɛyɩ gɛtɛ tɩ̀ wɛrɛ mɛ fɔ? Yema taade-kpen ɩ wɛrɛ sɔ, gɛ wowurufa-dɩrɛ wʋ wɛrɛ tɔ wʋ̀ gyaga Isareli wo koro.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2CH 28:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 28:14" />Okoro bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ fɔ be kere bɛnɩ gɛtɛ be gye fɔ, ma anyan gɛtɛ be kpila fɔ bɛ ya bɛndɩrɛbi ma dikpi fɔ powu bɔɔ bʋnʋn dʋkɔ. <verse eid="2CH 28:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 28:15" />Ɛwʋ gɛ bɛnɩ bɛnaa gɛtɛ be kpèlè baayere fɔ bɛ ba bʋnʋn, gɛ be tiri ayan gɛtɛ bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ fɔ be kpila be ye akpa fɔ yaanɩ fɔ be tin ɛbɛ gɛtɛ bɛ̀ san dibolon-kwaa fɔ. Bɛ tɛ bɛ ayan, ma anataga, ma anyandilɛ, ma butu, gɛ bɛ sa baakʋn gɩfa. Gɛ bɛ ka ɛbɛ gɛtɛ bɛ yɔlɔ baanɩ fɔ powu bɛ gyaga akpɔŋɔ-tɩtɩɩ yii koro, gɛ be birima ɛbɛ gɛtɛ be gye fɔ powu bɛ ma sɩ̀ Yeriko, aben yii ditele gɛtɛ dɩ̀ sa Yuda gɛtʋnkwaa gaanɩ fɔ daanɩ. Gɛ Isareli bete fɔ be biri bɛ da Samariya.<verse eid="2CH 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 28:16" />Ɔkʋna wʋtɔkɔ fɔ, egyu-dɩrɛ Ahasi ɛ fɔ Asyriya wogyu alɛ ɛ̀ɛ̀ kpà wɔ. <verse eid="2CH 28:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 28:17" />Yema Edom bete be biri bɛ ma kpà ma Yuda bete, gɛ be gye bɛ bɩtà bɛ da.<verse eid="2CH 28:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 28:18" />Fɔ Filisiti bete bɛ ma kpà ma atele gɛtɛ ɩ̀ sa odon wʋʋ bɩsɩrɩ ma Yuda Negebi gɩlan fɔ. Be gye Beti-Semesi, ma Ayalon, ma Gederoti, ma Soko watele, ma Timina, ma Gimiso fɩya ma yaatelebi gɛtɛ i silin yɩ i tuma fɔ. <verse eid="2CH 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 28:19" />Gɛ Yahwe ɛ warama Yuda gatɩn egyu-dɩrɛ Ahasi wo koro. Yema ɛ yɛ bɛnɩ bɛ mɛ duyu-kɛma daade Yuda, gɛ en di nʋnkwarɩ tɛ Yahwe.<verse eid="2CH 28:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 28:20" />Gɛtɛ Asiriya wogyu Tigilati-Pileseri e be gyu Ahasi wakʋn gɛtɛ ɛ̀ɛ̀ kpà wɔ fɔ, ɛ yɛ e len wɔ gɛ ade. <verse eid="2CH 28:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 28:21" />Okoro Ahasi ɛ ka sɩka-sɩya e ye Yahwe Dikwo-dɩrɛ daanɩ, ma digyu-kpaara fɔ daanɩ, ma wɔ bɛndɩrɛ baakpaara yaanɩ, gɛ ɛ ka yɩ ɛ tɛ Asiriya wogyu, mɔ ɛwʋ wʋʋn kpà wɔ.<verse eid="2CH 28:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 28:22" />Ma gɛtɛ ade ɩ ba egyu-dɩrɛ Ahasi wo koro gba fɔ, ɛwʋ gba gɛ en di nʋnkwarɩ tɛ Yahwe. <verse eid="2CH 28:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 28:23" />Ɛ tɛ Aram bete gɛtɛ be di boo koro akpa yaanɩ fɔ boo bekpen gedi, yema ɛɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Aram wogyu bekpen na kpà bɛ, nan tɛ bɛ gedi fɔ, bàà kpà nmɩ mɔ.&gt;&gt; Mɔ ɛwʋ gba na ka gyerebi-dɩrɛ na mɔma ɛwɔ ma Isareli gɩfɩɩ powu.<verse eid="2CH 28:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CH 28:24" />Ahasi ɛ kʋla anyɩmɩnyan kperen-kperen gɛtɛ ɩ̀ sa Wurubwarɛ Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ daanɩ, gɛ e sila-sila yɩ. Ɛ tan Yahwe Dikwo-dɩrɛ diitunu fɔ, gɛ e sere gedi gaatɛkʋn Yerusalem wo-isele powu yaanɩ <verse eid="2CH 28:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CH 28:25" />Gɛ e sere asʋmakʋn Yuda ditele-kamasɛ daanɩ fɔ bàà tì tɛ bekpen gekuma gedi, nyawʋ wʋ sa Yahwe, wotu ɛbɛ boo Wurubwarɛ fɔ owurufa.<verse eid="2CH 28:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CH 28:26" />Bɛ ŋwara ade-kurumakyɛɛ gɛtɛ Ahasi ɛ mɛ wo bugyu buu gedi gaanɩ powu, ye digyegeye ma sere ɔkʋna bɛ sa Yuda ma Isareli begyu-dɩrɛ boo koro gaade yɩɩ gɩkpa-dɩrɛ fɔ gaanɩ. <verse eid="2CH 28:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CH 28:27" />Ahasi e ku, gɛ be lò wɔ Yerusalem ditele, mɔ ben lò wɔ begyu bɔɔ bɩsan baanɩ. Gɛ wobi Hesekiya e di bugyu e sere wɔ gɩsɩrɩ.<verse eid="2CH 28:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 28" />
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="2CH 29" />
  <para style="s1">Yuda wogyu Hesekiya</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2KI 18:1-3">2 Begyu-dɩrɛ 18:1-3</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 29:1" />Hesekiya e sere bugyu buu gedi fɔ, ɛ̀ ba bɩkyan dikpilin ma ton, gɛ e di bugyu fɔ Yerusalem bɩkyan dikpilin ma yɛkɩ. Wɔna diyere n di Abiya, gɛtɛ è di Sekariya wobi-nanɩbi fɔ. <verse eid="2CH 29:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 29:2" />Ɛ mɛ ade gɛtɛ ɩ̀ tʋna Yahwe bʋnʋn anlɛ gɛtɛ wotu Dafidi ɛ bɔ ɛ mɛ fɔ.<verse eid="2CH 29:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 29:3" />Wo bugyu buu gedi gaanɩ gɩɩ gɩkyan gyangbasɛ, giibon-gyangbasɛlɛ wanɩ fɔ, ɛ tana Yahwe Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ diitunu fɔ, gɛ ɛ pɩna yɩ. <verse eid="2CH 29:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 29:4" />Gɛ e kpèlè gedi gɩɩ bɛtɛlɛ ma Lefi bete fɔ e tuma Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ dɩɩ dɩkpaara fɔ daanɩ ofila wʋʋ gɛtakʋn wʋʋ gɩlan, <verse eid="2CH 29:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 29:5" />gɛ ɛ dɔ̀ bɛ alan, &lt;&lt; Lefi bete, ɩnʋn maakʋn! Ɩ kpa koro dɩdɩɩ fɔ yàà mɛ Yahwe, yiitu ɛbɛ boo Wurubwarɛ Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ fɩrɩnfɩrɩn. Fɔ yàà tiri gɩnyan-kamasɛ gɛtɛ gɩɩ sa ɔkʋn fɩrɩnfɩrɩn-kʋn fɔ dɩdɩɩ fɔ. <verse eid="2CH 29:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 29:6" />Tiitu ɛbɛ ben di nʋnkwarɩ tɛ Yahwe tii Wurubwarɛ. Bɛ mɛ ade-kpen, gɛ be terema wɔ. Be kere wɔ bɛ ya, gɛ be fi gama be ten wɔ. <verse eid="2CH 29:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 29:7" />Bɛ nɩ tan Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ dɩɩ-ɩpʋnʋ, gɛ be wolo bɛkandɩya fɔ, gɛ bɛn mɩnɩ kuma olifwi tɛ Isareli wo Wurubwarɛ fɔ gedi Ɔkʋn-fɩrɩnfɩrɩnkʋn fɔ nya. <verse eid="2CH 29:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 29:8" />Gɛlɛ wuu koro Yahwe ɛ ka owurufa-dɩrɛ Yuda ma Yerusalem boo koro. Gɛ wʋ yɛ bɛnɩ be gyu gɩsaa-dɩrɛ, gɛ be biligi gɛmʋmwa-yoli gɩɩ bɛnɩ, anlɛ gɛtɛ ɛyɩ gbagba ii we lɛ. <verse eid="2CH 29:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 29:9" />Ɛwʋ na yɛ gɛ tiitu ɛbɛ be ku bɩtà baanɩ, gɛ tii bebi-teni, ma tii bebi-nanɩ, ma tɩɩsɔ ɛbɛ bɛ̀ sa gɩdɩ gaanɩ lɛ. <verse eid="2CH 29:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 29:10" />Mɔ nkele, n tɛ mɛ amɩnlɛ gɛtɛ nan tà dikola ma Yahwe, Isareli wo Wurubwarɛ fɔ, gɛtɛ eè kere wowurufa-dɩrɛ fɔ ɛ ya. <verse eid="2CH 29:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 29:11" />Miin bebi, ɩ kara nyà ade ɩ sɩ̀. Yema ɛyɩ gɛ Yahwe e tiri gɛtɛ yàà tì kuma olifwi ɩ tɛ wɔ, fɔ yàà gyegeye tɛ bɛnɩ fɔ bàà tɩ̀ sʋma wɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2CH 29:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 29:12" />Gɛ Lefi bete nyabɛ be sere bɔɔ gʋtʋn gɩɩ gɛmɛ.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="2CH 29:12" />
  <para style="li1" vid="2CH 29:12">Bɛnɩ gɛtɛ be ye Kohati dɩkpaara daanɩ fɔ n di</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="2CH 29:12">Amasayi wobi-teni Mahati, ma Asariya wobi-teni Yoweli.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2CH 29:12">Bɛnɩ gɛtɛ be ye Merari dɩkpaara daanɩ fɔ n di</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="2CH 29:12">Abdi wobi Kisi, ma Yehalele wobi Asariya.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2CH 29:12">Ɛbɛ gɛtɛ be ye Gerison bete baanɩ fɔ n di</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="2CH 29:12">Sima wobi Yowa, ma Yowa wobi Eden.<verse eid="2CH 29:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 29:13" />Bɛnɩ gɛtɛ be ye Elisafan dɩkpaara fɔ n di</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="2CH 29:13">Simiri ma Yeyeli.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2CH 29:13">Bɛnɩ gɛtɛ be ye Asafu dɩkpaara n di Sekariya ma Mataniya.<verse eid="2CH 29:13" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 29:14" />Bɛnɩ gɛtɛ be ye Heman dɩkpaara daanɩ fɔ n di</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="2CH 29:14">Yehiyeli ma Simeyi.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2CH 29:14">Bɛnɩ gɛtɛ be ye Yedutun dɩkpaara Semaya ma Usiyeli.<verse eid="2CH 29:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 29:15" />Gɛlɛ wʋʋ bɛnɩ nyabɛ bɛ kʋla bɔɔwɔlɔn ɛbɛ Lefi bete, gɛ bɛ kpa koro dɩdɩɩ. Gɛ be gyu Yahwe Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ daanɩ bɛ mɛ dɩ fɩrɩnfɩrɩn anlɛ gɛtɛ egyu-dɩrɛ ɛ dɔ̀ bɛ fɔ. Bɛ mɛ anlɛ gɛtɛ Yahwe wose wuu wùlà fɔ. <verse eid="2CH 29:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 29:16" />Gedi gɩɩ bɛtɛlɛ fɔ be gyu Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ daanɩ bɛ mɛ dɩ fɩrɩnfɩrɩn, gɛ bɛ ka gɩnyan-kamasɛ gɛtɛ be we gɛ gi gyu dɩdɩɩ fɔ be ye Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ diikòro. Gɛ Lefi bete fɔ be tola yɩ bɛ ma sa Kidiron Dɩtagba daanɩ. <verse eid="2CH 29:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 29:17" />Ebon-gyangbasɛlɛ duwi-gyangbasɛlɛ daanɩ fɔ, be sere ɔpɩ bɛɛ mɛ dɩdɩɩ dɩɩ gɛkpa dɩɩ gʋtʋn fɔ, gɛ duwi nɩyɛfɛ fɔ, be werema Yahwe Dikwo-dɩrɛ dɩɩkpata fɔ wʋʋ gɛmɛ fɩrɩnfɩrɩn. Gɛ bɛ ka awi nɩyɛ-do mɔ bɛ mɛ Yahwe Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ gbagba daanɩ fɩrɩnfɩrɩn, okoro be werema gʋtʋn fɔ ebon fɔ duwi fwo-kooronfɛ daanɩ.<verse eid="2CH 29:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 29:18" />Gɛ Lefi bete fɔ bɛ ma dɔ̀ egyu-dɩrɛ Hesekiya alan, &lt;&lt;Tɩ mɛ Yahwe Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ powu fɩrɩnfɩrɩn ti were. Tɩ mɛ gekuma gii gedi gɩɩ gɛtɛ̀kʋn ma ganyan powu, ma ɔkpʋlɔ gɛtɛ bɛɛ sɩ̀ boroboro wuu koro fɔ, ma wanyan powu fɩrɩnfɩrɩn. <verse eid="2CH 29:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 29:19" />Gɛ anyan powu gɛtɛ egyu-dɩrɛ Ahasi ee di bugyu gɛ en di nʋnkwarɩ, gɛ e tiri yɩ e ye Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ daanɩ fɔ, tɩ kpa yɩ dɩdɩɩ, gɛ ti birima yɩ tɩ sɩ̀ Yahwe gedi gɩɩ gɛtɛ̀kʋn fɔ gɩɩpɩ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2CH 29:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 29:20" />Gɛtɛ kere gɩ kpa gagyɩgyan fuu fɔ, egyu-dɩrɛ e kpèlè ditele fɔ dɩɩ bɛndɩrɛbi e tuma, gɛ bɛ san Yahwe Dikwo dɩrɛ fɔ daanɩ. <verse eid="2CH 29:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 29:21" />Bɛ ka bɛkwɔ kwarankɩ, ma ayɛran-gbʋgbʋ kwarankɩ, ma bɛyɛran atan kwarankɩ, ma begbebi-teni kwarankɩ bɛ ma tɛ ade-kpen yɩɩ gɛkakyɛ yii gedi tɛ Bugyu buu gedikʋn fɔ, Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ, ma Yuda. Egyu-dɩrɛ dɔ̀ gedi gɩɩ bɛtɛlɛ fɔ gɛtɛ bè di Aaron wodu waanɩ wʋʋ bɛnɩ fɔ alɛ bɛ tɛ gedi fɔ Yahwe gedi gɩɩ gɛtɛkʋn fɔ gii koro. <verse eid="2CH 29:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 29:22" />Okoro be wolo bɛkwɔ fɔ, gɛ gedi gɩɩ bɛtɛlɛ fɔ bɛ ka nkalan fɔ bɛ ŋwan gedi gɩɩ gɛtɛkʋn fɔ gii koro. Wʋʋ gama fɔ be wolo ayaran-gbʋgbʋ fɔ, gɛ bɛ ka yɩɩ nkalan bɛ ŋwan gedi gɩɩ gɛtɛkʋn fɔ gii koro. Gɛ be wolo ayara-tan fɔ, gɛ bɛ ka yɩɩ-nkalan bɛ ŋwan gedi gɩɩ gɛtɛkʋn fɔ gii koro. <verse eid="2CH 29:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 29:23" />Gɛ bɛ ka begbebi gɛtɛ baà ka bɛ tɛ ade-kpen yɩɩ gɛka-kyɛ yii gedi fɔ bɛ ba egyu-dɩrɛ ma bɛnɩ dikpi fɔ bɔɔ bʋnʋn, gɛ bɛ ka baalɔ bɛ gyaga boo koro. <verse eid="2CH 29:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CH 29:24" />Ɛwʋ gɛ gedi gɩɩ bɛtɛlɛ fɔ be wolo begbebi fɔ, gɛ bɛ ka bɔɔ nkalan be lù gedi gɩɩ gɛtɛkʋn fɔ gii koro bɛ ka bɛ fɔ Isareli powu wade-kpen yɩɩ gɛka-kyɛ.<verse eid="2CH 29:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CH 29:25" />Ɛ yɛ gedi gɩɩ bɛtɛlɛ bɛ ka akyaka, ma adʋlɛ ɛbɛ, ma adʋlɛ-dɩrɛ-dɩrɛ ɛbɛ, anlɛ gɛtɛ egyu-dɩrɛ Dafidi, ma Gadi gɛtɛ è di Wurubwarɛ wɔtabʋrʋlɛ tɛ egyu-dɩrɛ fɔ, ma Wurubwarɛ wɔtabʋrʋlɛ Natan bɛ dɔ̀ fɔ. Yahwe na da ma wɔ bɛtabʋrʋlɛ boo koro ɛ dɔ̀ ade nyayɩ. <verse eid="2CH 29:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CH 29:26" />Okoro Lefi bete fɔ bɛ pɩna koro gɛtɛ bè de Dafidi wɔ-ɩnʋn yɩɩ gɛnʋma yaanyan fɔ, gɛ gedi gɩɩ bɛtɛlɛ fɔ mɔ bè de baakantan.<verse eid="2CH 29:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CH 29:27" />Gɛ Hesekiya ɛ dɔ̀ bɛ alɛ bɛ tɛ tɛ gekuma gii gedi, gedi gɩɩ gɛtɛkʋn fɔ gii koro. Gɛtɛ be sere gedi fɔ gɩɩ gɛtɛ̀ fɔ, bɛ ka egyu-dɩrɛ Dafidi wɔ-ɩnʋn yɩɩ gɛnʋma gaanyan ma akantan, gɛ bɛ nʋma ɩnʋn bɛ tɛ Yahwe. <verse eid="2CH 29:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2CH 29:28" />Gɛtɛ ɩnʋn yɩɩ bɛnʋmalɛ fɔ bɛɛ nʋma ɩnʋn, gɛ akantan yii bɛfʋ̀nlɛ baakantan fɔ, bɛnɩ dikpi fɔ powu bɛ waran be kura bɛ sʋma Yahwe. Bɛ mɛ gɛlɛɛ ma ye gɛtɛ bɛ tɛ gekuma gii gedi gɩɩ gɛtɛ̀ fɔ gi were.<verse eid="2CH 29:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2CH 29:29" />Gɛtɛ bɛ tɛ gedi fɔ be were fɔ, egyu-dɩrɛ ma ɛnɩ-kamasɛ gɛtɛ ɛ̀ sa dʋkɔ fɔ, bɛ waran be kura baakpin yii koro, gɛ bɛ sʋma Yahwe. <verse eid="2CH 29:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2CH 29:30" />Ɛwʋ gɛ egyu-dɩrɛ Hesekiya ma wɔ bɛndɩrɛbi bɛ dɔ̀ Lefi bete fɔ alɛ bɛ ka egyu-dɩrɛ Dafidi ma Wurubwarɛ wɔtabʋrʋlɛ Asafu baanyun-gyebi bɛ nʋma ɩnʋn be sila Yahwe. Okoro bɛ nʋma gesila gɩɩ-ɩnʋn ɔsɛ waanɩ, gɛ bɛ warama baayun gatɩn bɛ sʋma Yahwe.<verse eid="2CH 29:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="2CH 29:31" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Hesekiya alan, &lt;&lt;Nkele i fere koro i were. Okoro ɩ yaanyan-tɛlɛ gedi, ma onyun wʋʋ gɛsa gaanyan ɩ ba Yahwe Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ daanɩ.&gt;&gt; Okoro bɛnɩ dikpi fɔ bɛ gedi gɩɩ gɛtɛ̀ gaanyan ma onyun wʋʋ gɛsa gaanyan bɛ ba, gɛ ɛbɛ powu gɛtɛ wʋ kya bɛ oturu fɔ mɔ bɛ bɛ tɛ gekuma gii gedi.<verse eid="2CH 29:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2CH 29:32" />Bɛnan gɛtɛ bɛnɩ dikpi fɔ bɛ ka bɛ bɛ tɛ gekuma gii gedi fɔ powu n di bɛkwɔ akpilin asiyee ma fwo (70), ma ayaran-gbʋgbʋ akpilin ton (100), ma ayaran-tan (200). Bɛ ka bɛnan nyabɛ powu bɛ bɛ tɛ gekuma gii gedi. <verse eid="2CH 29:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2CH 29:33" />Bɛnan gɛtɛ be tiri bɛ mɛ bɛ fɩrɩnfɩrɩn tɛ gedi gɩɩ gɛtɛ̀ fɔ powu bɔɔkʋna wʋ̀ ba bɛkwɔ-teni nkpɩn bisiyee (600), bɛyɛran ma begbebi gbaa ma nkpɩn ton (3,000). <verse eid="2CH 29:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="2CH 29:34" />Gɛtɛ gedi gɩɩ bɛtɛlɛ bɛn sɔ gɛtɛ bàà bɩya bɛnan fɔ be tiri baakpa okoro, bɔɔwɔlɔn ɛbɛ Lefi bete bɛ bɛ kpà bɛ kʋtʋmaa gʋtʋn fɔ gi were, ka sere ke gɛtɛ Lefi bete fɔ bɛ kpa koro dɩdɩɩ be were. Yema Lefi bete bɔɔ bʋnʋn baanɩ fɔ, koro gii gefere gì di bɛ ade-dɩrɛ da gedi gɩɩ bɛtɛlɛ. <verse eid="2CH 29:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2CH 29:35" />Bɛ tɛ gekuma gii gedi kpekpesi, fɩya ma ayo gɛtɛ be kuma bɛ tɛ olila wuu gedi, ma bʋkan buu gedi gɩɩ gɛtɛ̀.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CH 29:35">Okoro dɩsʋma di biri di sere ɔpɩ Yahwe Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ daanɩ. <verse eid="2CH 29:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="2CH 29:36" />Hesekiya ma bɛnɩ fɔ powu be di ɔsɛ, yema Wurubwarɛ ɛ kpa bɛ, gɛ bɛ mɛ ade nyayɩ ɔya-kpenkpesen waanɩ.<verse eid="2CH 29:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 29" />
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="2CH 30" />
  <para style="s1">Hesekiya ɛ pɩna koro ɛ tɛ Gɛkààrà-da gii duwi dii gedi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 30:1" />Hesekiya ɛ tɩyɛma Isareli bete ma Yuda bete powu ɔtʋn, gɛ ɛ ŋwara akpa e kpèlè Efrayim ma Manase bɛnɩ alɛ bɛ ba Yerusalem, Yahwe Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ daanɩ bàà di Gɛkààrà-da gii duwi fɔ bɛ tɛ Yahwe, Isareli bete boo Wurubwarɛ fɔ.<verse eid="2CH 30:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 30:2" />Egyu-dɩrɛ ma wɔ bɛndɩrɛbi ma bɛnɩ dikpi gɛtɛ bɛ sa Yerusalem fɔ powu bɛ dɔ̀ alɛ baà di Gɛkààrà-da gii duwi fɔ ebon-nyɔɔfɛ fɔ waanɩ. <verse eid="2CH 30:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 30:3" />Ben te di Gɛkààrà-da gii duwi ɔyɛ-kpara waanɩ nya yema gedi gɩɩ bɛtɛlɛ gɛtɛ bɛ kpa koro dɩdɩɩ fɔ bɛn sɔ, gɛ bɛnɩ ben te tuma Yerusalem asɔ waanɩ.<verse eid="2CH 30:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 30:4" />Okoro amɩnlɛ gɛtɛ bɛ ka fɔ ɩ sara ma egyu-dɩrɛ ma bɛnɩ dikpi fɔ powu. <verse eid="2CH 30:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 30:5" />Bɛ dɔ̀ gɛtɛ baà kpèlè bɛnɩ be ye Isareli anɩ powu, ye Beseba ma ye Dan. Baà kpèlè bɛnɩ bɛ ba Yerusalem bàà bè di Gɛkààrà-da gii duwi fɔ bɛ tɛ Yahwe, Isareli bete boo Wurubwarɛ fɔ. Ben te biri di duwi fɔ asɔ yaanɩ anlɛ gɛtɛ Ose fɔ wuu wùlà fɔ.<verse eid="2CH 30:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 30:6" />Egyu-dɩrɛ ma wɔ bɛndɩrɛbi bɛ ŋwara akpa, gɛ bɛ sa bɛnɩ bɛ ka yɩ san Isareli ma Yuda. Ade gɛtɛ bɛ ŋwara fɔ n di alan, &lt;&lt;Isareli bete, I biri ɩ ba Yahwe, Abraham ma Isaki ma Isareli wo Wurubwarɛ fɔ wakʋn, fɔ ɛwɔ mɔ èè biri ba ɛyɩ gɛtɛ i kuruma gɛtɛ i serenti i ye Asiriya wogyu gʋlɔ gaanɩ fɔ yaakʋn. <verse eid="2CH 30:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 30:7" />Ɩ kara mɛ anlɛ yiitu ɛbɛ, ma yɩɩdɩrɛ ɛbɛ gɛtɛ ben di nʋnkwarɩ tɛ Yahwe, boote ɛbɛ boo Wurubwarɛ fɔ, gɛ ɛ yɛ bɛ be biligi gɛmʋmwa-yoli gɩɩ bɛnɩ, anlɛ gɛtɛ ii we lɛ. <verse eid="2CH 30:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 30:8" />Ɩ kara mɛ oturu-kɛma anlɛ gɛtɛ yiitu ɛbɛ bɛ mɛ fɔ. Ɩ ka koro ɩ tɛ Yahwe. Ɩ ba ɔkʋn fɩrɩnfɩrɩn-kʋn gɛtɛ ɛ kpa dɩdɩɩ gakpaagakpa fɔ. Ɩ sʋma Yahwe, yii Wurubwarɛ fɔ, fɔ èè kere wowurufa-dɩrɛ fɔ ya. <verse eid="2CH 30:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 30:9" />Gengyi ì biri ɩ ba Yahwe wakʋn fɔ, bɛnɩ gɛtɛ be gye yɩɩ bɛnɩ gɩdɩ̀ fɔ baà we boo gutunkoro, fɔ baà kere bɛ bɛ ya bàà biri ba gɛtʋnkwaa nyagɩ gaanɩ, yema Yahwe, yii Wurubwarɛ fɔ è di gɛbwala giite ma gutunkoro giiwulalɛ. Gengyi ì biri ɩ ba wakʋn fɔ, ɛn nan tiri wɔ bʋnʋn e ye yii koro.<verse eid="2CH 30:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 30:10" />Gɛ bɛsalɛ fɔ bɛ san Efrayim ma Manase boo-ifoli yaatele-atele yaanɩ, ka ma ye Sebulun wofoli waanɩ, mɔ bɛnɩ fɔ bɛ mʋmwa bɛ, gɛ bɛ sa bɛ dɩkpàtà. <verse eid="2CH 30:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 30:11" />Mɔ Asa, ma Manase, ma Sebulun wo-ifoli yɩɩ bɛnɩ bɛkɩ bɛ nʋn baakʋn, gɛ bɛ san Yerusalem. <verse eid="2CH 30:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 30:12" />Gɛlɛ ke gɛ Yuda mɔ anɩ fɔ, Wurubwarɛ ɛ kya bɛnɩ fɔ boo-ituru, gɛ bɛ mɛ onyun-kɩlɩn gɛtɛ bàà di Yahwe wade gɛtɛ egyu-dɩrɛ ma wɔ bɛndɩrɛbi bɛ dɔ̀ fɔ yii koro.<verse eid="2CH 30:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 30:13" />Bɛnɩ dɩtɩnpan be tuma Yerusalem bàà di boroboro gɛtɛ bɛn sa gɩfa-ŋanlɛ fɔ wɔsɛ wuu gedi ebon-nyɔɔfɛ fɔ wanɩ. <verse eid="2CH 30:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 30:14" />Be tiri bekpen boo gedi gaatɛkʋn fɔ, ma olifwi wuu gedi gaatɛkʋn fɔ, gɛ bɛ ka yɩ bɛ ma fun bɛ sa Kidiron dɩtagba daanɩ.<verse eid="2CH 30:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 30:15" />Be wolo Gɛkààrà-da gɩɩyaran fɔ ebon-nyɔɔfɛ fɔ wo duwi fwo-naafɛ daanɩ. Gɛ gedi gɩɩ bɛtɛlɛ ma Lefi bete fɔ bɔɔ bʋnʋn bu ku, gɛ bɛ kpa koro dɩdɩɩ, gɛ bɛ tɛ gekuma gii gedi Yahwe Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ daanɩ. <verse eid="2CH 30:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 30:16" />Ɛwʋ gɛ be biri bɛ ma yela baayelakʋn, anlɛ gɛtɛ Wurubwarɛ wɔnɩ Mose Wose fɔ wuu wùlà fɔ. Gɛ Lefi bete fɔ bɛ ka nkalan gɛtɛ gedi gɩɩ bɛtɛlɛ fɔ bɛ ka bɛ tɛ fɔ bɛ ŋwan gedi gɩɩ gɛtɛkʋn fɔ gii koro. <verse eid="2CH 30:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 30:17" />Gɛtɛ dikpi bɛnɩ kpekpesi bɛn ta kpà koro dɩdɩɩ okoro, Lefi bete na wolo Gɛkààrà-da gɩɩ bɛyɛran fɔ bɛ tɛ ɛbɛ powu gɛtɛ boo koro gin fere, gɛ wun pe gɛtɛ bàà talɩ wolo ɛbɛ gbagba bɔɔ bɛyɛran bɛ tɛ Yahwe fɔ. <verse eid="2CH 30:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 30:18" />Ma gɛtɛ bɛnɩ kpekpesi gɛtɛ be ye Efrayim, ma Manase, ma Isaka, ma Sebulun boo-ifoli yɩɩ bɛnɩ bɛn kpa koro dɩdɩɩ fɔ, be di Gɛkààrà-da gaanyandilɛ fɔ, gɛtɛ wʋn san ma anlɛ gɛtɛ bɛ ŋwara bɛ sɩ̀ fɔ. Mɔ Hesekiya e tiri onyun ɛ tɛ bɛ alan, &lt;&lt;Wurubwarɛ gɛtɛ ɛ̀ kɔlɔ fɔ, ɛ ka ɛ kyɛ ɛnɩ-kamasɛ <verse eid="2CH 30:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 30:19" />gɛtɛ wɔ bʋnʋn bʋ̀ gyaga Yahwe, bootu ɛbɛ boo Wurubwarɛ fɔ wo koro, gengyi boo koro gin fere anlɛ gɛtɛ Dikwo-dɩrɛ dii-ise ii wùlà gba fɔ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2CH 30:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 30:20" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Yahwe ɛ nʋn Hesekiya wonyun-tiri, gɛ ɛ ka ɛ kyɛ bɛnɩ fɔ.<verse eid="2CH 30:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 30:21" />Gɛ Isareli bete gɛtɛ bɛ̀ sa Yerusalem fɔ bɛ ka ɔsɛ-dɩrɛ be di boroboro gɛtɛ bɛn sa gɩfa-ŋanlɛ fɔ, duwi n di duwi awi kwarankɩ. Fɔ Lefi bete ma gedi gɩɩ bɛtɛlɛ fɔ bè de Yahwe wɔ-ɩnʋn yɩɩ gɛnʋma gaanyan fɔ gɛ bɛɛ nʋma ɩnʋn be sila Yahwe.<verse eid="2CH 30:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 30:22" />Gɛ egyu-dɩrɛ Hesekiya e sila Lefi bete gɛtɛ be yera bɛ bɛ sʋma Yahwe fɔ. Awi kwarankɩ fɔ powu fɔ, be di gɛ anyandilɛ fɩrɩnfɩrɩn fɔ. Gɛ bɛ tɛ olila wuu gedi, gɛ be sila Yahwe, bootu ɛbɛ boo Wurubwarɛ fɔ.<verse eid="2CH 30:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 30:23" />Gɛ Bɛnɩ dikpi fɔ powu bɛ dɔ̀ be yera alɛ baà biri bɛ awi kwarankɩ be di ɔsɛ-dɩrɛ fɔ. Okoro be biri bɛ ka awi kwarankɩ be di ɔsɛ fɔ. <verse eid="2CH 30:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CH 30:24" />Yuda wogyu-dɩrɛ Hesekiya ɛ tɛ bɛkwɔ-teni nkpɩn ton (1,000), ma bɛyɛran ma begbebi ɩgbaa isiyee ma nkpɩn ton (7,000). Gɛ wɔ bɛndɩrɛbi fɔ mɔ bɛ tɛ bɛkwɔ-teni nkpɩn ton (1,000) ma bɛyɛran ma begbebi ɩgbaa ton (10,000). Gɛ gedi gɩɩ bɛtɛlɛ kpekpesi bɛ kpa koro dɩdɩɩ <verse eid="2CH 30:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CH 30:25" />Ɛwʋ gɛ wʋ mɛ Yuda bɛnɩ dikpi fɔ powu, ma gedi gɩɩ bɛtɛlɛ, ma Lefi bete powu gɛtɛ be ye Isareli fɔ, ma besela gɛtɛ bè si Yuda fɔ ɔsɛ. <verse eid="2CH 30:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CH 30:26" />Gɛ ɔsɛ-dɩrɛ wʋ ba Yerusalem, yema ye Isareli wogyu Dafidi wobi Solomon wawi yaanɩ bè ye ma ǹdò fɔ, ade ɩkɩ anlɛ in te biri sere Yerusalem ɩ nya. <verse eid="2CH 30:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CH 30:27" />Ɛwʋ gɛ gedi gɩɩ bɛtɛlɛ fɔ ma Lefi bete fɔ bɛ tɔ be yela be hira bɛnɩ fɔ, gɛ Wurubwarɛ ɛ nʋn boonyun-tiri e ye gatala.<verse eid="2CH 30:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 30" />
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="2CH 31" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 31:1" />Gɛtɛ ade nyayɩ powu i were fɔ, Isareli bete gɛtɛ bɛ̀ sa dʋkɔbɛ fɔ bɛ san Yuda watele fɔ yaanɩ, gɛ bɛ ma gbena akpen-taa fɔ, gɛ be kebi Asera woyon fɔ. Be gbena asʋmakʋn fɔ, ma gedi gaatɛkʋn gɛtɛ ɩ̀ sa Yuda, ma Benyamin, ma Efrayim, ma Manase boo-ifoli yaanɩ fɔ. Gɛtɛ be muru yɩ powu be were fɔ, Isareli bete fɔ powu be biri bɛ da baasarakʋn, baatele yaanɩ.<verse eid="2CH 31:1" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Dɩsʋma daanyan yɩɩ gɛtɛ̀</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 31:2" />Hesekiya e yo gedi gɩɩ bɛtɛlɛ fɔ ma Lefi bete fɔ ɛ sa bɔɔ bʋtʋn baakpi yaanɩ, fɔ bàà tɩ tɛ gekuma gii gedi ma olila wuu gedi, fɔ bàà mɛ dɩsʋma dɩɩ gʋtʋn, fɔ bàà tɩ yela wɔ gɛsarakʋn fɔ giitunu ka onyun wʋʋ gɛsa ma gesila gɩɩ-ɩnʋn bɛ tɛ Yahwe. <verse eid="2CH 31:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 31:3" />Egyu-dɩrɛ e tiri ɛwɔ gbagba wanyan ɛ tɛ gagyɩgyan ma ɔgyɔlɔ yii gekuma gii gedi, ma Duwi-Tunalɛ dii gekuma gii gedi, ma Ebon-Fon wɔsɛ wuu gedi, ma ɩsɛ gɛtɛ bɛ ŋwara yaade Yahwe Wose yaanɩ fɔ yii gedi. <verse eid="2CH 31:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 31:4" />Gɛ ɛ dɔ̀ bɛnɩ gɛtɛ bè si Yerusalem fɔ gɛtɛ bàà tì tiri gedi gɩɩ bɛtɛlɛ ma Lefi bete booyo gedikʋn bɛ tɩ̀ tɛ bɛ fɔ bàà talɩ ka koro bɛ mɛ gʋtʋn gɛtɛ Yahwe Wose fɔ wʋ dɔ̀ bɛ alɛ bɛ mɛ fɔ. <verse eid="2CH 31:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 31:5" />Gɛtɛ ɛ bɔ ɛ dɔ̀ bɛnɩ fɔ ade nyayɩ e were fɔ, Isareli bete bɛ tɛ yaanyan-gyangbasɛlɛ gɛtɛ be sila be ye bii-ili yaanɩ fɔ be ye booturu waanɩ. Bɛ ka afɩnaa, ma wayɩn-fon, ma olife bʋnɔ, ma ɛŋɔɔ, ma oli wanyan-kamasɛ bɛ ba. Bɛ tiri gɩnyan-kamasɛ gii dikpen-fwofɛ bɛ ba asɔ yaanɩ. <verse eid="2CH 31:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 31:6" />Isareli bete ma Yuda bete gɛtɛ bè si Yuda watele yaanɩ fɔ mɔ be tiri bɔɔ bɛkwɔ ma bɔɔ bɛyɛran baanɩ dikpen-fwofɛ, ma anyan gɛtɛ bɛ mɛ fɩrɩnfɩrɩn yii dikpen-fwofɛ bɛ tɛ Yahwe, boo Wurubwarɛ fɔ, gɛ bɛ kʋla yɩ kpekpesi. <verse eid="2CH 31:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 31:7" />Be sere ade nyayɩ yɩɩ gɛmɛ ye ebon-siyeefɛ fɔ waanɩ, gɛ be werema yɩ ebon kwarankɩfɛ waanɩ. <verse eid="2CH 31:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 31:8" />Gɛtɛ egyu Hesekiya ma wɔ bɛndɩrɛbi fɔ be be we anyan gɛtɛ bɛ kʋla fɔ, be sila Yahwe boo Wurubwarɛ fɔ, gɛ be hira wɔ bɛnɩ Isareli bete.<verse eid="2CH 31:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 31:9" />Gɛ egyu Hesekiya e lila gedi gɩɩ bɛtɛlɛ ma Lefi bete fɔ ɔkʋn gɛtɛ anyan kpekpesi fɔ i ye.<verse eid="2CH 31:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 31:10" />Gɛ gedi gɩɩtɛlɛ Asariya gɛtɛ è di gedi gɩɩ tɛlɛ bɔndɩrɛ ye Sadoki dɩkpaara daanɩ fɔ e tiri wuunyun alan, &lt;&lt;Bo ye gɛtɛ bɛnɩ be sere ɔpɩ bɛɛ ka anyandilɛ bɛ ba Yahwe Dikwo-dɩrɛ daanɩ fɔ, ti wura akɩ ti di ti kuruma kpekpesi, yema Yahwe e hira wɔ bɛnɩ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2CH 31:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 31:11" />Gɛ egyu Hesekiya ɛ dɔ̀ bɛ alɛ bɛ pɩna akwo gɛtɛ bɛɛ sɩ̀ anyandilɛ yaanɩ Yahwe Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ daanɩ fɔ. Gɛ bɛ mɛ anlɛ gɛtɛ ɛ dɔ̀ fɔ. <verse eid="2CH 31:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 31:12" />Gɛ bɛ ka anyan-tɛlɛ, ma anyan dikpen-fwofɛ, ma anyan gɛtɛ bɛ mɛ fɩrɩnfɩrɩn bɛ tɛ Yahwe fɔ powu bɛ bɛ sɩ̀ akwo fɔ yaanɩ. Gɛ bɛ yɛ Lefi-te Konaniya ɛ nya anyan fɔ yii koro, fɔ wonobi Simeyi ndi wɔkpàlɛ.<verse eid="2CH 31:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 31:13" />Gɛ egyu Hesekiya ma gedi gɩɩtɛlɛ Asariya be tiri Yehiyeli, ma Asasiya, ma Nahati, ma Asaheli, ma Yerimoti, ma Yosabadi, ma Eliyeli, ma Isimakiya, ma Mahati, ma Benayiya alɛ bɛ mɛ gʋtʋn Yahwe Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ daanɩ, Konaniya ma wonobi bɔɔ gatɩn.<verse eid="2CH 31:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 31:14" />Lefi-te Imina wobi-teni Kore gɛtɛ ɛɛ nya ofila wʋʋ gɛtàkʋn giitunu fɔ, ntɛ nya gedi gɩɩ gɛtɛ̀ gɛtɛ gi ye oturu waanɩ fɔ yii koro. Ɛwɔ nte yo anyan gɛtɛ bɛɛ tɛ Yahwe Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ daanɩ fɔ, gɛ ɛɛ mɛ yɩ fɩrɩnfɩrɩn.<verse eid="2CH 31:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 31:15" />Eden, ma Miniyamin, ma Yesuwa, ma Semayiya, ma Amariya, ma Sekaniya ntɛ kpà wɔ ma anyan yii geyo atele gɛtɛ gedi gɩɩ bɛtɛlɛ bɛ̀ sa yaanɩ fɔ. Be yo anyan fɔ bɛ tɛ bɛndɩrɛ ma bebi powu kyɛkyɛ anlɛ gɛtɛ akpen fɔ ɩ̀ dɔ.<verse eid="2CH 31:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 31:16" />Nkele mɔ, be yo bɛ tɛ beteni gɛtɛ be di bɩkyan bisiyee ka bʋn gɛtɛ bɛ ŋwara baayere bɛ sa gewo-tama gɩɩ gɩkpa gaanɩ fɔ. Ɛbɛ powu gɛtɛ baà gyu Yahwe Dikwo-dɩrɛ daanɩ duwi ndi duwi bɛ mɛ bɔɔ gʋtʋn anlɛ gɛtɛ bɛ tɛ bɛ gʋtʋn alɛ bɛ mɛ baakpen yaanɩ fɔ. <verse eid="2CH 31:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 31:17" />Gɛ be yo bɛ tɛ gedi gɩɩ bɛtɛlɛ gɛtɛ bɛ ŋwara baayere dɩkpaara-dɩkpaara bɛ sa gewo-tama gɩɩ gɩkpa gaanɩ fɔ, gɛlɛ ke gɛ bɛ tɛ Lefi bete gɛtɛ be di bɩkyan dikpilin ka bʋn fɔ anlɛ gɛtɛ bɔɔ gʋtʋn ma baakpen ɩ̀ dɔ fɔ. <verse eid="2CH 31:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 31:18" />Gɛ bɛ ka bebi, ma bɛna-kpasɔ, ma bebi-teni, ma bebi-nanɩ gɛtɛ bɛ̀ sa gɩfɩɩ fɔ gaanɩ powu gɛ bɛ ŋwara baayere bɛ sa gewo-tama gɩɩ gɩkpa gaanɩ fɔ bɛ fɩya. Yema be di nʋnkwarɩ gɛtɛ bɛ kpa koro dɩdɩɩ.<verse eid="2CH 31:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 31:19" />Gɛ gedi gɩɩ bɛtɛlɛ gɛtɛ bè di Aaron wodu wʋʋ bɛnɩ fɔ bɩrɛ, ɛbɛ gɛtɛ bè si gɛtʋnkwaa-kpara gɛtɛ gi silin baatele fɔ, abɛɛ atele kurumakyɛɛ yaanɩ fɔ, be tiri bɛnɩ bɛ sɩ̀ gɛtɛ bàà tɩ̀ tɛ eteni-kamasɛ gɛtɛ ɛ̀ sa baanɩ fɔ anyandilɛ, ma ɛbɛ gɛtɛ bɛ ŋwara baayere bɛ sa Lefi bete boo gewo-tama gɩɩ gɩkpa gaanɩ fɔ.<verse eid="2CH 31:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 31:20" />Anlɛ gɛ Hesekiya ɛ mɛ Yuda powu anɩ. Ɛ mɛ ade gɛtɛ ɩ̀ kɔlɔ, gɛ ɩ̀ tʋna, gɛ e di nʋnkwarɩ ɛ tɛ Yahwe, wɔ Wurubarɛ fɔ. <verse eid="2CH 31:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 31:21" />Gɛ ade powu gɛtɛ ɛ mɛ Wurubwarɛ Dikwo-dɩrɛ daanɩ fɔ, e di Wurubwarɛ wose ma wade wùlàlɛ fɔ yii koro. E len Wurubwarɛ, gɛ ɛ ka woturu powu ɛ mɛ gʋtʋn. Gɛlɛ wuu koro ade i pe ɩ tɛ wɔ.<verse eid="2CH 31:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 31" />
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="2CH 32" />
  <para style="s1">Asiriya wogyu Senakeribi ɛ sʋ Yuda ɛ sa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 32:1" />Ade gɛtɛ Hesekiya ɛ mɛ powu lɛ wʋʋ gama fɔ, Asiriya wogyu-dɩrɛ Senakeribi ɛ ma sʋ Yuda ɛ sa. Ɛ sʋ watele ma ɔkɛma fɔ ɛ sa, ma dɩmɩnlɛ gɛtɛ ee gye bɛ bɩtà. <verse eid="2CH 32:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 32:2" />Gɛtɛ Hesekiya e we alɛ Senakeribi ɛ ba, gɛ è len ɛ̀ɛ̀ kpà ma Yerusalem fɔ, <verse eid="2CH 32:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 32:3" />ɛwɔ ma wɔ bɛndɩrɛbi ma wɔ bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ bɔɔ bɛndɩrɛbi bɛ dɔ̀ gɛtɛ baà sʋ butu gɛtɛ bʋʋ da ditele fɔ daanɩ bu ye okòro fɔ, gɛ be to wade fɔ bɛ sa. <verse eid="2CH 32:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 32:4" />Bɛ kʋla gʋtʋn gɩɩ bɛmɛlɛ kpekpesi, gɛ bɛ sʋ atiribun ma atu gɛtɛ yɩɩ da gɛtʋnkwaa fɔ gaanɩ fɔ, gɛ bɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Anʋn yii koro gɛ Asiriya wogyu eè be wura butu kpekpesi?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2CH 32:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 32:5" />Gɛ ɛ pɩna e sere ɔpɔrɩ fɔ wʋʋ-ɩkʋn gɛtɛ i gbena-gbena fɔ powu, ɛ mara ayela-dɩyɛlɛkʋn ɛ gyaga wuu koro. Gɛ e biri ɛ mara ɔpɔrɩ ɛ sa wʋ̀ gyangbasɛlɛ fɔ wàà sa wʋ ɔkɛma ɔkʋn gɛtɛ bee kpèlè Dafidi ditele fɔ daanɩ. Gɛ ɛ nɩ mɛ akpanyan ma wawɔrɔnyan panpasan-dɩyɛlɛ koro kpekpesi.<verse eid="2CH 32:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 32:6" />Gɛ e tiri bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ bɔɔ bɛndɩrɛ gɛtɛ bàà nya bɛnɩ fɔ boo koro. Gɛ ɛ kʋla be powu ditele fɔ dɩkpaara gɛtɛ dɩ̀ sa otunu fɔ, gɛ ɛ tabʋrʋ ɛ sa bɛ ɔkɛma alan, <verse eid="2CH 32:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 32:7" />&lt;&lt;I yela kin-kin, fɔ yàà sa koro ɔkɛma. I kara yɛ gɩsaa gàà ton yɩ abɛɛ koro gàà yɔ yi Asiriya wogyu ma wɔ bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ kpekpesi gɛtɛ bɛ fɩya ma ɛwɔ fɔ boo koro, yema kɛma-dɩrɛ wʋ sa ma ɛtɩ da ɛbɛ. <verse eid="2CH 32:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 32:8" />Ɛwɔ ɛ̀ ba gɛ bɛnɩ-nyalɛ bɔɔkɛma, mɔ ɛtɩ bɩrɛ Yahwe, tii Wurubwarɛ nan kpà tɩ, fɔ ɛ̀ɛ̀ kpà taakpa ɛ tɩ.&gt;&gt; Gɛ egyu-dɩrɛ wade gɛtɛ ɛ dɔ̀ fɔ ɩ sa bɛnɩ fɔ ɔkɛma.<verse eid="2CH 32:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 32:9" />Gamama fɔ, gɛtɛ Asiriya wogyu Senakeribi ma wɔ bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ bɛ̀ sangba bɛ̀ sa Lakisi fɔ, ɛ sa wɔ bɛndɩrɛbi bɛ san Yerusalem, Yuda wogyu Hesekiya ma wɔ bɛnɩ powu baakʋn alan,<verse eid="2CH 32:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 32:10" />&lt;&lt;Asiriya wogyu Senakeribi alan, Anʋn yii koro gɛ aa bʋnʋn bʋ̀ gyaga gɛ i to Yerusalem ì si lɛ?<verse eid="2CH 32:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 32:11" />Gɛ Hesekiya ɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt; Yahwe, tii Wurubwarɛ eè to tɩ e ye Asiriya wogyu walɔ yaanɩ,&gt; ɛɛ gban wɔ fɔ àà be ku dɩkpan ma otinbili. <verse eid="2CH 32:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 32:12" />Nka Hesekiya gbagba na gbena Yahwe dɩsʋmakʋn ma gedi gɩɩ gɛtɛ̀kʋn, gɛ ɛ dɔ̀ ɛyɩ Yuda ma Yerusalem bɛnɩ alɛ gedi gɩɩ gɛtɛ̀kʋn kɩlɩn gɛ wù di gɛtɛ yàà sʋma fɔ yàà kuma olifwi gii koro fɔ.<verse eid="2CH 32:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 32:13" />&lt;&lt;An nyɩ̀ gɩnyan gɛtɛ Ɛtɩ ma miinte tɩ̀ mɛ bɛnɩ powu ntʋnkwaa kurumakyɛɛ yaanɩ? Bɩfɩɩ bʋtɔkɔ buu bekpen bɛ talɩ be to bɔɔ ntʋnkwaa be ye maalɔ yaanɩ?<verse eid="2CH 32:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 32:14" />Bekpen powu gɛtɛ miinte e gbena bɩfɩɩ baanɩ fɔ, baanɩ mɔmɔ na talɩ na to wɔ bɛnɩ na ye mɩɩn gʋlɔ gaanɩ? Gɛ lan waanɩ gɛ yii Wurubwarɛ fɔ ɛɛ̀ talɩ e to yi e ye mɩɩn gʋlɔ gaanɩ? <verse eid="2CH 32:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 32:15" />Nkele Ɩ kara yɛ Hesekiya ɛ̀ɛ̀ gban yɩ fɔ yàà lulu osele gɛlɛ. Ɩ kara to wɔ i di, yema ekpen ɛkɩ ɛn ma, abɛɛ gɩfɩɩ gɩkɩ gɩ̀ ma, abɛɛ bugyu bʋkɩ bʋ̀ ma gɛtɛ bʋ talɩ bu to bʋʋ bɛnɩ bu ye mɩɩn gʋlɔ gaanɩ, abɛɛ miintu ɛbɛ bɔɔ gʋlɔ gaanɩ bɛ nya. Gɛ lan waanɩ gɛ yii Wurubwarɛ ɛɛ̀ talɩ e to yi e ye mɩɩn gʋlɔ?<verse eid="2CH 32:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 32:16" />Senakeribi bɛndɩrɛbi fɔ bɛ ade-kpen kadama Yahwe Wurubwarɛ, ma wɔsaranyan Hesekiya. <verse eid="2CH 32:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 32:17" />Egyu Senakeribi mɔ ɛ ŋwara akpa e toro Yahwe, Isareli bete boo Wurubwarɛ fɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Anlɛ gɛtɛ ntʋnkwaa kurumakyɛɛ fɔ yɩɩ bɛnɩ boo bekpen ban talɩ to bɔɔ bɛnɩ ye mɩɩn gʋlɔ gaanɩ fɔ, gɛlɛ ke gɛ Hesekiya wo Wurubwarɛ fɔ mɔ ɛn nan talɩ e to wɔ bɛnɩ e ye mɩɩn gʋlɔ gaanɩ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2CH 32:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 32:18" />Gɛ bɛ gbɛrɛ afala Hebre ginde gaanɩ, bàà ka sa Yerusalem bɛnɩ gɛtɛ bɛ̀ gyaga ditele fɔ dɩɩpɔrɩ wuu koro fɔ gɩsaa, fɔ koro gàà yɔ bɛ, fɔ bàà gye ditele fɔ bɩtà. <verse eid="2CH 32:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 32:19" />Bɛ tabʋrʋ Yerusalem wo Wurubwarɛ fɔ wo koro gaade anlɛ gɛtɛ bɛɛ tabʋrʋ gɛtʋnkwaa gɩɩ bɛnɩ boo bekpen gɛtɛ bɛnɩ bɛ ka baalɔ bɛ mɛ fɔ baade.<verse eid="2CH 32:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 32:20" />Gɛ egyu-dɩrɛ Hesekiya ma Amosi wobi Wurubwarɛ wɔtabʋrʋlɛ Isaya, be tiri onyun be wùlà be kpèlè Wurubwarɛ ade fɔ yii koro. <verse eid="2CH 32:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 32:21" />Gɛ Yahwe ɛ sa wɔsalɛ ɛkɩ e be wolo bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ ma boo begyegeyelɛ, ma bɔɔ bɛndɩrɛbi gɛtɛ bɛ sa Asiriya wogyu gɛsarakʋn fɔ powu. Okoro e biri ɛ da wɔlɛ ma ɩnɩnfa. Gɛ gɛtɛ ɛ̀ sa wokpen dikwo daanɩ fɔ, wo bebi bɛkɩ be be wolo wɔ.<verse eid="2CH 32:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 32:22" />Okoro Yahwe e to Hesekiya ma Yerusalem bete e ye Asiriya wogyu Senakeribi ma bekurumakyɛɛ powu baalɔ yaanɩ. Gɛ ɛ yɛ boo koro gɩ nʋ̀n bɛ ade powu yaanɩ. <verse eid="2CH 32:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 32:23" />Gɛ bɛnɩ kpekpesi bɛ ba Yerusalem bɛ bɛ tɛ Yahwe gedi, gɛ bɛ ka anyan-kyɛlɛ gbagba bɛ bɛ kyɛ Yuda wogyu Hesekiya. Ye dʋkɔbɛ fɔ, bɩfɩɩ powu bʋ tɛ wɔ gebù-dɩrɛ<verse eid="2CH 32:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Hesekiya gɛbʋma koro ma wo gepe ma wo diku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CH 32:24" />Awi ɩtɔkɔ waanɩ fɔ Hesekiya e gyu geyeba diku-diku. Gɛ e tiri onyun ɛ fɔ Wurubwarɛ, gɛ e yera wɔ, gɛ e wùlà wɔ ade-dɩrɛ ma gɩsaa ɩkɩ. <verse eid="2CH 32:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CH 32:25" />Mɔ Hesekiya e bʋma koro gatala, gɛ ɛn mɩnɩ kʋna ade-kpara gɛtɛ Yahwe ɛ mɛ ɛ tɛ wɔ fɔ. Gɛlɛ wuu koro Yahwe wowurufa wʋ ba ɛwɔ ma Yuda ma Yerusalem boo koro. <verse eid="2CH 32:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CH 32:26" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Hesekiya ma Yerusalem bete bɛ warama koro gatɩn. Okoro Yahwe en tiira bɛ giten ma sere gɛtɛ Hesekiya e ku.<verse eid="2CH 32:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CH 32:27" />Hesekiya e wura koro gaanyan kpekpesi ma gebù, gɛ e sere akwo gɛtɛ ɛɛ sɩ̀ wɔ sɩka-fututu, ma wɔ sɩka-sɩya, ma wataa-kpara, ma wanyan ma ofen, ma awɔrɔnyan-dɩyɛlɛ-koro, ma anyan gbagba-kamasɛ. <verse eid="2CH 32:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2CH 32:28" />Gɛ e biri e sere akwo gɛtɛ bɛɛ sɩ̀ afɩnaa, ma wayɩn-fon, ma bʋnɔ, gɛ ɛ mɛ bɛkwɔ ma bɛyɛran baakwo. <verse eid="2CH 32:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2CH 32:29" />Gɛ ɛ yɛ be sere atele bɛ tɛ wɔ, gɛ e wura bɛyɛran ma bɛkwɔ kpekpesi, yema Wurubwarɛ e hira wɔ gepepe.<verse eid="2CH 32:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2CH 32:30" />Hesekiya na sʋ Gihon butu gɛtɛ buu ye gatala wʋ̀ gɩɩ gɩlan, gɛ e fi bu ɛ san gatɩn Dafidi-ditele diifila wʋʋ gɛnʋ̀nkʋn wʋʋ gɩlan. Gɛ gɩnyan-kamasɛ gɛtɛ ɛ mɛ fɔ wu pe wʋ tɛ wɔ. <verse eid="2CH 32:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2CH 32:31" />Mɔ gɛtɛ Babilon gɩfɩɩ gɩɩ bɛnyalɛ bɛ sa bɛnɩ bɛ ma lila wɔ ade-dɩrɛ ma gɩsaa gɛtɛ i sere gɛtʋnkwaa fɔ gii koro fɔ, Wurubwarɛ e kere wɔ ɛ ya fɔ ɛ̀ɛ̀ kɛrɛ wɔ nya, fɔ èè we woturu ade powu gɛtɛ ɩ̀ sa oturu waanɩ.<verse eid="2CH 32:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2CH 32:32" />Bɛ ŋwara Hesekiya wade-kurumakyɛɛ gɛtɛ ɛ mɛ wo bugyu buu gedi gaanɩ, ma koro gɩɩ gɛka-tɛ, bɛ sa Amosi wobi Wurubwarɛ wɔtabʋrʋlɛ Isaya wade gɛtɛ e we anlɛ okute waanɩ yɩɩ gɩkpa ma Yuda ma Isareli begyu-dɩrɛ boo koro gaade yaakpa yaanɩ.<verse eid="2CH 32:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="2CH 32:33" />Hesekiya e ku gɛ be lò wɔ odon wuu koro ɔkʋn gɛtɛ Dafidi wodu wʋʋ bɛnɩ bɔɔ bɩsàn bʋ̀ sa fɔ. Gɛ Yuda ma Yerusalem bete powu bɛ sa wɔ gebù wo diku daanɩ. Gɛ wobi Manase e di bugyu e sere wɔ gɩsɩrɩ.<verse eid="2CH 32:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 32" />
  <chapter number="33" style="c" sid="2CH 33" />
  <para style="s1">Yuda wogyu Manase</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2KI 21:1-9">2 Begyu-dɩrɛ 21:1-9</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 33:1" />Ɔkʋna gɛtɛ Manase e di bugyu fɔ, ɛ̀ ba bɩkyan fwo bʋnyɔɔ. Gɛ e di bugyu bɩkyan akpilin anyɔɔ ma fwo-ton (55) Yerusalem. <verse eid="2CH 33:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 33:2" />Ɛ mɛ ade-kpen Yahwe bʋnʋn. Ɛ tɛrɛma ade kyʋnlɛ gɛtɛ bɛnɩ gɛtɛ Yahwe e berema e ye Isareli bete bɔɔ bʋnʋn fɔ bɛɛ mɛ fɔ. <verse eid="2CH 33:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 33:3" />E biri e sere asʋmakʋn gɛtɛ wote Hesekiya e gbena fɔ, gɛ e biri e sere Baali gedi gaatɛ̀kʋn ma Asera wo-iyon. E kura gatala gaanyan powu, gɛ ɛ sʋma yɩ. <verse eid="2CH 33:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 33:4" />E sere bekpen boo gedi gaatɛ̀kʋn Yahwe Dikwo-dɩrɛ gɛtɛ Yahwe ɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Yerusalem nan mɛ mɩɩn gɛsʋmakʋn gakpaakpa&gt;&gt; fɔ daanɩ. <verse eid="2CH 33:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 33:5" />E sere gedi gaatɛ̀kʋn ɛ tɛ gatala gaanyan yɩɩ gɛsʋma Yahwe Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ daakpaara anyɔɔ fɔ powu yaanɩ. <verse eid="2CH 33:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 33:6" />E kuma wo bebi-teni ɛ tɛ gedi Beni-Hinom dɩtagba daanɩ. Ɛ mɛ gɛsɔma gaade, ma gɩbwɔ ma asɔlɔ-de, gɛ e kpèlè bekpena afiye-kpen. Ɛ mɛ ade-kpen ɛ kara Yahwe bʋnʋn, gɛ wʋ yɛ Yahwe owurufa wʋ tɔ.<verse eid="2CH 33:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 33:7" />Ɛ ka bekpen gɛtɛ ɛ mɛ fɔ ɛ sɩ̀ Wurubwarɛ Dikwo-dɩrɛ gɛtɛ Wurubwarɛ ɛ dɔ̀ Dafidi ma wobi Solomon alan, &lt;&lt;Dikwo-dɩrɛ nyadɩ ma Yerusalem gɛtɛ na tiri na ye Isareli wo-ifoli powu yaanɩ lɛ nan mɛ ɔkʋn gɛtɛ baà tɩ sʋma mɩ gakpaakpa. <verse eid="2CH 33:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 33:8" />Mɩn nan nɩ yɛ Isareli bete bɔɔ gɩsɩrɩ gàà ye gɛtʋnkwaa gɛtɛ na ka na tɛ bootu ɛbɛ lɛ gaanɩ gengyi bè di ade powu gɛtɛ na yɛ mɩɩnsaranyan Mose ɛ dɔ̀ bɛ fɔ yii koro fɔ. Ade fɔ n di ise fɔ, ma ade-wùlàlɛ fɔ, ma ade-tɩyɛlɛ-sɩ̀lɛ fɔ daanɩ&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2CH 33:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 33:9" />Mɔ Manase ɛ yɛ Yuda ma Yerusalem bɛnɩ bɛ mɛ ade-kpen ɩ kààrà bɩfɩɩ gɛtɛ Yahwe e muru Isareli bete bɔɔ bʋnʋn fɔ booyo fɔ.<verse eid="2CH 33:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 33:10" />Ma gɛtɛ Yahwe e terema ade ɛ tɛ Manase ma wɔ bɛnɩ gba fɔ, bɛn ka wɔ bɩta. <verse eid="2CH 33:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 33:11" />Okoro Yahwe ɛ yɛ Asiriya wogyu-dɩrɛ bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ bɔɔ bɛndɩrɛ bɛ bɛ sʋ bɛ bɛ sa, gɛ be gye Manase gɩdɩ, gɛ bɛ sa wɔ gɩwɔrɔnyan dininfere, gɛ bɛ ka gɩwɔrɔnyan-sɩya gaagbarɩgbarɩ bɛ ban wɔ, gɛ bɛ ka wɔ bɛ da Babilon. <verse eid="2CH 33:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 33:12" />Gɛtɛ Manase ɛ̀ sa dɩyɩyɛ daanɩ fɔ, e wula ɛ fɔ Yahwe, wɔ Wurubwarɛ fɔ, gɛ ɛ warama koro gepepe wotu ɛbɛ boo Wurubwarɛ fɔ bʋnʋn. <verse eid="2CH 33:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 33:13" />Gɛtɛ e wula e kpèlè Yahwe fɔ, Yahwe e to wonyun-tiri, gɛ e birima wɔ ɛ ba Yerusalem, wo bugyu fɔ baanɩ. Ade nyayɩ ɩ yɛ Manase e we ɛ nyɩnla alɛ Yahwe n di Wurubwarɛ.<verse eid="2CH 33:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 33:14" />Nyawʋ wʋʋ gama fɔ, e pɩna e sere Ɔkʋn gɛtɛ bee kpèlè Dafidi Ditele fɔ diikòro wʋʋpɔrɩ, butu buu geduru-yekʋn gɛtɛ wʋ̀ sa Gihon fɔ wuufila wʋʋ gɛnʋ̀nkʋn wʋʋ gɩlan dɩtagba daanɩ, ka silin Ofeli wodon, ka ma ye Otunu gɛtɛ bee kpèlè Ɛsʋ̀n Wotunu fɔ. E sere ɔpɔrɩ fɔ gɛtɛ wʋ tɔ gepepe. Gɛ e tiri bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ bɔɔ bɛndɩrɛ ɛ sɩ̀ Yuda watele ma ɔkɛma fɔ powu yaanɩ.<verse eid="2CH 33:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 33:15" />E tiri bendeni boo bekpen fɔ, ma oyon-salɩlɛ fɔ e ye Yahwe Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ daanɩ, ka fɩya ma gedi gaatɛkʋn gɛtɛ e sere Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ diidon wuu koro, ma Yerusalem fɔ, gɛ ɛ ka yɩ e fun e lulu ditele fɔ diikòro. <verse eid="2CH 33:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 33:16" />Gɛ ɛ pɩna e sere Yahwe gedi gɩɩ gɛtɛkʋn fɔ, gɛ ɛ tɛ olila wuu gedi, ma onyun wʋʋ gɛsa gii gedi, gedi gɩɩ gɛtɛkʋn fɔ gii koro. Ɛwʋ gɛ ɛ dɔ̀ Yuda bɛnɩ alɛ wù di gɛtɛ bàà sʋma gɛ Yahwe, Isareli wo Wurubwarɛ fɔ woko. <verse eid="2CH 33:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 33:17" />Bɛnɩ fɔ bɛ̀ bɔ bɛɛ tɛ gedi asʋmakʋn fɔ yaanɩ, mɔ Yahwe boo Wurubwarɛ fɔ gɛ bɛɛ tɛ.<verse eid="2CH 33:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 33:18" />Bɛ ŋwara Manase bugyu buu gedi gaade, fɩya ma wonyun gɛtɛ e tiri ɛ tɛ Yahwe, Isareli wo Wurubwarɛ fɔ, bɛ sa Isareli begyu-dɩrɛ boo koro gaade yɩɩ gɩkpa gaanɩ. <verse eid="2CH 33:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 33:19" />Bɛ ŋwara Manase wonyun-tiri fɔ waade, ma anlɛ gɛtɛ Wurubwarɛ ɛ nʋn wonyun-tiri fɔ, fɩya ma wade-kpen gɛtɛ ɛ mɛ ma wɔ gɛmandi nʋnkwarɩ, ma ɩkʋn gɛtɛ e sere asʋmakʋn, gɛ e sere Asera wo-iyon ma bekpen, pɛgɛ ɛ bɛ warama koro fɔ powu bɛ sa Hosayi wo koro gaade yɩɩ gɩkpa gaanɩ. <verse eid="2CH 33:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 33:20" />Manase e ku, gɛ be lò wɔ wo digyu-kpaara daanɩ. Gɛ wobi Amon e di bugyu e sere wɔ gɩsɩrɩ.<verse eid="2CH 33:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yuda wogyu Amon</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2KI 21:19-26">2 Begyu-dɩrɛ 21:19-26</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 33:21" />Ɔkʋna gɛtɛ bɛ sɩ̀ Amon bugyu fɔ ɛ̀ ba bɩkyan dikpilin ma bʋnyɔɔ, gɛ e di bugyu Yerusalem bɩkyan-bʋnyɔɔ. <verse eid="2CH 33:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 33:22" />Ɛ mɛ ade-kpen Yahwe bʋnʋn anlɛ gɛtɛ wote Manase ɛ bɔ ɛ mɛ fɔ. Amon ɛ sʋma bekpen gɛtɛ wote ɛ mɛ fɔ, gɛ ɛ tɛ bɛ gedi. <verse eid="2CH 33:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 33:23" />Mɔ ɛwɔ ɛn warama koro gatɩn alɛ wote, mɔ fɔ ɛ mɛ gɛ ade-kpen ɛ fɩya.<verse eid="2CH 33:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CH 33:24" />Amon bɛndɩrɛbi bɛ mɛ onyun wo koro, gɛ be wolo wɔ wo digyu-kpaara daanɩ. <verse eid="2CH 33:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CH 33:25" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Yuda bɛnɩ be wolo bɛnɩ powu gɛtɛ be wolo egyu-dɩrɛ Amon fɔ, gɛ bɛ ka wobi Yosiya bɛ sɩ̀ bugyu be sere wɔ gɩsɩrɩ.<verse eid="2CH 33:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 33" />
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="2CH 34" />
  <para style="s1">Yuda wogyu-dɩrɛ Yosiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 34:1" />Ɔkʋna gɛtɛ Yosiya e di bugyu fɔ ɛ̀ ba bɩkyan nɩyɛ, gɛ e di bugyu Yerusalem bɩkyan dikpilin ma fwo-dɩkɩ. <verse eid="2CH 34:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 34:2" />Ɛ mɛ ade gɛtɛ ɩ̀ tʋna Yahwe bʋnʋn gɛ ɛ san wotu Dafidi wo-isele powu yaanɩ. En fi san dɩbɩyan abɛɛ ologyi. <verse eid="2CH 34:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 34:3" />Wo bugyu buu gedi bʋʋ gɩkyan-nɩyɛfɛ gaanɩ, ma gɛtɛ è di ebi gba fɔ, e sere ɔpɩ ɛɛ sʋma wotu Dafidi wo Wurubwarɛ fɔ. Wɔ gɩkyan fwo-nyɔɔfɛ gaanɩ fɔ, e sere ɔpɩ ee muru asʋmakʋn, ma Asera wo-iyon, ma bekpen gɛtɛ bɛ salɩ, ma bekpen gɛtɛ bɛ mara powu gɛtɛ bɛ sa Yuda ma Yerusalem fɔ. <verse eid="2CH 34:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 34:4" />Ɛ yɛ be gbena Baali wo gedi gaatɛkʋn fɔ, gɛ be gbena olifwi wuu gedi gaatɛkʋn gɛtɛ ɩ̀ gbɛma yɩ fɔ, gɛ be tunla Asera wo-iyon fɔ ma bekpen fɔ bɛ fɩna. E gbena anyan nyayɩ dugudugu, gɛ ɛ yasɩ yɩ e lù bɛnɩ gɛtɛ bɛ sʋma bekpen fɔ bɔɔ bɩsan buu koro. <verse eid="2CH 34:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 34:5" />E kuma bekpen fɔ boo gedi gɩɩ bɛtɛlɛ baanankʋba gedi gaatɛkʋn fɔ yii koro ɛ ka ɛ kpa Yuda ma Yerusalem dɩdɩɩ. <verse eid="2CH 34:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 34:6" />Gɛ ɛ mɛ gɛlɛ ke Manase, ma Efrayim, ma Simeyon boo-ifoli yaatele yaanɩ, ka ma ye Nafitali. <verse eid="2CH 34:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 34:7" />E tùnla-tùnla gedi gaatɛkʋn fɔ, ma Asera wo-iyon fɔ ɛ fɩna, gɛ ɛ kpààrà boo bekpen fɔ ɛ mɛ ɔnʋmʋ, gɛ e gbena-gbena boo-ilifwi yii gedi gɩɩ gɛtɛkʋn fɔ buruburu Isareli anɩ powu, gɛ e biri ɛ da Yerusalem.<verse eid="2CH 34:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 34:8" />Yosiya bugyu buu gedi bʋʋ gɩkyan fwo-nɩyɛfɛ gaanɩ fɔ, gɛtɛ e tiri dɩdɩɩ daanyɩmɩnyan fɔ e ye gɛtʋnkwaa fɔ gaanɩ, ma Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ daanɩ fɔ, ɛ sa Asaliya wobi Safan, ma gɩfɩɩ gɩɩnyalɛ Maaseya, ma gɩkpa gɩɩŋwaralɛ Yowahasi wobi-teni Yowa alɛ bɛ ma pɩna Yahwe, wo Wurubwarɛ Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ.<verse eid="2CH 34:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 34:9" />Ɛwʋ gɛ bɛ san Gedi gɩɩtɛlɛ ɛndɩrɛ Hilikiya wakʋn, gɛ bɛ ka sɩka gɛtɛ otunu wʋʋ bɛdɩyɛlɛ gɛtɛ ɛbɛ n di Lefi bete fɔ be to be ye Manase wɔfan-do fɔ, ma Efrayim bete, ma Isareli bɛnɩ-kurumakyɛɛ, ma Yuda bete powu, ma Benyamin bɛnɩ, ma Yerusalem bete baakʋn fɔ bɛ tɛ wɔ. <verse eid="2CH 34:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 34:10" />Ɛwʋ gɛ bɛ ka sɩka fɔ bɛ sa gʋtʋn gɩɩ bɛnyalɛ gɛtɛ bɛɛ nya Yahwe Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ dii koro fɔ bɔɔ gʋlɔ. Gɛ bɛ ka sɩka fɔ be le gʋtʋn gɩɩ bɛmɛlɛ fɔ. <verse eid="2CH 34:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 34:11" />Gɛlɛ ke gɛ bɛ tɛ bɛkapɩnta, ma ɩpɔrɩ yii beserelɛ sɩka bàà ka se ataa, ma iyon bàà ka pɩna ɩpɔrɩ gɛtɛ Yuda begyu-dɩrɛ ben ton gepe, gɛ i gbena fɔ.<verse eid="2CH 34:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 34:12" />Gʋtʋn gɩɩ bɛmɛlɛ fɔ bɛ ka nʋnkwarɩ bɛ mɛ gʋtʋn. Lefi bete Yahati ma Obediya gɛtɛ be ye Merari dɩkpaara daanɩ fɔ, ma Sekariya ma Mesulam gɛtɛ be ye Kohati dɩkpaara daanɩ fɔ na nya boo koro. Lefi bete-do gɛtɛ bɛ̀ nyɩ̀ ɩnʋn yɩɩ gɛnʋma yaanyan yaanɩ gepepe fɔ, <verse eid="2CH 34:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 34:13" />bɛɛ nya gʋtʋn gɩɩ bɛmɛlɛ gɛtɛ bɛ̀ sa bʋtʋn-kperen-kperen baanɩ fɔ boo koro. Lefi bete bɛkɩ mɔ bɛ mɛ akpa yɩɩ bɛŋwaralɛ, ma akpa yɩɩ bɛŋwaralɛ-sɩ̀lɛ, ma otunu wʋʋ bɛdɩyɛlɛ.<verse eid="2CH 34:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Be we Ose wʋʋ Gɩkpa fɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 34:14" />Duwi dɩkɩ, gɛtɛ bee tiri sɩka gɛtɛ bɛnɩ bɛ ka bɛ ba Yahwe Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ daanɩ fɔ, gedi gɩɩtɛlɛ Hilikiya e we Gɩkpa gɛtɛ Yahwe Wose gɛtɛ ɛ da ma Mose wo koro ɛ tɛ fɔ ɩ̀ sa gaanɩ fɔ. <verse eid="2CH 34:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 34:15" />Gɛ Hilikiya ɛ dɔ̀ gɩkpa gɩɩŋwaralɛ Safan alan, &lt;&lt;Na we Ose wʋʋ Gɩkpa fɔ Yahwe Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ daanɩ.&gt;&gt; Gɛ ɛ ka gɩ ɛ tɛ Safan.<verse eid="2CH 34:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 34:16" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Safan ɛ ka gɩkpa fɔ ɛ san ma egyu-dɩrɛ, gɛ ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Ɛtɩ aa bɛsaranyan tɩɩ mɛ gʋtʋn-kamasɛ gɛtɛ a ka a sa tɩɩ gʋlɔ fɔ. <verse eid="2CH 34:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 34:17" />Tɩ ka sɩka gɛtɛ wʋ̀ sa Yahwe Dikwo-dɩrɛ daanɩ fɔ gɛ tɩ ka wɔ tɩ sa gʋtʋn gɩɩ bɛmɛlɛ ma ɛbɛ gɛtɛ bɛɛ nya gʋtʋn fɔ gii koro fɔ bɔɔ gʋlɔ. <verse eid="2CH 34:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 34:18" />Gɛ gɩkpa gɩɩŋwaralɛ Safan ɛ dɔ̀ egyu-dɩrɛ alan, &lt;&lt;Gedi gɩɩtɛlɛ Hilikiya ɛ ka gɩkpa gɩkɩ ɛ tɛ mɩ.&gt;&gt; Gɛ Safan ɛ kalan gɩ egyu-dɩrɛ bʋnʋn.<verse eid="2CH 34:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 34:19" />Gɛtɛ egyu-dɩrɛ ɛ nʋn Ose fɔ waade-dɔ̀lɛ fɔ, ɛ fɛɛran wɔ ngba. <verse eid="2CH 34:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 34:20" />Ɛwʋ gɛ ɛ dɔ̀ Hilikiya, ma Safan wobi Ahikam, ma Mika wobi Abidon, gɩkpa gɩɩŋwaralɛ Safan, ma egyu-dɩrɛ wɔma-tenlɛ Asaya alan, <verse eid="2CH 34:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 34:21" />&lt;&lt;Ɩ san i ma lila Yahwe ɩ tɛ nmɩ ma Yuda bɛnɩ powu ka da ma ade gɛtɛ bɛ ŋwara bɛ sa gɩkpa nyagɩ gɛtɛ be we fɔ gaanɩ lɛ. Yahwe ɛ ka wowurufa-dɩrɛ tii koro, yema tiitu ɛbɛ ben di gɩkpa fɔ gaade yii koro. Bɛn mɛ ade gɛtɛ bɛ ŋwara bɛ sa gɩkpa fɔ gaanɩ fɔ.<verse eid="2CH 34:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 34:22" />Wʋʋ gama fɔ, Hilikiya ma bɛnɩ gɛtɛ egyu-dɩrɛ ɛ sa ɛ fɩya ma ɛwɔ fɔ bɛ san bɛ ma kasɩ ade fɔ bɛ tɛ Wurubwarɛ wɔtabʋrʋlɛ-nanɩ Hulida gɛtɛ wɔsan n di Tikifa wobi Salum gɛ wotu n di Hasira gɛtɛ ɛɛ nya ngba gɛtɛ bʋ̀ sa Dikwo-dɩrɛ daanɩ fɔ buu koro fɔ wakʋn. Ɛ sara gɛ Yerusalem Wɔlanlan-Nyɔɔfɛ fɔ waanɩ.<verse eid="2CH 34:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 34:23" />Gɛ ɛ dɔ̀ bɛ alan, &lt;&lt;Yahwe, Isareli wo Wurubwarɛ fɔ alan, ɩ dɔ̀ ɛnɩ gɛtɛ ɛ sa yɩ maakʋn fɔ alan, <verse eid="2CH 34:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CH 34:24" />&lt;Yahwe alɛ ɛɛ̀ yɛ gyerebi ɛ̀ɛ̀ nʋ̀n Yerusalem ma wɔ bɛnɩ boo koro anlɛ gɛtɛ bɛ ŋwara bɛ sa gɩkpa gɛtɛ bɛ kalan bɛ tɛ Yuda wogyu-dɩrɛ lɛ gaanɩ fɔ. <verse eid="2CH 34:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CH 34:25" />Gɛtɛ be kere mɩ gɛsʋma bɛ yɛ gɛ be kuma olifwi bɛ tɛ gɛ bekpen, gɛ bɛ mɛ bekpen bɛ sa mɩ owurufa okoro, miinwurufa waà tɔ Yerusalem wo koro gɛ wʋn nan nʋ̀n wʋ nya.&gt; <verse eid="2CH 34:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CH 34:26" />Ɩ ma dɔ̀ Yuda wogyu gɛtɛ ɛ sa yɩ alɛ ɩ ma lila Yahwe ɩ nʋn fɔ alan, &lt;Yahwe, Isareli wo Wurubwarɛ ɛɛ dɔ̀ ka da ma ade gɛtɛ ɩ nʋn lɛ alɛ, <verse eid="2CH 34:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CH 34:27" />gɛtɛ i foma yaamɩnlɛ, gɛ ɩ warama koro gatɩn ɩ tɛ nmɩ Yahwe, ɔkʋna gɛtɛ ɩ nʋn gefura gɛtɛ na fura gɩfɩɩ fɔ ma gɩɩ bɛnɩ ma gɛfwala gaade gɛtɛ na dɔ̀ ka da ma gɛtʋnkwaa fɔ ma gɩɩ bɛnɩ alɛ baà bɛ̀ mɛ bɛnɩ fwalalɛ, gɛ ɩ fɛɛran yɩɩ ngba gɛ i wula mɩɩn bʋnʋn okoro, nmɩ Yahwe na nʋn yiinyun-tiri. <verse eid="2CH 34:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2CH 34:28" />Gɛlɛ wuu koro, nan yɛ yɩ yàà ku bàà lò yɩ olila waanɩ pɛ gyerebi gɛtɛ nan yɛ ɛ̀ɛ̀ ba Yerusalem wo koro fɔ ɛ̀ɛ̀ ba.&gt; &gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CH 34:28">Ɛwʋ gɛ be birima wanyun-gyebi fɔ bɛ ma dɔ̀ egyu-dɩrɛ.<verse eid="2CH 34:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2CH 34:29" />Ɛwʋ gɛ egyu Yosiya e kpèlè bɛndɩrɛ fɔ powu gɛtɛ bɛ̀ sa Yuda ma Yerusalem fɔ e tuma. <verse eid="2CH 34:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2CH 34:30" />Gɛ ɛwɔ ma Yuda bɛnɩ ma Yerusalem bɛnɩ, ma gedi gɩɩ bɛtɛlɛ, ma Wurubwarɛ bɛtabʋrʋlɛ fɔ, ma bɛnɩ-kurumakyɛɛ, (beyenpu oo, bɛkyɩnyɩn oo) ɛbɛ powu bɛ bʋn bɛ san Yahwe Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ daanɩ. Gɛ ɛ kalan Dikola dɩɩ gɩkpa gɛtɛ be we Yahwe Dikwo-dɩrɛ daanɩ fɔ ɛ tɛ bɛnɩ fɔ powu. <verse eid="2CH 34:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2CH 34:31" />Ɛwʋ gɛ egyu fɔ ɛ tɔ e yela wo pila wʋʋpɩ, gɛ ɛ pɩna ɛ tà Dikola ma Yahwe alɛ ɛɛ̀ ka woturu powu ma wɔkala ɛ tɛrɛma wɔ, gɛ eè di wo-ise ma wade-wùlàlɛ, ma wade-tɩyɛlɛ-sɩ̀lɛ fɔ yii koro anlɛ gɛtɛ bɛ ŋwara wanyun-gyebi bɛ sa gɩkpa fɔ gaanɩ fɔ.<verse eid="2CH 34:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2CH 34:32" />Ɛwʋ gɛ ɛ yɛ Yerusalem ma Benyamin bete powu bɛ kan ntam gɛtɛ baà di bootu ɛbɛ boo Wurubwarɛ fɔ dikola fɔ dii koro.<verse eid="2CH 34:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="2CH 34:33" />Gɛ egyu-dɩrɛ Yosiya e tiri bekpen baanyɩmɩnyan fɔ e ye Isareli gɛtʋnkwaa gɩɩkʋn-kamasɛ, gɛ ɛ yɛ ɛbɛ powu gɛtɛ bɛ̀ sa Isareli fɔ bɛ sʋma Yahwe, boo Wurubwarɛ fɔ. Wɔ nkpa wawi yaanɩ fɔ, ben mini kere Yahwe, bootu ɛbɛ boo Wurubwarɛ fɔ gɛsʋma ya.<verse eid="2CH 34:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 34" />
  <chapter number="35" style="c" sid="2CH 35" />
  <para style="s1">Yosiya e di Gɛkààrada</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 35:1" />Yosiya e di Gɛkààrada Yerusalem anɩ ɛ ka sa Yahwe gebù, gɛ be wolo Gɛkààrada gɩɩyɛran fɔ ebon-gyangbasɛ wo duwi fwo-naafɛ daanɩ. <verse eid="2CH 35:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 35:2" />E yo gʋtʋn ɛ tɛ gedi gɩɩ bɛtɛlɛ, gɛ ɛ sa bɛ aniya bàà tɩ mɛ gʋtʋn Yahwe Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ daanɩ. <verse eid="2CH 35:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 35:3" />Ɛ dɔ̀ Lefi bete gɛtɛ bè di Isareli wade yii bewùlàlɛ gɛtɛ bɛ kpa koro dɩdɩɩ fɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Ɩ ka Dɩdaka fɔ ɩ sɩ̀ Dikwo-dɩrɛ gɛtɛ Isareli wogyu Dafidi wobi Solomon e sere fɔ daanɩ. Wun di gɛtɛ yàà ni tola dɩ yaagongyi yii koro, mɔ ɩ sʋma Yahwe yii Wurubwarɛ fɔ, ma wɔ bɛnɩ Isareli bete. <verse eid="2CH 35:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 35:4" />I yela yaayelakʋn ofoli-ofoli Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ daanɩ anlɛ gɛtɛ Egyu-dɩrɛ Dafidi ma wobi Solomon bɛ ŋwara bɛ sɩ fɔ.<verse eid="2CH 35:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 35:5" />I yela anlɛ gɛtɛ ɛyɩ bɛkɩ yaà talɩ ɩ kpà Isareli dɩkpaara-kamasɛ dɩɩ bɛnɩ fɔ. <verse eid="2CH 35:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 35:6" />I wolo Gɛkààrada gɩɩ bɛyɛran fɔ, fɔ yàà kpa koro dɩdɩɩ, fɔ yàà pɩna yɩɩwɔlɔn ɛbɛ booyo bɛyɛran fɔ, fɔ yàà mɛ anlɛ gɛtɛ Yahwe ɛ dama Mose wo koro ɛ dɔ̀ fɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2CH 35:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 35:7" />Ɛwʋ gɛ egyu-dɩrɛ Yosiya ɛ tɛ bɛnɩ fɔ powu bɛyɛran ma begbebi gɛtɛ baasɔ ɩ̀ ba disepekyi dɩkɩ ma ɩgbaa ton tɛ Gɛkààrada gii gedi fɔ. Gɛ ɛ nɩ tɛ bɛkwɔ gbaa ɛkɩ ma nkpɩn ton e ye ɛwɔ gbagba wanyan yaanɩ.<verse eid="2CH 35:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 35:8" />Gɛ wɔ bɛndɩrɛbi mɔ bɛ tɛ be ye ɛbɛ gbagba bo-ituru yaanɩ bɛ tɛ bɛnɩ fɔ, ma gedi gɩɩ bɛtɛlɛ, ma Lefi bete. Gɛ Hilikiya, ma Sakariya, ma Yetiyeli, gɛtɛ bɛɛ mɛ gʋtʋn Wurubwarɛ Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ daanɩ fɔ, bɛ tɛ gedi gɩɩ bɛtɛlɛ fɔ Gɛkààrada gaanyan gɛtɛ ɩ̀ ba disepekyi dɩkɩ ma ɩgba isiyee, ma bɛkwɔ gɛkpɩn ma akpilin ton. <verse eid="2CH 35:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 35:9" />Lefi bete bɔɔ bɛndɩrɛ Konaniya, ma Semayiya, ma wɔndɩrɛ ɛbɛ Nethaniyeli, ma Hasabiya, ma Yeyiyeli, ma Yosabadi bɛ tɛ bɛyɛran ɩgbaa ɩnyɔɔ ma nkpɩn ton, ma begbebi atan, ma ayɛran-gbʋgbʋ nkpɩn bʋnyɔɔ ma akpilin ton bɛ tɛ Lefi bete gɛtɛ bàà ka tɛ gedi fɔ.<verse eid="2CH 35:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 35:10" />Gɛtɛ bɛ pɩna gɩnynan-kamasɛ be were bɛ tɛ Gɛkààrada fɔ, gedi gɩɩ bɛtɛlɛ ma Lefi bete be yela baayelakʋn kperen-kperen anlɛ gɛtɛ egyu-dɩrɛ ɛ dɔ̀ bɛ fɔ. <verse eid="2CH 35:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 35:11" />Be wolo Gɛkààrada gɩɩ bɛyɛran fɔ, gɛ gedi gɩɩ bɛtɛlɛ bɛ ka bɛnan fɔ bɔɔkalan bɛ ŋwan gedi gɩɩ gɛtɛ̀kʋn fɔ gii koro, fɔ Lefi bete bɛɛ bɩya bɛnan fɔ. <verse eid="2CH 35:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 35:12" />Bɛ sɩ̀ gekuma gii gedi gɩɩ fɔ kperen gɛtɛ bɛnɩ fɔ baakpi kperen-kperen bàà tɛ Yahwe gedi anlɛ gɛtɛ bɛ ŋwara bɛ sa Mose gɩkpa gaanɩ fɔ. Gɛlɛ ke gɛ bɛ mɛ bɛkwɔ fɔ mɔ. <verse eid="2CH 35:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 35:13" />Be kuma Gɛkààrada gɩɩ bɛnan fɔ anlɛ gɛtɛ be wùlà fɔ, gɛ bɛ gyaga gedi gɩɩ gɛtɛ̀ fɩrɩnfɩrɩn fɔ bɛdanseyi, ma bɛsɩrɩbayɩ, ma bɛtasa yaanɩ gɛ be yo yɩ ɔtan-ɔtan bɛ tɛ bɛnɩ fɔ powu. <verse eid="2CH 35:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 35:14" />Nyawʋ wʋʋ gama fɔ, bɛ nya ɛbɛ gbagba mɔ boo koro, ma gedi gɩɩ bɛtɛlɛ fɔ, yema gedi gɩɩ bɛtɛlɛ gɛtɛ bè di Aaron wodu waanɩ wʋʋ bɛnɩ fɔ, bɛɛ tɛ gekuma gaanyan ma ayo yaanyan gɛlɛɛ ofila wàà gyu. Gɛlɛ wuu koro Lefi bete fɔ bɛ nya boo koro ma gedi gɩɩ bɛtɛlɛ gɛtɛ bè di Aaron wodu waanɩ wuu bebi fɔ.<verse eid="2CH 35:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 35:15" />Ɩnʋn yɩɩ bɛnʋmalɛ gɛtɛ bè di Asafi wodu waanɩ wʋʋ bɛnɩ fɔ, bè yela baayelakʋn anlɛ gɛtɛ Dafidi, ma Asafi, ma Heman, ma Wurubwarɛ wɔtabʋrʋlɛ Yadutun be wùlà bɛ fɔ. Gɛ wun di gɛtɛ itunun yɩɩ bɛnyalɛ fɔ bàà kpe ye baayelakʋn, yema bɔɔwɔlɔn ɛbɛ Lefi bete fɔ bɛ pɩna koro gɛtɛ bàà nya boo koro.<verse eid="2CH 35:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 35:16" />Gɛlɛ wuu okoro, anlɛ gɛtɛ egyu Yosiya ɛ bɔ ɛ dɔ̀ fɔ, bɛ mɛ wʋ duwi dɩtɔkɔ tɛ Yahwe gɛsʋma. Anlɛ gɛtɛ baà tì di Gɛkààrada gii duwi fɔ, ma gekuma gii gedi gɩɩ gɛtɛ̀, gedi gɩɩ gɛtɛ̀kʋn fɔ gii koro. <verse eid="2CH 35:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 35:17" />Gɛ Isareli bete gɛtɛ bɛ̀ sa dʋkɔ fɔ, be di Gɛkààrada gɩɩsɛ fɔ ma Boroboro gɛtɛ bɛn sa gɩfa-ŋanlɛ awi kwarankɩ. <verse eid="2CH 35:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 35:18" />Ye Wurubwarɛ wɔtabʋrʋlɛ Samuweli wɔya waanɩ be sere ma ǹdò lɛ, ben di Gɛkààrada gɩɩsɛ wʋkɩ anlɛ nyawʋ. Begyu powu gɛtɛ bɛ sara bɛ bɛ da fɔ, baanɩ ɛkɩ en di Gɛkààrada gii duwi anlɛ egyu Yosiya, ma gedi gɩɩ bɛtɛlɛ, ma Lefi bete, ma Yuda bete, ma Isareli, ma Yerusalem booyo nyawʋ. <verse eid="2CH 35:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 35:19" />Yosiya wo bugyu buu gedi wʋʋ gɩkyan fwo-nɩyɛfɛ gaanɩ gɛ be di Gɛkààrada gii duwi fɔ.<verse eid="2CH 35:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yosiya diku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 35:20" />Nyayɩ powu yɩɩ gama gɛtɛ Yosiya ɛ pɩna Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ, Egyipiti wogyu Neko ɛ san bɩtà karikemisi Efurati anɩ. Gɛ Yosiya ɛ san ɛ ma tà bɩtà ma ɛwɔ. <verse eid="2CH 35:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 35:21" />Mɔ Neko ɛ sa bɛsalɛ wakʋn ɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Oo! Egyu Yosiya, ololo mɔmɔ n sa ɛtɩ ma awɔ taanɩ? Mɩn ba na ba kpà ma awɔ, nan ba na kpà gɛ ma bɩɩn bɛkyʋnlɛ, gɛ Wurubwarɛ ɛ dɔ̀ mɩ alɛ n kya koro. Okoro ten gɛtɔ-yela Wurubwarɛ gɛtɛ ɛ̀ sa ma nmɩ fɔ wo koro, nka gɛlɛ fɔ, eè muru wɔ̀.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2CH 35:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 35:22" />Mɔ Yosiya è len gɛtɛ ɛ̀ɛ̀ kpa ma ɛwɔ. Okoro e terema ɛn nʋn ade gɛtɛ Wurubwarɛ ɛ dama Neko wo koro ɛ dɔ̀ fɔ. E foma wo koro gɛ ɛ san ɛ̀ ma ta wɔ bɩtà Megido wɔtalan waanɩ.<verse eid="2CH 35:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 35:23" />Akpa yannɩ fɔ, gɩsɩnta gi sere egyu Yosiya gɛ ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ bɩtà bʋʋndɩrɛbi fɔ alan, &lt;&lt; ka mɩ ye, na pira gɛtɛ wʋn ma gɛnya.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2CH 35:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CH 35:24" />Okoro be tiri wɔ be ye wo tiira-mɩ-san anɩ gɛ bɛ ka wɔ bɛ sa tiira-mɩ-san-fon gɛtɛ ɛ̀ sa dʋkɔ fɔ anɩ gɛ bɛ ka wɔ bɛ san Yerusalem, dʋkɔ gɛ e ku. Be lò wɔ wotu ɛbɛ bɔɔ gɩ̀sàn gaanɩ, gɛ Yuda ma Yerusalem powu be wula wɔ. <verse eid="2CH 35:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CH 35:25" />Wurubwarɛ wɔtabʋrʋlɛ Yeremiya tiri ɔnʋn ɛ ka e wula Yosiya, gɛ wʋ be biligi ɔkɔnʋn wʋ tɛ ɩnʋn yɩɩ bɛnʋmalɛ gɛtɛ beteni ma bɛnanɩ powu bɛɛ tɩ nʋma wʋ gengyi bee wula wɔ fɔ. Bɛ ŋwara wʋ bɛ sa dɩkpʋkpʋ dɩɩnʋn yaanɩ. <verse eid="2CH 35:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CH 35:26" />Ade-kurumakyɛɛ gɛtɛ Yosiya ɛ mɛ wo bugyu buu gedi baanɩ, ma wɔ gɛka koro tɛ anlɛ gɛtɛ bɛ ŋwara bɛ sa Yahwe wo-ise yaanɩ, <verse eid="2CH 35:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CH 35:27" />ma wade-mɛlɛ powu ye digyegeye ma sere ɔkʋna powu, bɛ ŋwara yɩ bɛ sa Isareli ma Yuda begyu bɔɔ gɩkpa gaanɩ.<verse eid="2CH 35:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 35" />
  <chapter number="36" style="c" sid="2CH 36" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 36:1" />Ɛwʋ gɛ bɛnɩ fɔ bɛ ka Yosiya wobi Yehowahasi bɛ sɩ̀ bugyu Yerusalem anɩ be sere wote gɩsɩrɩ.<verse eid="2CH 36:1" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yuda wogyu Yehowahasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 36:2" />Ɔkʋna gɛtɛ Yehowahasi e di bugyu fɔ, ɛ̀ ba bɩkyan dikpilin. E di bugyu Yerusalem bebon besiyee. <verse eid="2CH 36:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 36:3" />Egyipiti wogyu Neko ɛ tɔ̀là wɔ bugyu e ye Yerusalem anɩ gɛ ɛ nyɩ Yuda e le sɩka-fututu bekotoku akpilin ton (100), fɩya ma sɩka-sɩya kotoku ɛkɩ. <verse eid="2CH 36:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 36:4" />Gɛ Egyipiti wogyu ɛ ka Yehowahasi wonobi Eliyakim ɛ sɩ bugyu ɛ tɛ Yuda ma Yerusalem gɛ e foma Eliyakim diyere ɛ mɛ Yehoyiyakim. Mɔ Egyipiti wogyu Neko ɛ ka Eliyakim wɔdɩrɛ Yehowasi ɛ da Egyipiti.<verse eid="2CH 36:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yuda wogyu Yehoyiyakim</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 36:5" />Ɔkʋna gɛtɛ Yehoyiyakim e di bugyu fɔ, ɛ̀ ba bɩkyan dikpilin ma ton. E di bugyu Yerusalem bɩkyan fwo ɛkɩ. Ɛ mɛ ade-kpen Yahwe, wo Wurubwarɛ bʋnʋn. <verse eid="2CH 36:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 36:6" />Babilon wogyu Nebukadinesa ɛ ta bɩtà ma Yuda gɛ e gye Yehoyiyakim bɩtà, ɛ ka agbarɩgbarɩ ɛ ban wɔ ɛ da Babilon. <verse eid="2CH 36:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 36:7" />Nebukadinesa ɛ nɩ ka anyan powu gɛtɛ ɩ̀ sa Yahwe dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ daanɩ fɔ ɛ da Babilon gɛ ɛ ka yɩ ɛ sɩ wo digyu-kpara daanɩ.<verse eid="2CH 36:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 36:8" />Ade-kurumakyɛɛ gɛtɛ Yehoyiyakim ɛ mɛ wo bugyu buu gedi baanɩ, ade-kyʋnlɛ gɛtɛ ɛ mɛ ma ɛyɩ powu gɛtɛ be we kadama wo koro fɔ, bɛ ŋwara yɩ bɛ sa Isareli begyu-dɩrɛ ma Yuda begyu-dɩrɛ bɔɔ gɩkpa-dɩrɛ fɔ gaanɩ. Gɛ wobi Yehoyiyakim e di bugyu e sere wɔ gɩsɩrɩ.<verse eid="2CH 36:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yuda wogyu-dɩrɛ Yehoyiyakim</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 36:9" />Ɔkʋna gɛtɛ Yehoyiyakin e e di bugyu fɔ, ɛ̀ ba bɩkyan fwo-nɩyɛ. Gɛ e di bugyu Yerusalem bebon besiyee ma awi fwo. Ɛ mɛ ade-kpen Yahwe bʋnʋn. <verse eid="2CH 36:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 36:10" />Ɛsʋn gɛnʋn gɩɩya waanɩ fɔ, egyu Nebukadinesa ɛ sa bɛ ma ka wɔ bɛ ba Babilon fɩya ma anyan gbagba gɛtɛ ɩ̀ sa Yahwe Dikwo-dɩrɛ daanɩ fɔ, gɛ ɛ sɩ̀ Yehoyiyakin wogbete Sedekiya bugyu ɛ tɛ Yuda ma Yerusalem.<verse eid="2CH 36:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yuda wogyu Sedekiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 36:11" />Ɔkʋna gɛtɛ Sedekiya e di bugyu fɔ, ɛ̀ ba bɩkyan dikpilin ma ɛkɩ, gɛ e di bugyu Yerusalem bɩkyan fwo ɛkɩ. <verse eid="2CH 36:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 36:12" />Ɛ mɛ ade-kpen Yahwe, wo Wurubwarɛ bʋnʋn gɛ ɛn warama wo koro tɛ Wurubwarɛ wɔtabʋrʋlɛ Yeremiya gɛtɛ ɛ tabʋrʋ Wurubwarɛ wade fɔ. <verse eid="2CH 36:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 36:13" />Ɛ nɩ tɔ e yela egyu Nebukadinesa wo koro gɛtɛ wʋ yɛ wɔ ɛ kan ntam wo Wurubwarɛ diyere daanɩ. Ɛ mɛ oturu-kɛma gɛ en foma ba Yahwe, Isareli wo Wurubwarɛ fɔ wakʋn. <verse eid="2CH 36:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 36:14" />Gɛ nkele mɔ, Yuda bɛndɩrɛbi, ma gedi gɩɩ bɛtɛlɛ ma bɛnɩ fɔ powu ben di nʋnkwarɩ. Bɛ tɛrɛma bɩfɩɩ gɛtɛ bi silin bɛ bu tuma fɔ baade karan-karan gɛtɛ bʋʋ mɛ fɔ, gɛ wʋ sa Yahwe Dikwo-dɩrɛ gɛtɛ ɛ mɛ fɩrɩnfɩrɩn Yerusalem anɩ fɔ dɩdɩɩ fɔ.<verse eid="2CH 36:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yerusalem gɛnʋ̀n</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 36:15" />Yahwe, bootu ɛbɛ boo Wurubwarɛ, ɛ dama wɔ bɛtabʋrʋlɛ boo koro ɛ tabʋrʋ ɛ tɛ bɛ disere dilen-dilen, yema ee we wɔ bɛnɩ boo gutunkoro ye wɔ gɛsarakʋn. <verse eid="2CH 36:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 36:16" />Mɔ bɛ mʋmwa Wurubwarɛ bɛtabʋrʋlɛ fɔ, bɛ gbɛlɩ wade fɔ gɛ bɛ sa bɛ dɩkpata ka ma ye gɛtɛ Yahwe wowurufa-dɩrɛ wʋ tɔ wɔ bɛnɩ boo koro gɛtɛ ɛkɩlɩn gba ɛn talɩ ye waanɩ. <verse eid="2CH 36:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 36:17" />Okoro Yahwe ɛ yɛ Babilon wogyu ɛ bɛ tà bɛ bɩtà gɛ e wolo bɔɔ bɛsaranyan-bi Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ daanɩ. Gɛ ɛsaranyan-bi oo, ɛsʋgʋgyan oo, ditenikwaa abɛɛ dɩnanɩkwaa oo, en kere bɛ ya. Yahwe e tiri bɛ powu ɛ tɛ Nebukadinesa. <verse eid="2CH 36:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 36:18" />E kpila anyan powu gɛtɛ ɩ̀ sa Wurubwarɛ Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ daanɩ, Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ daanyan gbagba ma egyu ma wɔ bɛndɩrɛbi boo koro gaanyan gbagba powu ɛ da Babilon. <verse eid="2CH 36:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 36:19" />Bɛ sa Yahwe Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ ɔtan, be gbena Yerusalem wɔ ɩpɔrɩ, be kuma agyu-kpara powu gɛ bɛ mɩna gɩnyan-kamasɛ gɛtɛ gì di gɩnyan gbaa fɔ.<verse eid="2CH 36:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 36:20" />Gɛ e gye ɛbɛ gɛtɛ be kuruma gɛ ben wolo bɛ fɔ bɩtà ɛ da Babilon. Gɛ bɛ mɛ bɛsʋmalɛ bɛ tɛ ɛwɔ ma wo bebi ma ye gɛtɛ Perisiya bugyu bu be yela. <verse eid="2CH 36:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 36:21" />Okoro ade gɛtɛ Yahwe ɛ dama wɔtabʋrʋlɛ Yeremiya wo koro ɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt; Gɛtʋnkwaa fɔ, gaà dʋrʋ tuntun bɩkyan akpilin asiyee ma fwo, gɛ gaà tuna gi ye duwi-tunalɛ dii gedi gaanɩ.&gt;&gt; fɔ ɩ ba waanɩ. <verse eid="2CH 36:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 36:22" />Perisiya wogyu Sirusi wo bugyu buu gedi wʋʋ gɩkyan-gyangbasɛlɛ gaanɩ fɔ, Yahwe ɛ yɛ gɛtɛ ade gɛtɛ ɛ dama wɔtabʋrʋlɛ Yeremiya wo koro ɛ dɔ̀ fɔ ɩ ba waanɩ. Ɛ kya Sirusi woturu gɛ ɛ tɛ ose gɛ ɛ dɔ̀ gɛtɛ bàà kalan wʋ kin-kin wo bugyu buu gedikʋn wʋʋkʋn-kamasɛ alan, <verse eid="2CH 36:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 36:23" />&lt;&lt;Perisiya wogyu Sirusi ɛɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt; Yahwe, gatala gii Wurubwarɛ ɛ ka gɛtʋnkwaa gii bugyu powu ɛ tɛ mɩ gɛ e tiri mɩ ɛ sɩ̀ gɛtɛ na sere dikwo-dɩrɛ n tɛ wɔ Yerusalem ma Yuda. Nkele ɛyɩ powu gɛtɛ ì di Wurubwarɛ bɛnɩ fɔ, ɩ san dʋkɔbɛ. Yahwe yii Wurubwarɛ ɛ fɩya ma ɛyɩ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2CH 36:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 36" />
</usx>